     <span>S</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"cosmic\" style=\"--color: #ffa500\" data-text=\"T\">\n                            <span>T</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"cosmic\" style=\"--color: #00d4ff\" data-text=\"A\">\n                            <span>A</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"cosmic\" style=\"--color: #ff4081\" data-text=\"G\">\n                            <span>G</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"cosmic\" style=\"--color: #9c27b0\" data-text=\"E\">\n                            <span>E</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"cosmic\" style=\"--color: #00e676\" data-text=\"S\">\n                            <span>S</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </h1>\n                    <!-- SEO-optimized visible h1 for search engines (screen reader only but indexed) -->\n                    <h1 class=\"sr-only\">Event Stages - Professional Event Staging Services, Stage Rental & Custom Stage\n                        Design | MiHi Entertainment</h1>\n                    <p\n                        class=\"cinematic-subtitle text-sm sm:text-base md:text-lg lg:text-xl xl:text-2xl mb-6 sm:mb-8 md:mb-10 lg:mb-12 max-w-6xl mx-auto font-normal px-2\">\n                        Amplify your message. Captivate your audience. Create experiences that resonate. We\'re your\n                        trusted\n                        partner for <a href=\"../../av-production.html\"\n                            class=\"text-cyan-300 hover:text-cyan-200 underline font-semibold\">AV services</a>, offering\n                        expertly designed event staging solutions including custom stage design, stage rental, and\n                        professional staging that bring your vision to life for corporate events, conferences, weddings,\n                        and performances.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"px-2 hero-buttons-container\">\n                        <span class=\"button--bubble__container\">\n                            <a href=\"../contact-us.html\" class=\"button button--bubble cursor-pointer\"\n                                aria-label=\"Get a quote for event staging services\">\n                                <span>Get A Quote</span>\n                                <span class=\"button-arrow\">→</span>\n                            </a>\n                            <span class=\"button--bubble__effect-container\">\n                                <span class=\"circle top-left\"></span>\n                                <span class=\"circle top-left\"></span>\n                                <span class=\"circle top-left\"></span>\n                                <span class=\"button effect-button\"></span>\n                                <span class=\"circle bottom-right\"></span>\n                                <span class=\"circle bottom-right\"></span>\n                                <span class=\"circle bottom-right\"></span>\n                            </span>\n                        </span>\n                        <button type=\"button\" data-click-to-call data-call-text=\"Contact Us\"\n                            class=\"button button--call cursor-pointer\"\n                            aria-label=\"Contact us about event staging services\">\n                            <span class=\"call-icon\">📞</span>\n                            Contact Us\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Trust Indicators -->\n                    <div\n                        class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4 sm:gap-8 mt-8 sm:mt-12 text-white/70 px-4\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-pink-400 rounded-full\"></div>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium\">Expert Staging Solutions</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-purple-400 rounded-full\"></div>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium\">Custom Design</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-cyan-400 rounded-full\"></div>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium\">Seamless Execution</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- A - Two Column Section -->\n        <section class=\"two-column-section section-padding bg-white stack-animation-wrapper section-a-responsive\"\n            id=\"section-a\" style=\"padding: 3rem 0;\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Service\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\">\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:gap-6 md:gap-8 items-start md:items-center\">\n                    <!-- Left Column -->\n                    <div class=\"left-column order-2 md:order-1\">\n                        <h3 style=\"font-family: \'Azo Sans Uber\', sans-serif; color: #1F1F1F;\">TAKE YOUR EVENT TO THE\n                            NEXT LEVEL WITH</h3>\n                        <h2 style=\"font-family: \'Azo Sans Uber\', sans-serif; font-weight: 200;\"><span\n                                style=\"color: #FF4F4F;\">EVENT</span>\n                            <em style=\"color: #18F1E1; font-weight: 200;\">STAGES</em>\n                        </h2>\n                        <p>MiHi Entertainment provides professional event staging services including custom stage design\n                            and stage rental to help your event stand out and\n                            leave a lasting impression. From elegant stages for keynote speeches to dynamic setups for\n                            live\n                            performances, our team designs and executes staging solutions tailored to your needs for\n                            corporate events, conferences, and weddings.</p>\n                        <p>Our <a href=\"../../av-production.html\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 underline\">AV\n                                services</a> ensure every aspect of your event runs seamlessly. With cutting-edge\n                            equipment\n                            and expert technicians, we deliver event staging that connects with your audience and makes\n                            an\n                            impact. Whether you\'re hosting a <a href=\"../../corporate-events.html\"\n                                class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 underline\">corporate event</a>, gala, or\n                            conference, our stages are built to\n                            impress. Pair our staging with our <a href=\"../audio-services.html\"\n                                class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 underline\">audio services</a> and <a\n                                href=\"../visual-services.html\"\n                                class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 underline\">visual services</a> for complete\n                            event production.</p>\n                        <p>We take a personalized approach to each event, working closely with you to understand your\n                            goals\n                            and venue details. Let MiHi Entertainment bring your event to life with customized event\n                            staging\n                            that blends function, style, and innovation for unforgettable experiences.</p>\n                        <a href=\"../contact-us.html\" class=\"btn-more bubbly-button\"\n                            style=\"font-family: \'Azo Sans Uber\', sans-serif; font-weight: 200;\"\n                            aria-label=\"Contact us about event staging services\">Interested In Hearing More?</a>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Right Column -->\n                    <div class=\"right-column order-1 md:order-2\">\n                        <div id=\"portfolio-gallery\">\n                            <div id=\"portfolio-content\">\n                                <div class=\"portfolio\">\n                                    <img src=\"../../assets/images/stages/w1.png\"\n                                        alt=\"Professional event staging with custom stage design for corporate events and conferences\"\n                                        loading=\"lazy\">\n                                    <div class=\"ombra\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"portfolio\">\n                                    <img src=\"../../assets/images/stages/w2.png\"\n                                        alt=\"Elegant wedding stage rental and staging services for memorable ceremonies\"\n                                        loading=\"lazy\">\n                                    <div class=\"ombra\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"portfolio\">\n                                    <img src=\"../../assets/images/stages/w3.png\"\n                                        alt=\"Dynamic performance staging with custom stage setup for live events\"\n                                        loading=\"lazy\">\n                                    <div class=\"ombra\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"portfolio\">\n                                    <img src=\"../../assets/images/stages/w4.png\"\n                                        alt=\"Professional event staging installation for conferences and corporate events\"\n                                        loading=\"lazy\">\n                                    <div class=\"ombra\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- B - Two Column Section -->\n        <section class=\"two-column-section section-padding bg-white stack-animation-wrapper\" id=\"section-b\"\n            style=\"padding: 3rem 0;\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\">\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:gap-6 md:gap-8 items-start md:items-center\">\n                    <!-- Left Column -->\n                    <div class=\"right-column order-2 md:order-1\">\n                        <!-- Images from Craig Henry\'s Dribbble profile: http://dribbble.com/craighenry -->\n                        <ul class=\"slider\">\n                            <li>\n                                <input type=\"radio\" id=\"slide-b1\" name=\"slide-b\" checked>\n                                <label for=\"slide-b1\" aria-label=\"Conference staging slide 1\"></label>\n                                <img src=\"../../assets/images/stages/e1.jpg\"\n                                    alt=\"Professional conference staging with custom stage design for corporate events\"\n                                    loading=\"lazy\">\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Right Column -->\n                    <div class=\"left-column left-aligned order-1 md:order-2\">\n                        <h2><a href=\"../../corporate-events.html\"><span\n                                    style=\"font-family: \'Azo Sans Uber\', sans-serif; color: #FF4F4F;\">CONFERENCES</span></a>\n                        </h2>\n                        <p>Set the tone, increase audience engagement, and ensure speakers and presentations are\n                            showcased\n                            effectively with our professional <a href=\"../../corporate-events.html\"\n                                class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 underline\">corporate event</a> staging\n                            services, creating a polished and professional atmosphere that leaves a lasting impression.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- C - Two Column Section -->\n        <section class=\"two-column-section section-padding bg-white stack-animation-wrapper\" id=\"section-c\"\n            style=\"padding: 3rem 0;\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\">\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:gap-6 md:gap-8 items-center\">\n                    <!-- Left Column -->\n                    <div class=\"left-column\">\n                        <h2><a href=\"../../wedding.html\"><span\n                                    style=\"font-family: \'Azo Sans Uber\', sans-serif; color: #FF4F4F;\">WEDDINGS</span></a>\n                        </h2>\n                        <p>Create a romantic and refined atmosphere for your <a href=\"../../wedding.html\"\n                                class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 underline\">wedding</a> with a beautifully\n                            designed stage.\n                            Whether it\'s for heartfelt toasts, memorable speeches, or live entertainment, our <a\n                                href=\"../../wedding.html\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 underline\">wedding\n                                staging</a> services ensure\n                            every moment is unforgettable and full of charm, leaving a lasting impression on you and\n                            your\n                            guests.</p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Right Column -->\n                    <div class=\"right-column\">\n                        <!-- Images from Craig Henry\'s Dribbble profile: http://dribbble.com/craighenry -->\n                        <ul class=\"slider\">\n                            <li>\n                                <input type=\"radio\" id=\"slide-c1\" name=\"slide-c\" checked>\n                                <label for=\"slide-c1\" aria-label=\"Wedding staging slide 1\"></label>\n                                <img src=\"../../assets/images/stages/e2.jpg\"\n                                    alt=\"Elegant wedding stage rental and staging for romantic ceremonies and receptions\"\n                                    loading=\"lazy\">\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Email Button -->\n        <section class=\"two-column-section section-padding bg-white stack-animation-wrapper\" id=\"section-email\"\n            style=\"padding: 3rem 0;\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\">\n                <div class=\"email-button-container\"\n                    style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 2rem 0;\">\n                    <button class=\"email-team-button\" aria-label=\"Email our event staging team\"\n                        onclick=\"window.location.href=\'mailto:info@mihientertainment.com\'\">\n                        <span class=\"text\" style=\"font-family: \'Azo Sans Uber\', sans-serif;\">Email Our Team</span>\n                        <span class=\"shimmer\"></span>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- D - Two Column Section -->\n        <section class=\"two-column-section section-padding bg-white stack-animation-wrapper\" id=\"section-d\"\n            style=\"padding: 3rem 0;\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\">\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:gap-6 md:gap-8 items-start md:items-center\">\n                    <!-- Left Column -->\n                    <div class=\"right-column order-2 md:order-1\">\n                        <!-- Images from Craig Henry\'s Dribbble profile: http://dribbble.com/craighenry -->\n                        <ul class=\"slider\">\n                            <li>\n                                <input type=\"radio\" id=\"slide-d1\" name=\"slide-d\" checked>\n                                <label for=\"slide-d1\" aria-label=\"Performance staging slide 1\"></label>\n                                <img src=\"../../assets/images/stages/e3.jpg\"\n                                    alt=\"Dynamic performance staging with custom stage setup and professional staging services\"\n                                    loading=\"lazy\">\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Right Column -->\n                    <div class=\"left-column left-aligned order-1 md:order-2\">\n                        <h2><a href=\"../contact-us.html\"><span\n                                    style=\"font-family: \'Azo Sans Uber\', sans-serif; color: #FF4F4F;\">PERFORMANCES</span></a>\n                        </h2>\n                        <p>Make your event performances shine with our customizable stages. Add branding or <a\n                                href=\"../event-lighting.html\"\n                                class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 underline\">lighting</a> to tie\n                            your event details together and bring your event to life with professional <a\n                                href=\"../contact-us.html\"\n                                class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 underline\">performance staging</a>.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- E - Two Column Section -->\n        <section class=\"two-column-section section-padding bg-white stack-animation-wrapper\" id=\"section-e\"\n            style=\"padding: 3rem 0;margin-bottom: 1rem;\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\">\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:gap-6 md:gap-8 items-center\">\n                    <!-- Left Column -->\n                    <div class=\"left-column\">\n                        <h2 style=\"font-family: \'Azo Sans Uber\', sans-serif; font-weight: 200;\"><span\n                                style=\"color: #FF4F4F;\">EVENT</span>\n                            <em style=\"color: #18F1E1; font-weight: 200;\">PRODUCTION</em>\n                        </h2>\n                        <p>Transform your event with a stage that sets the perfect backdrop for every moment. From\n                            dynamic\n                            presentations to live performances, our stages provide a professional and polished setting\n                            that\n                            ensures all eyes are on your speakers and entertainers, creating an atmosphere that engages\n                            and\n                            captivates your audience. Part of our comprehensive <a href=\"../../av-production.html\"\n                                class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 underline font-semibold\">event production\n                                services</a>.</p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Right Column -->\n                    <div class=\"right-column\">\n                        <!-- Images from Craig Henry\'s Dribbble profile: http://dribbble.com/craighenry -->\n                        <ul class=\"slider\">\n                            <li>\n                                <input type=\"radio\" id=\"slide-e1\" name=\"slide-e\" checked>\n                                <label for=\"slide-e1\" aria-label=\"Event production staging slide 1\"></label>\n                                <img src=\"../../assets/images/stages/e4.jpg\"\n                                    alt=\"Complete event production staging with custom stage design and professional installation\"\n                                    loading=\"lazy\">\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- F - New Section -->\n        <section class=\"two-column-section section-padding bg-white stack-animation-wrapper\" id=\"section-f\"\n            style=\"padding: 0;\">\n            <header class=\"header-design\">\n                <div class=\"listar-map-button\">\n                    <div class=\"listar-map-button-text\" style=\"display: inline-block; opacity: 1;\">\n                        <a href=\"/contact-us.html\" style=\"text-decoration: none; color: inherit; cursor: pointer;\"\n                            aria-label=\"Email our event staging team\">\n                            <span class=\"icon-map2\">\n                                Contact Us Now </span>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"header-design-text\"\n                    style=\"text-align: center; color: #fff; padding: 15px 30px; margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.8; position: relative; z-index: 10; max-width: 800px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), 0 0 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3); letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">\n                    Learn more about our professional event staging services including custom stage design, stage\n                    rental, and staging solutions for your next <a href=\"../../corporate-events.html\"\n                        class=\"text-cyan-300 hover:text-cyan-200 underline\">corporate event</a>, <a\n                        href=\"../../wedding.html\" class=\"text-cyan-300 hover:text-cyan-200 underline\">wedding</a>, <a\n                        href=\"../../holiday-party.html\" class=\"text-cyan-300 hover:text-cyan-200 underline\">holiday\n                        party</a>, conference, or performance. Click the button below to email us and\n                    connect with our expert staging team today.</p>\n                <div class=\"footer-wave\"></div>\n            </header>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n\n    <script src=\"https://code.jquery.com/jquery-3.6.0.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"../../assets/components/navigation.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"../../assets/components/footer.js\"></script>\n    <script>\n        $(document).ready(function () {\n            $(\'.button--bubble\').each(function () {\n                var $circlesTopLeft = $(this).parent().find(\'.circle.top-left\');\n                var $circlesBottomRight = $(this).parent().find(\'.circle.bottom-right\');\n\n                var tl = gsap.timeline();\n                var tl2 = gsap.timeline();\n\n                var btTl = gsap.timeline({ paused: true });\n\n                tl.to($circlesTopLeft, {\n                    duration: 1.2,\n                    x: -25,\n                    y: -25,\n                    scaleY: 2,\n                    ease: \"power2.out\"\n                });\n                tl.to($circlesTopLeft.eq(0), {\n                    duration: 0.1,\n                    scale: 0.2,\n                    x: \"+=6\",\n                    y: \"-=2\"\n                });\n                tl.to($circlesTopLeft.eq(1), {\n                    duration: 0.1,\n                    scaleX: 1,\n                    scaleY: 0.8,\n                    x: \"-=10\",\n                    y: \"-=7\"\n                }, \"-=0.1\");\n                tl.to($circlesTopLeft.eq(2), {\n                    duration: 0.1,\n                    scale: 0.2,\n                    x: \"-=15\",\n                    y: \"+=6\"\n                }, \"-=0.1\");\n                tl.to($circlesTopLeft.eq(0), {\n                    duration: 1,\n                    scale: 0,\n                    x: \"-=5\",\n                    y: \"-=15\",\n                    opacity: 0\n                });\n                tl.to($circlesTopLeft.eq(1), {\n                    duration: 1,\n                    scaleX: 0.4,\n                    scaleY: 0.4,\n                    x: \"-=10\",\n                    y: \"-=10\",\n                    opacity: 0\n                }, \"-=1\");\n                tl.to($circlesTopLeft.eq(2), {\n                    duration: 1,\n                    scale: 0,\n                    x: \"-=15\",\n                    y: \"+=5\",\n                    opacity: 0\n                }, \"-=1\");\n\n                var tlBt1 = gsap.timeline();\n                var tlBt2 = gsap.timeline();\n\n                tlBt1.set($circlesTopLeft, { x: 0, y: 0, rotation: -45 });\n                tlBt1.add(tl);\n\n                tl2.set($circlesBottomRight, { x: 0, y: 0 });\n                tl2.to($circlesBottomRight, {\n                    duration: 1.1,\n                    x: 30,\n                    y: 30,\n                    ease: \"power2.out\"\n                });\n                tl2.to($circlesBottomRight.eq(0), {\n                    duration: 0.1,\n                    scale: 0.2,\n                    x: \"-=6\",\n                    y: \"+=3\"\n                });\n                tl2.to($circlesBottomRight.eq(1), {\n                    duration: 0.1,\n                    scale: 0.8,\n                    x: \"+=7\",\n                    y: \"+=3\"\n                }, \"-=0.1\");\n                tl2.to($circlesBottomRight.eq(2), {\n                    duration: 0.1,\n                    scale: 0.2,\n                    x: \"+=15\",\n                    y: \"-=6\"\n                }, \"-=0.2\");\n                tl2.to($circlesBottomRight.eq(0), {\n                    duration: 1,\n                    scale: 0,\n                    x: \"+=5\",\n                    y: \"+=15\",\n                    opacity: 0\n                });\n                tl2.to($circlesBottomRight.eq(1), {\n                    duration: 1,\n                    scale: 0.4,\n                    x: \"+=7\",\n                    y: \"+=7\",\n                    opacity: 0\n                }, \"-=1\");\n                tl2.to($circlesBottomRight.eq(2), {\n                    duration: 1,\n                    scale: 0,\n                    x: \"+=15\",\n                    y: \"-=5\",\n                    opacity: 0\n                }, \"-=1\");\n\n                tlBt2.set($circlesBottomRight, { x: 0, y: 0, rotation: 45 });\n                tlBt2.add(tl2);\n\n                btTl.add(tlBt1);\n                btTl.to($(this).parent().find(\'.button.effect-button\'), {\n                    duration: 0.8,\n                    scaleY: 1.1\n                }, 0.1);\n                btTl.add(tlBt2, 0.2);\n                btTl.to($(this).parent().find(\'.button.effect-button\'), {\n                    duration: 1.8,\n                    scale: 1,\n                    ease: \"elastic.out(1.2, 0.4)\"\n                }, 1.2);\n\n                btTl.timeScale(2.6);\n\n                $(this).on(\'mouseover\', function () {\n                    btTl.restart();\n                });\n            });\n\n            // Portfolio Gallery Effect\n            $(\'#portfolio-content .portfolio\').each(function (index) {\n                $(this).attr(\'id\', \'img\' + (index + 1));\n            });\n\n            $(\'#portfolio-content .portfolio\').each(function () {\n                $(\'#portfolio-navi\').append(\'<div class=\"portfolio-circle\"></div>\');\n            });\n\n            $(\'.portfolio-circle\').each(function (index) {\n                $(this).attr(\'id\', \'circle\' + (index + 1));\n            });\n\n            $(\'#portfolio-content .portfolio\').click(function () {\n                if ($(this).hasClass(\'opened\')) {\n                    $(this).removeClass(\'opened\');\n                    $(\"#portfolio-content .portfolio\").fadeIn(\"fast\");\n                    $(this).find(\'.ombra\').fadeOut();\n                    $(\"#portfolio-navi div\").removeClass(\"activenav\");\n                } else {\n                    var indexi = $(\"#portfolio-content .portfolio\").index(this) + 1;\n                    $(this).addClass(\'opened\');\n                    $(\"#portfolio-content .portfolio\").not(this).fadeOut(\"fast\");\n                    $(this).find(\'.ombra\').fadeIn();\n                    $(\"#circle\" + indexi).addClass(\'activenav\');\n                }\n            });\n\n            // Navigation buttons\n            $(\"#portfolio-navi div\").click(function () {\n                if ($(this).hasClass(\"activenav\")) {\n                    return false;\n                }\n\n                $(\"#portfolio-navi div\").removeClass(\"activenav\");\n                $(\"#portfolio-content .portfolio\").removeClass(\'opened\');\n                $(\"#portfolio-content .portfolio\").show();\n                $(\'.ombra\').hide();\n\n                var index = $(\"#portfolio-navi div\").index(this) + 1;\n                $(\"#img\" + index).addClass(\'opened\');\n                $(\"#portfolio-content .portfolio\").not(\"#img\" + index).fadeOut(\"fast\");\n                $(\"#img\" + index).find(\'.ombra\').fadeIn();\n\n                $(this).addClass(\"activenav\");\n            });\n\n            // Trigger gallery entrance animation when scrolling to section A\n            const sectionA = document.querySelector(\'#section-a\');\n            const portfolioContent = document.querySelector(\'#portfolio-content\');\n\n            if (sectionA && portfolioContent) {\n                const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n                    entries.forEach(entry => {\n                        if (entry.isIntersecting && !portfolioContent.classList.contains(\'animate-comein\')) {\n                            portfolioContent.classList.add(\'animate-comein\');\n                        }\n                    });\n                }, {\n                    threshold: 0.2 // Trigger when 20% of section A is visible\n                });\n\n                observer.observe(sectionA);\n            }\n\n            // Trigger slider entrance animation when scrolling to section B\n            const sectionB = document.querySelector(\'#section-b\');\n            const sliderB = document.querySelector(\'#section-b .slider\');\n\n            if (sectionB && sliderB) {\n                // Check if section is already visible on page load\n                const rectB = sectionB.getBoundingClientRect();\n                const isVisibleB = rectB.top < window.innerHeight && rectB.bottom > 0;\n                if (isVisibleB && !sliderB.classList.contains(\'animate-comein\')) {\n                    sliderB.classList.add(\'animate-comein\');\n                }\n\n                const observerB = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n                    entries.forEach(entry => {\n                        if (entry.isIntersecting && !sliderB.classList.contains(\'animate-comein\')) {\n                            sliderB.classList.add(\'animate-comein\');\n                        }\n                    });\n                }, {\n                    threshold: 0.2 // Trigger when 20% of section B is visible\n                });\n\n                observerB.observe(sectionB);\n            }\n\n            // Trigger slider entrance animation when scrolling to section C\n            const sectionC = document.querySelector(\'#section-c\');\n            const sliderC = document.querySelector(\'#section-c .slider\');\n\n            if (sectionC && sliderC) {\n                // Check if section is already visible on page load\n                const rect = sectionC.getBoundingClientRect();\n                const isVisible = rect.top < window.innerHeight && rect.bottom > 0;\n                if (isVisible && !sliderC.classList.contains(\'animate-comein\')) {\n                    sliderC.classList.add(\'animate-comein\');\n                }\n\n                const observerC = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n                    entries.forEach(entry => {\n                        if (entry.isIntersecting && !sliderC.classList.contains(\'animate-comein\')) {\n                            sliderC.classList.add(\'animate-comein\');\n                        }\n                    });\n                }, {\n                    threshold: 0.2 // Trigger when 20% of section C is visible\n                });\n\n                observerC.observe(sectionC);\n            }\n\n            // Trigger slider entrance animation when scrolling to section D\n            const sectionD = document.querySelector(\'#section-d\');\n            const sliderD = document.querySelector(\'#section-d .slider\');\n\n            if (sectionD && sliderD) {\n                // Check if section is already visible on page load\n                const rectD = sectionD.getBoundingClientRect();\n                const isVisibleD = rectD.top < window.innerHeight && rectD.bottom > 0;\n                if (isVisibleD && !sliderD.classList.contains(\'animate-comein\')) {\n                    sliderD.classList.add(\'animate-comein\');\n                }\n\n                const observerD = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n                    entries.forEach(entry => {\n                        if (entry.isIntersecting && !sliderD.classList.contains(\'animate-comein\')) {\n                            sliderD.classList.add(\'animate-comein\');\n                        }\n                    });\n                }, {\n                    threshold: 0.2 // Trigger when 20% of section D is visible\n                });\n\n                observerD.observe(sectionD);\n            }\n\n            // Trigger slider entrance animation when scrolling to section E\n            const sectionE = document.querySelector(\'#section-e\');\n            const sliderE = document.querySelector(\'#section-e .slider\');\n\n            if (sectionE && sliderE) {\n                // Check if section is already visible on page load\n                const rectE = sectionE.getBoundingClientRect();\n                const isVisibleE = rectE.top < window.innerHeight && rectE.bottom > 0;\n                if (isVisibleE && !sliderE.classList.contains(\'animate-comein\')) {\n                    sliderE.classList.add(\'animate-comein\');\n                }\n\n                const observerE = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n                    entries.forEach(entry => {\n                        if (entry.isIntersecting && !sliderE.classList.contains(\'animate-comein\')) {\n                            sliderE.classList.add(\'animate-comein\');\n                        }\n                    });\n                }, {\n                    threshold: 0.2 // Trigger when 20% of section E is visible\n                });\n\n                observerE.observe(sectionE);\n            }\n\n            // Bubbly Button Animation\n            var animateButton = function (e) {\n                var target = e.target;\n                var isLink = target.tagName === \'A\' && target.href;\n\n                if (isLink) {\n                    e.preventDefault();\n                    //reset animation\n                    target.classList.remove(\'animate\');\n\n                    target.classList.add(\'animate\');\n                    setTimeout(function () {\n                        target.classList.remove(\'animate\');\n                        // Navigate after animation completes\n                        window.location.href = target.href;\n                    }, 700);\n                } else {\n                    e.preventDefault();\n                    //reset animation\n                    target.classList.remove(\'animate\');\n\n                    target.classList.add(\'animate\');\n                    setTimeout(function () {\n                        target.classList.remove(\'animate\');\n                    }, 700);\n                }\n            };\n\n            var bubblyButtons = document.getElementsByClassName(\"bubbly-button\");\n\n            for (var i = 0; i < bubblyButtons.length; i++) {\n                bubblyButtons[i].addEventListener(\'click\', animateButton, false);\n            }\n\n        });\n    </script>\n    <!-- Load Back to Top Component -->\n    <script src=\"../../assets/components/back-to-top.js\"></script>\n\n</body>', NULL, 'published', NULL, '2025-12-14 00:30:10', '2025-12-14 00:30:10');
INSERT INTO `pages` (`id`, `title`, `slug`, `content_html`, `custom_css`, `status`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(8, 'Visual Services', 'av-services-visual-services', '<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\n    <!-- Primary Meta Tags -->\n    <title>Visual Services | LED Walls, Video Mapping & AV Production | MiHi</title>\n    <meta name=\"title\" content=\"Visual Services | LED Walls, Video Mapping & AV Production | MiHi\">\n    <meta name=\"description\"\n        content=\"Professional visual services: LED walls, video mapping, projection design & AV production for corporate events, concerts, galas & trade shows. Expert visual solutions nationwide.\">\n    <meta name=\"keywords\"\n        content=\"visual services, AV production, LED walls, video mapping, projection mapping, event lighting, video production, event services, LED displays, lighting design, visual production, corporate events, trade shows, media production, immersive visuals\">\n    <meta name=\"author\" content=\"MiHi Entertainment\">\n    <meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\">\n    <meta name=\"language\" content=\"English\">\n    <meta name=\"revisit-after\" content=\"7 days\">\n    <meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#FF4F4F\">\n    <meta name=\"format-detection\" content=\"telephone=yes\">\n    <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.mihientertainment.com/av-services/visual-services.html\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n\n    <!-- Additional SEO Meta Tags -->\n    <meta name=\"geo.region\" content=\"US\">\n    <meta name=\"geo.placename\" content=\"United States\">\n    <meta name=\"ICBM\" content=\"39.8283, -98.5795\">\n\n    <!-- Open Graph / Facebook -->\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\">\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.mihientertainment.com/av-services/visual-services.html\">\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Visual Services & AV Production | LED Walls, Video Mapping | MiHi Entertainment\">\n    <meta property=\"og:description\"\n        content=\"Professional visual services and AV production for events. LED displays, video mapping, projection design, and immersive visual experiences.\">\n    <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.mihientertainment.com/assets/images/visuals/hero.jpg\">\n    <meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\">\n    <meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\">\n    <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"MiHi Entertainment\">\n    <meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\">\n\n    <!-- Twitter -->\n    <meta property=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n    <meta property=\"twitter:url\" content=\"https://www.mihientertainment.com/av-services/visual-services.html\">\n    <meta property=\"twitter:title\"\n        content=\"Visual Services & AV Production | LED Walls, Video Mapping | MiHi Entertainment\">\n    <meta property=\"twitter:description\"\n        content=\"Professional visual services and AV production for events. LED displays, video mapping, projection design, and immersive visual experiences.\">\n    <meta property=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://www.mihientertainment.com/assets/images/visuals/hero.jpg\">\n\n    <!-- Structured Data - Service -->\n    <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n    {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"Service\",\n      \"serviceType\": \"Visual Services & AV Production\",\n      \"name\": \"Visual Services\",\n      \"description\": \"Professional visual services and AV production for events. LED displays, video mapping, projection design, lighting production, and immersive visual experiences for conferences, galas, concerts, and brand activations.\",\n      \"provider\": {\n        \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\",\n        \"@id\": \"https://www.mihientertainment.com/#organization\",\n        \"name\": \"MiHi Entertainment\",\n        \"url\": \"https://www.mihientertainment.com\",\n        \"description\": \"Professional event visual services and AV production company specializing in LED walls, video mapping, projection design, and visual production for events nationwide.\",\n        \"foundingDate\": \"2010\",\n        \"numberOfEmployees\": {\n          \"@type\": \"QuantitativeValue\",\n          \"value\": \"50-200\"\n        },\n        \"priceRange\": \"$$-$$$\"\n      },\n      \"serviceArea\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Country\",\n        \"name\": \"United States\"\n      },\n      \"areaServed\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Country\",\n        \"name\": \"United States\"\n      },\n      \"audience\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Audience\",\n        \"audienceType\": \"Event Planners, Corporate Event Organizers, Wedding Planners, Concert Producers, Brand Activation Managers, Trade Show Organizers\"\n      },\n      \"hasOfferCatalog\": {\n        \"@type\": \"OfferCatalog\",\n        \"name\": \"Visual Services\",\n        \"itemListElement\": [\n          {\n            \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n            \"itemOffered\": {\n              \"@type\": \"Service\",\n              \"name\": \"LED Display Walls\",\n              \"description\": \"High-definition LED walls and screens for events\"\n            }\n          },\n          {\n            \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n            \"itemOffered\": {\n              \"@type\": \"Service\",\n              \"name\": \"Video Mapping\",\n              \"description\": \"Projection mapping and immersive visual experiences\"\n            }\n          },\n          {\n            \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n            \"itemOffered\": {\n              \"@type\": \"Service\",\n              \"name\": \"Event Lighting Design\",\n              \"description\": \"Professional lighting production for events\"\n            }\n          },\n          {\n            \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n            \"itemOffered\": {\n              \"@type\": \"Service\",\n              \"name\": \"Visual Production Services\",\n              \"description\": \"Complete visual production packages for conferences, galas, concerts, and brand activations\"\n            }\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n    </script>\n\n    <!-- Structured Data - BreadcrumbList -->\n    <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n    {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\",\n      \"itemListElement\": [\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n          \"position\": 1,\n          \"name\": \"Home\",\n          \"item\": \"https://www.mihientertainment.com\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n          \"position\": 2,\n          \"name\": \"AV Services\",\n          \"item\": \"https://www.mihientertainment.com/av-production.html\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n          \"position\": 3,\n          \"name\": \"Visual Services\",\n          \"item\": \"https://www.mihientertainment.com/av-services/visual-services.html\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n    </script>\n\n    <!-- Structured Data - Organization -->\n    <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n    {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n      \"name\": \"MiHi Entertainment\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.mihientertainment.com\",\n      \"logo\": \"https://www.mihientertainment.com/assets/images/logo.png\",\n      \"description\": \"MiHi Entertainment provides professional visual services, LED walls, video mapping, projection design, and AV production for corporate events, concerts, galas, and trade shows.\",\n      \"sameAs\": [\n        \"https://www.facebook.com/mihientertainment\",\n        \"https://www.instagram.com/mihientertainment\",\n        \"https://www.linkedin.com/company/mihientertainment\"\n      ],\n      \"contactPoint\": {\n        \"@type\": \"ContactPoint\",\n        \"telephone\": \"+1-XXX-XXX-XXXX\",\n        \"contactType\": \"Customer Service\",\n        \"email\": \"info@mihientertainment.com\",\n        \"availableLanguage\": \"English\"\n      },\n      \"address\": {\n        \"@type\": \"PostalAddress\",\n        \"addressCountry\": \"US\"\n      },\n      \"areaServed\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Country\",\n        \"name\": \"United States\"\n      }\n    }\n    </script>\n\n    <!-- Structured Data - WebPage -->\n    <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n    {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"WebPage\",\n      \"name\": \"Visual Services | LED Walls, Video Mapping & AV Production\",\n      \"description\": \"Professional visual services: LED walls, video mapping, projection design & AV production for corporate events, concerts, galas & trade shows. Expert visual solutions nationwide.\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.mihientertainment.com/av-services/visual-services.html\",\n      \"inLanguage\": \"en-US\",\n      \"isPartOf\": {\n        \"@type\": \"WebSite\",\n        \"name\": \"MiHi Entertainment\",\n        \"url\": \"https://www.mihientertainment.com\"\n      },\n      \"primaryImageOfPage\": {\n        \"@type\": \"ImageObject\",\n        \"url\": \"https://www.mihientertainment.com/assets/images/visuals/hero.jpg\",\n        \"width\": 1200,\n        \"height\": 630\n      },\n      \"breadcrumb\": {\n        \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\",\n        \"itemListElement\": [\n          {\n            \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n            \"position\": 1,\n            \"name\": \"Home\",\n            \"item\": \"https://www.mihientertainment.com\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n            \"position\": 2,\n            \"name\": \"AV Services\",\n            \"item\": \"https://www.mihientertainment.com/av-production.html\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n            \"position\": 3,\n            \"name\": \"Visual Services\",\n            \"item\": \"https://www.mihientertainment.com/av-services/visual-services.html\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"mainEntity\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Service\",\n        \"serviceType\": \"Visual Services & AV Production\",\n        \"provider\": {\n          \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\",\n          \"name\": \"MiHi Entertainment\"\n        }\n      }\n    }\n    </script>\n\n    <!-- Structured Data - FAQPage (for Google Featured Snippets) -->\n    <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n    {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n      \"mainEntity\": [\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What visual services do you offer for events?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"We provide comprehensive visual services including LED display walls, video mapping, projection mapping, projection design, lighting production, visual production, and immersive visual experiences for conferences, corporate events, concerts, galas, trade shows, and brand activations.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What is video mapping or projection mapping?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"Video mapping, also known as projection mapping, is a projection technique used to turn objects into display surfaces for video projection. We create immersive visual experiences by projecting video content onto buildings, stages, or any surface, transforming spaces into dynamic visual canvases for events.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"Do you provide LED wall rentals for events?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"Yes, we offer professional LED wall rentals and LED display screens in various sizes and resolutions. Our LED walls provide high-definition video displays perfect for presentations, branding, live video feeds, and visual effects at corporate events, concerts, trade shows, and conferences.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What visual services are available for corporate events and trade shows?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"Our visual services for corporate events and trade shows include LED display walls for presentations and branding, video mapping for immersive experiences, projection design for custom visuals, professional lighting production, and complete visual production packages tailored to showcase your brand effectively.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"Do you combine visual services with lighting and audio?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"Yes, we provide complete AV production solutions combining our visual services (LED walls, video mapping) with professional event lighting and audio services for fully integrated experiences. Our team coordinates all elements to create seamless, immersive events.\"\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n    </script>\n\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <!-- Brand Guide Typography: Azo Sans Font Family -->\n    <style>\n        /* Azo Sans Font Face Declarations */\n        @font-face {\n            font-family: \'Azo Sans\';\n            src: url(\'../../assets/fonts/AzoSans-Regular.woff2\') format(\'woff2\'),\n                url(\'../../assets/fonts/AzoSans-Regular.woff\') format(\'woff\');\n            font-weight: 400;\n            font-style: normal;\n            font-display: swap;\n        }\n\n        @font-face {\n            font-family: \'Azo Sans Uber\';\n            src: url(\'../../assets/fonts/AzoSansUber-Regular.woff2\') format(\'woff2\'),\n                url(\'../../assets/fonts/AzoSansUber-Regular.woff\') format(\'woff\');\n            font-weight: 400;\n            font-style: normal;\n            font-display: swap;\n        }\n\n        * {\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n\n        html {\n            overflow-x: hidden;\n            width: 100%;\n            scroll-behavior: smooth;\n        }\n\n        /* Brand Guide: Body Text - Azo Sans Uber */\n        body {\n            font-family: \'Azo Sans Uber\', sans-serif;\n            color: #1F1F1F;\n            overflow-x: hidden;\n            width: 100%;\n            position: relative;\n            background: #ffffff;\n        }\n\n        p {\n            font-family: \'Azo Sans Uber\', sans-serif;\n            color: #1F1F1F;\n        }\n\n        /* Screen reader only - for SEO purposes */\n        .sr-only {\n            position: absolute;\n            width: 1px;\n            height: 1px;\n            padding: 0;\n            margin: -1px;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);\n            white-space: nowrap;\n            border-width: 0;\n        }\n\n        /* Brand Guide: Headers - Azo Sans Uber (Uppercase) */\n        h1,\n        h2,\n        h3,\n        h4,\n        h5,\n        h6 {\n            font-family: \'Azo Sans Uber\', sans-serif;\n            font-weight: 400;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n            line-height: 1.2;\n            color: #FF4F4F;\n            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n            -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;\n        }\n\n        h1.av-title {\n            font-family: \'Azo Sans Uber\', sans-serif !important;\n            font-weight: 400;\n            letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            color: #FF4F4F;\n        }\n\n        /* Spotlight Effect for A/V PRODUCTION */\n        h3.av-title {\n            font-family: \'Azo Sans Uber\', sans-serif !important;\n            font-weight: 400;\n            font-size: 5rem !important;\n            letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            position: relative;\n            background: transparent;\n            color: #FF4F4F;\n            text-align: center;\n            display: inline-block;\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 640px) {\n            h3.av-title {\n                font-size: 1rem !important;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 799px) {\n            h3.av-title {\n                font-size: 1.1rem !important;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (min-width: 800px) {\n            h3.av-title {\n                font-size: 1.25rem !important;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (min-width: 990px) {\n            h3.av-title {\n                font-size: 2rem !important;\n            }\n        }\n\n        h3.av-title:before {\n            content: attr(data-text);\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            background: linear-gradient(#FF4F4F, #18F1E1, #FF4F4F);\n            -webkit-background-clip: text;\n            background-clip: text;\n            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n            color: transparent;\n            background-size: 100% 90%;\n            line-height: inherit;\n            clip-path: ellipse(100px 100px at -2.54% -9.25%);\n            -webkit-clip-path: ellipse(100px 100px at -2.54% -9.25%);\n            animation: swing 5s infinite;\n            animation-direction: alternate;\n            pointer-events: none;\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes swing {\n            0% {\n                -webkit-clip-path: ellipse(100px 100px at -2.54% -9.25%);\n                clip-path: ellipse(100px 100px at -2.54% -9.25%);\n            }\n\n            50% {\n                -webkit-clip-path: ellipse(100px 100px at 49.66% 64.36%);\n                clip-path: ellipse(100px 100px at 49.66% 64.36%);\n            }\n\n            100% {\n                -webkit-clip-path: ellipse(100px 100px at 102.62% -1.61%);\n                clip-path: ellipse(100px 100px at 102.62% -1.61%);\n            }\n        }\n\n        /* Monitor Effect for Paragraph */\n        .monitor-table {\n            width: 100%;\n            max-width: 790px;\n            height: 90px;\n            margin: 0.75rem auto;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f8f9fa 0%, #e9ecef 100%);\n            border-radius: 5px;\n            padding: 4px;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1),\n                inset 0 1px 2px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\n        }\n\n        .monitor-wrapper {\n            background: #1F1F1F;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 82px;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n            box-shadow: 0px 2px 2px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1),\n                inset 0 0 20px rgba(255, 79, 79, 0.05);\n            padding: 2px;\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .monitor-wrapper::before {\n            content: \'\';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            bottom: 0;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n            box-shadow: inset 0 0 30px rgba(24, 241, 225, 0.1),\n                inset 0 0 60px rgba(255, 79, 79, 0.05);\n            pointer-events: none;\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n\n        .monitor {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 78px;\n            background: #1F1F1F;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            white-space: nowrap;\n            box-shadow: inset 0px 5px 10px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1),\n                inset 0 0 20px rgba(255, 79, 79, 0.05);\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .monitor::after {\n            content: \'\';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            bottom: 0;\n            background: repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,\n                    rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15) 0px,\n                    transparent 1px,\n                    transparent 2px,\n                    rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15) 3px);\n            pointer-events: none;\n            z-index: 2;\n            opacity: 0.5;\n        }\n\n        .monitor p {\n            font-family: \'Azo Sans Uber\', sans-serif;\n            font-size: 2rem;\n            position: absolute;\n            display: inline-block;\n            animation: scrollText 40s infinite linear;\n            color: #18F1E1;\n            text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(24, 241, 225, 0.5),\n                0 0 20px rgba(24, 241, 225, 0.3),\n                0 0 30px rgba(24, 241, 225, 0.2);\n            white-space: nowrap;\n            padding: 0;\n            margin: 0;\n            line-height: 1;\n            z-index: 1;\n            width: max-content;\n            top: 50%;\n            margin-top: -1rem;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes scrollText {\n            0% {\n                left: 100%;\n            }\n\n            100% {\n                left: -200%;\n            }\n        }\n\n        /* Responsive adjustments */\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            .monitor-table {\n                height: 75px;\n                max-width: 95%;\n                margin: 0.5rem auto;\n                padding: 3px;\n            }\n\n            .monitor-wrapper {\n                height: 69px;\n                padding: 2px;\n            }\n\n            .monitor {\n                height: 65px;\n            }\n\n            .monitor p {\n                font-size: 1.5rem;\n                margin-top: -0.75rem;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 480px) {\n            .monitor-table {\n                height: 65px;\n                margin: 0.5rem auto;\n                padding: 3px;\n            }\n\n            .monitor-wrapper {\n                height: 59px;\n                padding: 2px;\n            }\n\n            .monitor {\n                height: 55px;\n            }\n\n            .monitor p {\n                font-size: 1rem;\n                margin-top: -0.5rem;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 375px) {\n            .monitor-table {\n                height: 60px;\n                margin: 0.4rem auto;\n            }\n\n            .monitor-wrapper {\n                height: 54px;\n            }\n\n            .monitor {\n                height: 50px;\n            }\n\n            .monitor p {\n                font-size: 0.9rem;\n                margin-top: -0.45rem;\n            }\n        }\n\n        /* Brand Guide: CTAs use Coral (#FF4F4F) */\n        .btn-primary {\n            background: #FF4F4F;\n            color: #ffffff;\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n        }\n\n        .btn-primary:hover {\n            background: #e63939;\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(255, 79, 79, 0.4);\n        }\n\n        /* Super Button Effect - Brand Theme */\n        .super-button {\n            position: relative;\n            display: inline-flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            gap: 12px;\n            padding: 14px 28px;\n            background: #18F1E1;\n            border: 2px solid rgba(24, 241, 225, 0.3);\n            border-radius: 100px;\n            color: #ffffff;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            transition: all 0.4s ease-in-out;\n            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(24, 241, 225, 0.15);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\n            z-index: 1;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            margin-top: 3rem;\n        }\n\n        /* Remove margin-top when button is in a flex container */\n        .flex .super-button {\n            margin-top: 0;\n        }\n\n        .super-button::before {\n            content: \"\";\n            position: absolute;\n            top: -50%;\n            left: -50%;\n            width: 200%;\n            height: 200%;\n            background: conic-gradient(from 0deg, #18F1E1, #12C4B8, #18F1E1, #12C4B8);\n            animation: rotateButton 4s linear infinite;\n            z-index: -2;\n        }\n\n        .super-button::after {\n            content: \"\";\n            position: absolute;\n            inset: 2px;\n            background: #18F1E1;\n            border-radius: inherit;\n            z-index: -1;\n        }\n\n        .super-button:hover {\n            transform: scale(1.05);\n            box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(24, 241, 225, 0.3),\n                0 0 60px rgba(24, 241, 225, 0.2);\n            border-color: rgba(24, 241, 225, 0.5);\n            background: #12C4B8;\n        }\n\n        .super-button:hover .arrow {\n            transform: translateX(6px);\n        }\n\n        .super-button:hover .arrow svg[viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"] path:first-child {\n            animation: phonePulse 0.6s ease-in-out;\n        }\n\n        .super-button .arrow {\n            width: 22px;\n            height: 22px;\n            transition: transform 0.3s ease-in-out;\n            color: #ffffff;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes phonePulse {\n\n            0%,\n            100% {\n                transform: scale(1);\n            }\n\n            50% {\n                transform: scale(1.1) rotate(5deg);\n            }\n        }\n\n        .super-button .arrow svg {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            fill: currentColor;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes rotateButton {\n            0% {\n                transform: rotate(0deg);\n            }\n\n            100% {\n                transform: rotate(360deg);\n            }\n        }\n\n        /* Get Your Quote button - Coral variant */\n        button[data-click-to-call].super-button {\n            background: #FF4F4F;\n            border: 2px solid rgba(255, 79, 79, 0.3);\n            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 79, 79, 0.15);\n        }\n\n        button[data-click-to-call].super-button::before {\n            background: conic-gradient(from 0deg, #FF4F4F, #e63939, #FF4F4F, #e63939);\n        }\n\n        button[data-click-to-call].super-button::after {\n            background: #FF4F4F;\n        }\n\n        button[data-click-to-call].super-button:hover {\n            box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(255, 79, 79, 0.3),\n                0 0 60px rgba(255, 79, 79, 0.2);\n            border-color: rgba(255, 79, 79, 0.5);\n            background: #e63939;\n        }\n\n        /* Contact Us button - Aqua text color */\n        a.super-button {\n            color: #1F1F1F;\n        }\n\n        a.super-button .arrow {\n            color: #1F1F1F;\n        }\n\n        .section-padding {\n            padding: 5rem 0;\n        }\n\n        .hero-gradient {\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75) 0%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75) 100%);\n        }\n\n        /* Animated Text Effect - Contact Us Now */\n        .animated-text-container {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: auto;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            margin: 1rem 0;\n        }\n\n        .animated-text-flex {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-wrap: nowrap;\n            justify-content: center;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 60px;\n        }\n\n        .animated-text-col {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            flex-wrap: nowrap;\n            justify-content: center;\n            height: 100%;\n        }\n\n        .animated-text-col-7 {\n            width: calc(100% / 7);\n        }\n\n        .animated-text-col-5 {\n            width: calc(100% / 5);\n            top: -1px;\n            height: calc(100% + 1px);\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .animated-centerize {\n            text-align: center;\n            display: grid;\n            justify-content: center;\n            align-content: center;\n            font-family: \'Azo Sans Uber\', sans-serif;\n            font-weight: 400;\n            font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 2vw, 1.3rem);\n            color: #1F1F1F;\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            .animated-text-container {\n                margin: 0.75rem 0;\n            }\n\n            .animated-text-flex {\n                height: 50px;\n            }\n\n            .animated-centerize {\n                font-size: clamp(0.75rem, 3vw, 1rem);\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 480px) {\n            .animated-text-flex {\n                height: 45px;\n            }\n\n            .animated-centerize {\n                font-size: clamp(0.65rem, 3.5vw, 0.9rem);\n            }\n        }\n\n        .animated-black {\n            color: #1F1F1F;\n            background: #f8f9fa;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: calc(100% / 3);\n        }\n\n        .animated-black-2 {\n            color: #1F1F1F;\n            background: #e9ecef;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: calc(100% / 3);\n        }\n\n        .animated-bg-primary {\n            color: #ffffff;\n            background: #FF4F4F;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: calc(100% / 3);\n        }\n\n        .animated-bg-secondary {\n            background: #18F1E1;\n            color: #1F1F1F;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: calc(100% / 3);\n        }\n\n        .animated-growup {\n            animation: animated-growup 1s infinite alternate;\n        }\n\n        .animated-scaleme {\n            animation: animated-scaleme 1s infinite alternate;\n        }\n\n        .animated-delay-1 {\n            animation-delay: 0.1s;\n        }\n\n        .animated-delay-2 {\n            animation-delay: 0.2s;\n        }\n\n        .animated-delay-3 {\n            animation-delay: 0.3s;\n        }\n\n        .animated-delay-4 {\n            animation-delay: 0.4s;\n        }\n\n        .animated-delay-5 {\n            animation-delay: 0.5s;\n        }\n\n        .animated-delay-6 {\n            animation-delay: 0.6s;\n        }\n\n        .animated-delay-7 {\n            animation-delay: 0.7s;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes animated-growup {\n            from {\n                height: calc(100% / 3);\n            }\n\n            to {\n                height: calc(100% / 1.5);\n            }\n        }\n\n        @keyframes animated-scaleme {\n            from {\n                transform: scale(1);\n            }\n\n            to {\n                transform: scale(1.5);\n                text-shadow: 0px 2px 4px hsl(0 0% 0% / 0.5);\n            }\n        }\n\n        /* Interactive Brochure Section Styles - Brand Theme */\n        .brochure-section {\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1F1F1F 0%, #2a2a2a 50%, #1F1F1F 100%);\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            font-family: \'Azo Sans Uber\', sans-serif;\n            min-height: 92vh;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            padding-top: 0;\n            padding-bottom: 0;\n        }\n\n        .brochure-section::before {\n            content: \'\';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            bottom: 0;\n            background: radial-gradient(circle at 20% 50%, rgba(255, 79, 79, 0.15) 0%, transparent 50%),\n                radial-gradient(circle at 80% 50%, rgba(24, 241, 225, 0.15) 0%, transparent 50%);\n            pointer-events: none;\n        }\n\n        .brochure-section .container {\n            width: 100%;\n            padding-top: 3rem;\n            padding-bottom: 3rem;\n            padding-left: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 3rem);\n            padding-right: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 3rem);\n        }\n\n        .brochure-header {\n            margin-bottom: 2rem !important;\n        }\n\n        .brochure-header h2 {\n            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n        }\n\n        .brochure-header p {\n            font-size: 1.05rem;\n        }\n\n        .content-grid {\n            gap: clamp(1.5rem, 2.5vw, 2.5rem);\n            align-items: stretch;\n        }\n\n        .feature-list {\n            gap: 0.9rem;\n            margin-bottom: 2rem;\n        }\n\n        .brochure-cta-group {\n            gap: 1rem;\n        }\n\n        .compact-tags {\n            gap: 0.75rem;\n            padding-top: 0.75rem;\n        }\n\n        .compact-tags .brochure-tag {\n            font-size: 0.8rem;\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 1024px) {\n            .brochure-section {\n                min-height: auto;\n                display: block;\n                padding-top: 0;\n                padding-bottom: 0;\n            }\n\n            .brochure-section .container {\n                padding-top: 2.5rem;\n                padding-bottom: 2.5rem;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            .brochure-section .container {\n                padding-top: 2rem;\n                padding-bottom: 2rem;\n                padding-left: 1rem;\n                padding-right: 1rem;\n            }\n\n            .brochure-header {\n                margin-bottom: 1.5rem !important;\n            }\n\n            .brochure-header h2 {\n                font-size: 1.75rem !important;\n                margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n            }\n\n            .brochure-header p {\n                font-size: 0.95rem !important;\n                padding: 0 0.5rem;\n            }\n\n            .content-grid {\n                gap: 1.5rem;\n            }\n\n            .brochure-preview {\n                margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n            }\n\n            .brochure-subtitle {\n                font-size: 1.75rem !important;\n            }\n\n            .brochure-section p {\n                font-size: 0.95rem !important;\n            }\n\n            .brochure-check-item {\n                gap: 0.6rem;\n            }\n\n            .brochure-check-icon {\n                width: 1.25rem;\n                height: 1.25rem;\n            }\n\n            .brochure-check-text {\n                font-size: 0.95rem;\n            }\n\n            .brochure-check-description {\n                font-size: 0.85rem;\n            }\n\n            .brochure-button {\n                padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;\n                font-size: 0.9rem;\n                width: 100%;\n                justify-content: center;\n            }\n\n            .brochure-download-button {\n                padding: 0.7rem 1.25rem;\n                font-size: 0.9rem;\n                width: 100%;\n                justify-content: center;\n            }\n\n            .brochure-cta-group {\n                flex-direction: column;\n                gap: 0.75rem;\n            }\n\n            .compact-tags {\n                flex-wrap: wrap;\n                justify-content: center;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 480px) {\n            .brochure-section .container {\n                padding-top: 1.5rem;\n                padding-bottom: 1.5rem;\n                padding-left: 0.75rem;\n                padding-right: 0.75rem;\n            }\n\n            .brochure-header h2 {\n                font-size: 1.5rem !important;\n            }\n\n            .brochure-header p {\n                font-size: 0.875rem !important;\n            }\n\n            .brochure-subtitle {\n                font-size: 1.5rem !important;\n            }\n\n            .brochure-section p {\n                font-size: 0.875rem !important;\n            }\n\n            .brochure-check-text {\n                font-size: 0.9rem;\n            }\n\n            .brochure-check-description {\n                font-size: 0.8rem;\n            }\n\n            .brochure-badge {\n                font-size: 0.75rem;\n                padding: 0.4rem 1rem;\n            }\n\n            .pill-label {\n                font-size: 0.75rem !important;\n                padding: 0.5rem 1rem;\n            }\n        }\n\n        .brochure-section h2 {\n            font-family: \'Azo Sans Uber\', sans-serif;\n            letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            color: #FFFEF7;\n        }\n\n        .brochure-section h3,\n        .brochure-section .brochure-subtitle {\n            font-family: \'Azo Sans Uber\', sans-serif;\n            letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            color: #FFFEF7;\n        }\n\n        .brochure-section p,\n        .brochure-check-description,\n        .brochure-tag {\n            font-family: \'Azo Sans Uber\', sans-serif;\n            letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n            color: #FFFEF7;\n            font-weight: 400;\n        }\n\n        .brochure-check-text {\n            font-family: \'Azo Sans Uber\', sans-serif;\n            letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n            font-weight: 400;\n        }\n\n        .brochure-section .pill-label {\n            font-family: \'Azo Sans Uber\', sans-serif;\n            letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n        }\n\n        #brochure-webgl-canvas {\n            position: absolute;\n            inset: 0;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            z-index: 0;\n        }\n\n        .brochure-badge {\n            background: #FF4F4F;\n            color: #FFFEF7;\n            padding: 0.5rem 1.5rem;\n            border-radius: 50px;\n            font-size: 0.875rem;\n            font-weight: 400;\n            letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            display: inline-block;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 18px rgba(255, 79, 79, 0.35);\n            font-family: \'Azo Sans Uber\', sans-serif;\n            text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);\n        }\n\n        .brochure-preview {\n            position: relative;\n            background: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: 1.5rem;\n            box-shadow: 0 25px 55px -15px rgba(31, 31, 31, 0.15);\n            overflow: hidden;\n            transition: transform 0.45s ease, box-shadow 0.45s ease;\n            border: 2px solid rgba(255, 79, 79, 0.15);\n        }\n\n        .brochure-preview:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-6px);\n            box-shadow: 0 35px 60px -20px rgba(255, 79, 79, 0.25);\n            border-color: rgba(24, 241, 225, 0.3);\n        }\n\n        .brochure-preview::before {\n            content: \"\";\n            position: absolute;\n            inset: 0;\n            background: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, transparent, transparent 2px, rgba(162, 0, 247, 0.05) 2px, rgba(162, 0, 247, 0.05) 4px);\n            opacity: 0.4;\n            pointer-events: none;\n        }\n\n        .brochure-image {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            object-fit: contain;\n            transition: transform 0.6s ease;\n        }\n\n        .brochure-preview:hover .brochure-image {\n            transform: scale(1.03);\n        }\n\n        .brochure-check-item {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: flex-start;\n            gap: 0.75rem;\n        }\n\n        .brochure-check-icon {\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n            width: 1.5rem;\n            height: 1.5rem;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            background: #FF4F4F;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n        }\n\n        .brochure-check-text {\n            font-weight: 400;\n            color: #18F1E1 !important;\n            text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n        }\n\n        .brochure-check-description {\n            color: #FFFEF7;\n            margin-top: 0.25rem;\n            text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n            opacity: 0.95;\n            font-weight: 300;\n        }\n\n        .brochure-button {\n            display: inline-flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            background: #FF4F4F;\n            color: #ffffff;\n            padding: 0.85rem 1.75rem;\n            border-radius: 9999px;\n            font-weight: 500;\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            font-family: \'Azo Sans Uber\', sans-serif;\n            border: none;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            box-shadow: 0 20px 35px -15px rgba(255, 79, 79, 0.4);\n            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;\n        }\n\n        .brochure-button:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-2px) scale(1.02);\n            box-shadow: 0 30px 45px -20px rgba(255, 79, 79, 0.5);\n            background: #e63939;\n        }\n\n        .brochure-download-button {\n            display: inline-flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            border: 2px solid #FF4F4F;\n            color: #18F1E1;\n            padding: 0.8rem 1.5rem;\n            border-radius: 0.5rem;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            font-family: \'Azo Sans Uber\', sans-serif;\n            letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n            text-decoration: none;\n        }\n\n        .brochure-download-button:hover {\n            background: #FF4F4F;\n            color: #ffffff;\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n        }\n\n        .brochure-tag {\n            display: inline-flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 0.4rem;\n            color: #FFFEF7;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            font-weight: 500;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n            text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n        }\n\n        .brochure-tag-icon {\n            color: #FF4F4F;\n            width: 1.15rem;\n            height: 1.15rem;\n        }\n\n        .brochure-modal {\n            position: fixed;\n            inset: 0;\n            z-index: 9999;\n            display: none;\n            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);\n            font-family: \'Azo Sans Uber\', sans-serif;\n        }\n\n        .brochure-modal.show {\n            display: block;\n        }\n\n        .brochure-modal-content {\n            position: relative;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n        }\n\n        .brochure-close-button {\n            position: fixed;\n            top: 1rem;\n            right: 1rem;\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);\n            color: #FF4F4F;\n            border: none;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            padding: 0.6rem;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: transform 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease;\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(31, 31, 31, 0.2);\n            z-index: 10001;\n            pointer-events: auto;\n        }\n\n        .brochure-close-button:hover {\n            transform: scale(1.08);\n            background: #FF4F4F;\n            color: #ffffff;\n        }\n\n        .brochure-iframe {\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            border: none;\n            background: transparent;\n        }\n\n        #brochureLoader {\n            display: none;\n        }\n\n        /* Visual Services Animation Effect */\n        .visual-services-container {\n            width: 12em;\n            height: 1.2em;\n            font-size: 2.5rem;\n            font-family: \'Azo Sans Uber\', sans-serif;\n            font-weight: 400;\n            letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n            position: relative;\n            margin: 50px auto 40px auto;\n            line-height: 1;\n            cursor: pointer;\n        }\n\n        @media (min-width: 768px) {\n            .visual-services-container {\n                font-size: 4rem;\n                width: 16em;\n                height: 1.15em;\n                margin: 60px auto 50px auto;\n            }\n        }\n\n        .visual-services-container div {\n            position: absolute;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            display: block;\n            font-family: \'Azo Sans Uber\', sans-serif;\n            font-weight: 400;\n            letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n            white-space: nowrap;\n            line-height: 1;\n            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n            -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;\n        }\n\n        .visual-upper {\n            top: 0;\n            left: 50%;\n            height: 52.5%;\n            background: linear-gradient(180deg,\n                    #ffffff 0%,\n                    #e8e8e8 10%,\n                    #d0d0d0 25%,\n                    #b0b0b0 40%,\n                    #a0a0a0 50%,\n                    #b8b8b8 60%,\n                    #d0d0d0 75%,\n                    #e8e8e8 90%,\n                    #f0f0f0 100%);\n            -webkit-background-clip: text;\n            background-clip: text;\n            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            z-index: 3;\n            width: auto;\n            text-align: center;\n            transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0) scaleX(1.3);\n            transform-origin: center;\n            will-change: transform;\n            transition: transform 0.5s ease-in-out;\n            letter-spacing: 0.25em;\n            filter: drop-shadow(0 1px 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8)) drop-shadow(0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)) drop-shadow(0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7)) drop-shadow(0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5)) drop-shadow(0 0 8px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6)) drop-shadow(0 0 15px rgba(200, 200, 200, 0.4));\n        }\n\n        .visual-lower {\n            top: 0;\n            left: 50%;\n            height: 100%;\n            background: linear-gradient(180deg,\n                    transparent 52.5%,\n                    #f0f0f0 52.5%,\n                    #d8d8d8 60%,\n                    #c0c0c0 68%,\n                    #a8a8a8 75%,\n                    #989898 80%,\n                    #a8a8a8 85%,\n                    #b8b8b8 90%,\n                    #d0d0d0 95%,\n                    #e0e0e0 100%);\n            color: transparent;\n            background-clip: text;\n            -webkit-background-clip: text;\n            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n            z-index: 1;\n            width: auto;\n            text-align: center;\n            transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0) scaleX(1.3);\n            transform-origin: center;\n            will-change: transform;\n            transition: transform 0.5s ease-in-out;\n            letter-spacing: 0.25em;\n            filter: drop-shadow(0 1px 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6)) drop-shadow(0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)) drop-shadow(0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7)) drop-shadow(0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5));\n        }\n\n        .services-inside {\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 50%;\n            left: 50%;\n            transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scaleX(1.3);\n            text-align: center;\n            z-index: 2;\n            font-size: 1.5rem;\n            color: #FF4F4F;\n            font-weight: 400;\n            letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n            line-height: 1;\n            width: auto;\n            opacity: 0;\n            transition: opacity 0.5s ease-in-out, text-shadow 0.5s ease-in-out, color 0.5s ease-in-out;\n            text-shadow:\n                0 0 1px #FF4F4F,\n                0 0 2px #FF4F4F,\n                0 0 2px rgba(255, 79, 79, 0.8),\n                0 0 4px rgba(255, 79, 79, 0.6),\n                0 0 6px rgba(255, 79, 79, 0.4);\n        }\n\n        .visual-services-container:hover .visual-upper {\n            transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(-50px) scaleX(1.3);\n        }\n\n        .visual-services-container:hover .visual-lower {\n            transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(35px) scaleX(1.3);\n        }\n\n        .visual-services-container:hover .services-inside {\n            opacity: 1;\n            color: #FF4F4F;\n            animation: neonPulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes neonPulse {\n\n            0%,\n            100% {\n                text-shadow:\n                    0 0 1px #FF4F4F,\n                    0 0 2px #FF4F4F,\n                    0 0 2px #FF4F4F,\n                    0 0 4px #FF4F4F,\n                    0 0 6px #FF4F4F,\n                    0 0 8px #FF4F4F,\n                    0 0 12px #FF4F4F,\n                    0 0 18px #FF4F4F,\n                    0 0 2px rgba(255, 79, 79, 1),\n                    0 0 4px rgba(255, 79, 79, 0.9),\n                    0 0 6px rgba(255, 79, 79, 0.8),\n                    0 0 8px rgba(255, 79, 79, 0.6),\n                    0 0 12px rgba(255, 79, 79, 0.4);\n            }\n\n            50% {\n                text-shadow:\n                    0 0 1px #18F1E1,\n                    0 0 2px #18F1E1,\n                    0 0 1px #18F1E1,\n                    0 0 2px #18F1E1,\n                    0 0 3px #18F1E1,\n                    0 0 4px #18F1E1,\n                    0 0 6px #18F1E1,\n                    0 0 10px #18F1E1,\n                    0 0 1px rgba(24, 241, 225, 1),\n                    0 0 2px rgba(24, 241, 225, 0.9),\n                    0 0 3px rgba(24, 241, 225, 0.7),\n                    0 0 4px rgba(24, 241, 225, 0.5),\n                    0 0 6px rgba(24, 241, 225, 0.3);\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (min-width: 768px) {\n            .services-inside {\n                font-size: 2.5rem;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @keyframes moveUp {\n            0% {\n                transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0) scaleX(1.3);\n            }\n\n            15% {\n                transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(-50px) scaleX(1.3);\n            }\n\n            18% {\n                transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(-50px) scaleX(1.3);\n            }\n\n            40% {\n                transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0) scaleX(1.3);\n            }\n\n            100% {\n                transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0) scaleX(1.3);\n            }\n        }\n\n        @keyframes moveDown {\n            0% {\n                transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0) scaleX(1.3);\n            }\n\n            15% {\n                transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(35px) scaleX(1.3);\n            }\n\n            18% {\n                transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(35px) scaleX(1.3);\n            }\n\n            40% {\n                transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0) scaleX(1.3);\n            }\n\n            100% {\n                transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0) scaleX(1.3);\n            }\n        }\n\n        @keyframes fadeInOut {\n\n            0%,\n            100% {\n                opacity: 0;\n            }\n\n            15% {\n                opacity: 0;\n            }\n\n            17% {\n                opacity: 1;\n            }\n\n            28% {\n                opacity: 1;\n            }\n\n            32% {\n                opacity: 0;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @keyframes glowPulse {\n\n            0%,\n            100% {\n                text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.3);\n            }\n\n            17% {\n                text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.8),\n                    0 0 35px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.6),\n                    0 0 50px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.4);\n            }\n\n            20% {\n                text-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.9),\n                    0 0 45px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.7),\n                    0 0 65px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.5);\n            }\n\n            25% {\n                text-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.9),\n                    0 0 45px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.7),\n                    0 0 65px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.5);\n            }\n\n            28% {\n                text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.8),\n                    0 0 35px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.6),\n                    0 0 50px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.4);\n            }\n\n            32% {\n                text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.3);\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 640px) {\n            .visual-services-container {\n                font-size: 1.75rem;\n                width: 9em;\n                margin: 35px auto 25px auto;\n            }\n\n            .services-inside {\n                font-size: 1.2rem;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 424px) {\n            .visual-services-container {\n                font-size: 1.5rem;\n                width: 8em;\n                margin: 30px auto 20px auto;\n            }\n\n            .services-inside {\n                font-size: 1.1rem;\n            }\n\n            .visual-services-container:hover .visual-upper {\n                transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(-35px) scaleX(1.3);\n            }\n\n            .visual-services-container:hover .visual-lower {\n                transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(25px) scaleX(1.3);\n            }\n\n            @keyframes moveUp {\n                0% {\n                    transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0) scaleX(1.3);\n                }\n\n                15% {\n                    transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(-35px) scaleX(1.3);\n                }\n\n                18% {\n                    transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(-35px) scaleX(1.3);\n                }\n\n                40% {\n                    transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0) scaleX(1.3);\n                }\n\n                100% {\n                    transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0) scaleX(1.3);\n                }\n            }\n\n            @keyframes moveDown {\n                0% {\n                    transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0) scaleX(1.3);\n                }\n\n                15% {\n                    transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(25px) scaleX(1.3);\n                }\n\n                18% {\n                    transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(25px) scaleX(1.3);\n                }\n\n                40% {\n                    transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0) scaleX(1.3);\n                }\n\n                100% {\n                    transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0) scaleX(1.3);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 320px) {\n            .visual-services-container {\n                font-size: 1.5rem;\n                width: 8em;\n                margin: 35px auto 25px auto;\n            }\n\n            .services-inside {\n                font-size: 1.1rem;\n            }\n        }\n\n        /* Film reel wrapper to span both sections */\n        .film-reel-wrapper {\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: visible;\n        }\n\n        /* Vertical Film Reel */\n        .film-reel-container {\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            bottom: 0;\n            width: 100px;\n            z-index: 5;\n            pointer-events: none;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            justify-content: flex-start;\n            align-items: center;\n            padding-top: 0;\n        }\n\n        .film-reel-container-left {\n            left: 0;\n        }\n\n        .film-reel-container-right {\n            right: 0;\n        }\n\n        /* Film Reel (Circular) */\n        .film-reel {\n            width: 80px;\n            height: 80px;\n            position: relative;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            filter: drop-shadow(0 0 8px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2));\n        }\n\n        .reel-outer {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            background:\n                radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%, rgba(100, 100, 100, 0.4), rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.6), rgba(20, 20, 20, 0.8)),\n                radial-gradient(circle at 70% 70%, rgba(60, 60, 60, 0.3), transparent 70%),\n                linear-gradient(135deg, #2a2a2a 0%, #1a1a1a 50%, #0a0a0a 100%);\n            border: 4px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);\n            box-shadow:\n                inset 0 0 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9),\n                inset 0 0 15px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1),\n                inset -5px -5px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8),\n                inset 5px 5px 20px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05),\n                0 0 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6),\n                0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5),\n                0 0 10px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2),\n                0 0 20px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1),\n                0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);\n            position: relative;\n            animation: reelRotate 4s linear infinite;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        .reel-outer::before {\n            content: \'\';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: -50%;\n            left: -50%;\n            width: 200%;\n            height: 200%;\n            background: conic-gradient(from 0deg,\n                    transparent 0deg,\n                    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1) 45deg,\n                    transparent 90deg,\n                    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1) 135deg,\n                    transparent 180deg,\n                    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1) 225deg,\n                    transparent 270deg,\n                    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1) 315deg,\n                    transparent 360deg);\n            animation: reelRotate 2s linear infinite;\n            opacity: 0.6;\n        }\n\n        .reel-outer::after {\n            content: \'\';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 5px;\n            left: 5px;\n            right: 5px;\n            bottom: 5px;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);\n            box-shadow:\n                inset 0 0 10px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1),\n                0 0 5px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n        }\n\n        .reel-inner {\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 50%;\n            left: 50%;\n            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\n            width: 50px;\n            height: 50px;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            background:\n                radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%, rgba(80, 80, 80, 0.5), rgba(30, 30, 30, 0.7), rgba(10, 10, 10, 0.9)),\n                radial-gradient(circle at 70% 70%, rgba(40, 40, 40, 0.4), transparent 70%),\n                linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a1a 0%, #0f0f0f 50%, #0a0a0a 100%);\n            border: 3px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);\n            box-shadow:\n                inset 0 0 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 1),\n                inset 0 0 10px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1),\n                inset -3px -3px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9),\n                inset 3px 3px 15px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05),\n                0 0 8px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15),\n                0 1px 3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);\n        }\n\n        .reel-inner::before {\n            content: \'\';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 50%;\n            left: 50%;\n            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\n            width: 8px;\n            height: 8px;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8), rgba(200, 200, 200, 0.4));\n            box-shadow:\n                0 0 5px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6),\n                0 0 10px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3),\n                inset 0 0 3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n        }\n\n        .reel-spokes {\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 50%;\n            left: 50%;\n            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n        }\n\n        .reel-spoke {\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 50%;\n            left: 50%;\n            width: 3px;\n            height: 35px;\n            background: linear-gradient(to bottom,\n                    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8) 0%,\n                    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5) 30%,\n                    rgba(200, 200, 200, 0.4) 50%,\n                    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5) 70%,\n                    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8) 100%);\n            transform-origin: center bottom;\n            border-radius: 1px;\n            box-shadow:\n                0 0 4px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4),\n                0 0 8px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2),\n                0 1px 3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8),\n                inset 0 0 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4),\n                inset 0 0 3px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n        }\n\n        .reel-spoke:nth-child(1) {\n            transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(0deg);\n        }\n\n        .reel-spoke:nth-child(2) {\n            transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(45deg);\n        }\n\n        .reel-spoke:nth-child(3) {\n            transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(90deg);\n        }\n\n        .reel-spoke:nth-child(4) {\n            transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(135deg);\n        }\n\n        .reel-spoke:nth-child(5) {\n            transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(180deg);\n        }\n\n        .reel-spoke:nth-child(6) {\n            transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(225deg);\n        }\n\n        .reel-spoke:nth-child(7) {\n            transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(270deg);\n        }\n\n        .reel-spoke:nth-child(8) {\n            transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(315deg);\n        }\n\n        /* Film Strip */\n        .film-strip-vertical {\n            width: 60px;\n            height: 100%;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            background: #000;\n            position: relative;\n            border-left: 3px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);\n            border-right: 3px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);\n            box-shadow:\n                inset 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5),\n                0 0 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3),\n                0 0 10px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1),\n                inset 0 0 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7),\n                0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);\n            visibility: visible;\n            opacity: 1;\n            z-index: inherit;\n        }\n\n        .film-strip-vertical::before {\n            content: \'\';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            bottom: 0;\n            background: repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,\n                    transparent 0px,\n                    transparent 18px,\n                    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2) 18px,\n                    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2) 22px,\n                    transparent 22px,\n                    transparent 40px);\n            background-size: 100% 40px;\n            animation: filmScroll 2s linear infinite;\n            box-shadow: inset 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);\n        }\n\n        .film-strip-vertical::after {\n            content: \'\';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: -8px;\n            width: 6px;\n            bottom: 0;\n            background: repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,\n                    #000 0px,\n                    #000 8px,\n                    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7) 8px,\n                    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7) 12px,\n                    #000 12px,\n                    #000 20px,\n                    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7) 20px,\n                    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7) 24px,\n                    #000 24px,\n                    #000 32px,\n                    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7) 32px,\n                    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7) 36px,\n                    #000 36px,\n                    #000 40px);\n            background-size: 100% 40px;\n            animation: filmScroll 2s linear infinite;\n            box-shadow:\n                inset -2px 0 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5),\n                0 0 5px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15),\n                inset 0 0 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);\n        }\n\n        .film-strip-vertical .sprocket-right {\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            right: -8px;\n            width: 6px;\n            bottom: 0;\n            background: repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,\n                    #000 0px,\n                    #000 8px,\n                    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7) 8px,\n                    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7) 12px,\n                    #000 12px,\n                    #000 20px,\n                    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7) 20px,\n                    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7) 24px,\n                    #000 24px,\n                    #000 32px,\n                    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7) 32px,\n                    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7) 36px,\n                    #000 36px,\n                    #000 40px);\n            background-size: 100% 40px;\n            animation: filmScroll 2s linear infinite;\n            box-shadow:\n                inset 2px 0 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5),\n                0 0 5px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15),\n                inset 0 0 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);\n        }\n\n        @keyframes reelRotate {\n            0% {\n                transform: rotate(0deg);\n            }\n\n            100% {\n                transform: rotate(360deg);\n            }\n        }\n\n        @keyframes filmScroll {\n            0% {\n                background-position: 0 0;\n            }\n\n            100% {\n                background-position: 0 40px;\n            }\n        }\n\n        /* Reverse rotation for right side */\n        .film-reel-container-right .reel-outer {\n            animation: reelRotateReverse 4s linear infinite;\n        }\n\n        .film-reel-container-right .reel-outer::before {\n            animation: reelRotateReverse 2s linear infinite;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes reelRotateReverse {\n            0% {\n                transform: rotate(0deg);\n            }\n\n            100% {\n                transform: rotate(-360deg);\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            .film-reel-container {\n                width: 70px;\n            }\n\n            .film-strip-vertical {\n                width: 45px;\n            }\n\n            .film-reel {\n                width: 60px;\n                height: 60px;\n            }\n\n            .reel-outer {\n                border-width: 3px;\n            }\n\n            .reel-inner {\n                width: 35px;\n                height: 35px;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 480px) {\n            .film-reel-container {\n                width: 50px;\n                display: none;\n                /* Hide on very small screens for better content visibility */\n            }\n\n            .film-strip-vertical {\n                width: 30px;\n            }\n\n            .film-reel {\n                width: 45px;\n                height: 45px;\n            }\n\n            .reel-inner {\n                width: 28px;\n                height: 28px;\n            }\n        }\n\n        /* Slider Section Styles */\n        .slider-section {\n            position: relative;\n            width: 100%;\n            display: block;\n            overflow-x: hidden;\n        }\n\n        .slider-section.section-padding {\n            padding: 2.5rem 0;\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            .slider-section.section-padding {\n                padding: 2rem 0;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 480px) {\n            .slider-section.section-padding {\n                padding: 1.5rem 0;\n            }\n        }\n\n        .slider-full-height {\n            min-height: 60vh;\n        }\n\n        .slider-over-hide {\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        .slider-padding-tb {\n            padding: 40px 0;\n        }\n\n        .slider-section [type=\"radio\"]:checked,\n        .slider-section [type=\"radio\"]:not(:checked) {\n            position: absolute;\n            left: -9999px;\n        }\n\n        .slider-section .checkbox:checked+label,\n        .slider-section .checkbox:not(:checked)+label {\n            position: relative;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-right: 6px;\n            margin-left: 6px;\n            display: inline-block;\n            width: 50px;\n            height: 50px;\n            border: 3px solid rgba(255, 79, 79, 0.5);\n            background-size: cover;\n            background-position: center;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n            -webkit-transition: all 0.2s ease;\n            transition: all 0.2s ease;\n            animation: border-transform 6s linear infinite alternate forwards;\n            -webkit-animation-play-state: paused;\n            -moz-animation-play-state: paused;\n            animation-play-state: paused;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n        }\n\n        .slider-section .checkbox.scnd+label {\n            background-image: url(\'../../assets/images/audivis/p2.jpg\');\n        }\n\n        .slider-section .checkbox.thrd+label {\n            background-image: url(\'../../assets/images/audivis/p3.jpg\');\n        }\n\n        .slider-section .checkbox.foth+label {\n            background-image: url(\'../../assets/images/audivis/p4.jpg\');\n        }\n\n        .slider-section .checkbox.frst+label {\n            background-image: url(\'../../assets/images/audivis/p1.jpg\');\n        }\n\n        .slider-section .checkbox:checked+label {\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px 0 rgba(255, 79, 79, 0.4);\n            transform: scale(1.3);\n            border-color: #FF4F4F;\n            -webkit-animation-play-state: running;\n            -moz-animation-play-state: running;\n            animation-play-state: running;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes border-transform {\n\n            0%,\n            100% {\n                border-radius: 63% 37% 54% 46% / 55% 48% 52% 45%;\n            }\n\n            14% {\n                border-radius: 40% 60% 54% 46% / 49% 60% 40% 51%;\n            }\n\n            28% {\n                border-radius: 54% 46% 38% 62% / 49% 70% 30% 51%;\n            }\n\n            42% {\n                border-radius: 61% 39% 55% 45% / 61% 38% 62% 39%;\n            }\n\n            56% {\n                border-radius: 61% 39% 67% 33% / 70% 50% 50% 30%;\n            }\n\n            70% {\n                border-radius: 50% 50% 34% 66% / 56% 68% 32% 44%;\n            }\n\n            84% {\n                border-radius: 46% 54% 50% 50% / 35% 61% 39% 65%;\n            }\n        }\n\n        .slider-height-padding {\n            padding-top: 380px;\n            position: relative;\n            max-width: 100%;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n\n        .slider-section .section {\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .slider-section ul {\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            display: block;\n            width: 100%;\n            z-index: 100;\n            padding: 0;\n            margin: 0;\n            list-style: none;\n        }\n\n        .slider-section ul li {\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 100%;\n            display: block;\n            z-index: 100;\n            padding: 0;\n            margin: 0;\n            list-style: none;\n            height: 340px;\n            border: 5px solid rgba(255, 79, 79, 0.3);\n            background-size: cover;\n            background-position: center;\n            background-image: url(\'../../assets/images/audivis/p1.jpg\');\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n            font-family: \'Azo Sans Uber\', sans-serif;\n            font-weight: 400;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            letter-spacing: 3px;\n            line-height: 2.7;\n            color: #1F1F1F;\n            writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n            opacity: 0;\n            pointer-events: none;\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px 0 rgba(255, 79, 79, 0.2);\n            -webkit-transition: all 0.5s ease;\n            transition: all 0.5s ease;\n        }\n\n        .slider-section ul li span {\n            mix-blend-mode: difference;\n            text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 79, 79, 0.8);\n        }\n\n        .slider-section ul li:nth-child(2) {\n            background-image: url(\'../../assets/images/audivis/p2.jpg\');\n        }\n\n        .slider-section ul li:nth-child(3) {\n            background-image: url(\'../../assets/images/audivis/p3.jpg\');\n        }\n\n        .slider-section ul li:nth-child(4) {\n            background-image: url(\'../../assets/images/audivis/p4.jpg\');\n        }\n\n        .slider-section .checkbox.frst:checked~ul li:nth-child(1) {\n            opacity: 1;\n            pointer-events: auto;\n            border-radius: 16px;\n            border-color: #FF4F4F;\n        }\n\n        .slider-section .checkbox.scnd:checked~ul li:nth-child(2) {\n            opacity: 1;\n            pointer-events: auto;\n            border-radius: 16px;\n            border-color: #FF4F4F;\n        }\n\n        .slider-section .checkbox.thrd:checked~ul li:nth-child(3) {\n            opacity: 1;\n            pointer-events: auto;\n            border-radius: 16px;\n            border-color: #FF4F4F;\n        }\n\n        .slider-section .checkbox.foth:checked~ul li:nth-child(4) {\n            opacity: 1;\n            pointer-events: auto;\n            border-radius: 16px;\n            border-color: #FF4F4F;\n        }\n\n        /* Right Column Content Styling */\n        .slider-section .text-content {\n            padding-left: 0;\n        }\n\n        @media (min-width: 1024px) {\n            .slider-section .text-content {\n                padding-left: 2rem;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 1024px) {\n            .slider-section .grid {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n            }\n\n            .slider-section .slider-padding-tb {\n                padding: 30px 0;\n            }\n\n            .slider-section .text-content {\n                padding-left: 0;\n                padding-right: 0;\n                text-align: center;\n            }\n\n            .slider-section .text-content h3,\n            .slider-section .text-content h2,\n            .slider-section .text-content p {\n                text-align: center;\n            }\n\n            .slider-section .flex.items-center.justify-center {\n                min-height: auto;\n                padding: 1rem 0;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 640px) {\n            .slider-section .text-content {\n                text-align: center;\n                padding: 0;\n            }\n\n            .slider-section .text-content h3,\n            .slider-section .text-content h2,\n            .slider-section .text-content p {\n                text-align: center;\n            }\n\n            .slider-section .text-content[style*=\"text-right\"] {\n                text-align: center !important;\n            }\n\n            .slider-section .text-content[style*=\"text-right\"] h2,\n            .slider-section .text-content[style*=\"text-right\"] p {\n                text-align: center !important;\n            }\n\n            .slider-section .text-content[style*=\"padding-right\"] {\n                padding-right: 0 !important;\n            }\n\n            .slider-section div[style*=\"justify-content: flex-end\"] {\n                justify-content: center !important;\n            }\n\n            .slider-section div[style*=\"justify-content: flex-start\"] {\n                justify-content: center !important;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 1024px) {\n            .slider-section .section-padding {\n                padding-top: 2rem;\n                padding-bottom: 2rem;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 767px) {\n            .slider-section .grid {\n                gap: 2rem !important;\n            }\n\n            .slider-height-padding {\n                padding-top: 220px;\n            }\n\n            .slider-section ul li {\n                height: 220px;\n                font-size: 11px;\n                letter-spacing: 1.5px;\n            }\n\n            .slider-full-height {\n                min-height: auto;\n            }\n\n            .slider-section .container {\n                padding-left: 1rem;\n                padding-right: 1rem;\n            }\n\n            .slider-section .grid {\n                gap: 2rem;\n            }\n\n            .slider-section .text-content {\n                text-align: center !important;\n            }\n\n            .slider-section .text-content h2,\n            .slider-section .text-content h3,\n            .slider-section .text-content p {\n                text-align: center !important;\n            }\n\n            .slider-section .checkbox:checked+label,\n            .slider-section .checkbox:not(:checked)+label {\n                width: 45px;\n                height: 45px;\n                margin: 0 4px;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 575px) {\n            .slider-height-padding {\n                padding-top: 200px;\n            }\n\n            .slider-section ul li {\n                height: 180px;\n                font-size: 10px;\n                letter-spacing: 1px;\n            }\n\n            .slider-section .checkbox:checked+label,\n            .slider-section .checkbox:not(:checked)+label {\n                width: 40px;\n                height: 40px;\n                margin: 0 3px;\n            }\n\n            .slider-section .text-content h2 {\n                font-size: 1.75rem !important;\n            }\n\n            .slider-section .text-content h3 {\n                font-size: 0.9rem !important;\n            }\n\n            .slider-section .text-content p {\n                font-size: 0.9rem !important;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 480px) {\n            .slider-height-padding {\n                padding-top: 180px;\n            }\n\n            .slider-section ul li {\n                height: 160px;\n                font-size: 9px;\n            }\n\n            .slider-section .container {\n                padding-left: 0.75rem;\n                padding-right: 0.75rem;\n            }\n\n            .slider-section .text-content h2 {\n                font-size: 1.5rem !important;\n                line-height: 1.2;\n            }\n\n            .slider-section .text-content h3 {\n                font-size: 0.85rem !important;\n            }\n\n            .slider-section .text-content p {\n                font-size: 0.875rem !important;\n            }\n\n            .slider-section .grid {\n                gap: 1.5rem !important;\n            }\n\n            .slider-section .flex.items-center.justify-center {\n                min-height: auto;\n                padding: 0.75rem 0;\n            }\n        }\n\n        /* Email Button Section Styles - Visual Theme */\n        .email-button-container {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            width: 100%;\n            padding: 0.5rem 0;\n            font-family: \'Azo Sans Uber\', sans-serif;\n            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n            -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;\n            user-select: none;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            color: inherit;\n        }\n\n        .email-button-bevel {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            position: relative;\n            padding: 0 72px;\n            height: 80px;\n            background: #FF4F4F linear-gradient(to bottom, #FF4F4F 50%, #e63939 50%);\n            border-radius: 0px;\n            box-shadow:\n                0px 15px 25px -10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5),\n                inset 0px 0px 0px 0px rgba(255, 79, 79, 0),\n                inset 0px -40px 0px 0px #e63939;\n            font-size: 24px;\n            font-family: \'Azo Sans Uber\', sans-serif;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            text-align: center;\n            text-shadow:\n                0px 3px 5px #e63939,\n                0px 5px 10px #e63939,\n                0px 5px 10px #e63939,\n                0px 5px 10px #e63939,\n                0px 5px 10px #e63939;\n            color: #fff;\n            letter-spacing: 0.4px;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            outline: 0 !important;\n            transform: scale(1.01);\n            transition: all 0.2s ease-in-out;\n            cursor: pointer;\n        }\n\n        .email-button-bevel:before,\n        .email-button-bevel:after {\n            content: \" \";\n            width: 40px;\n            max-width: 50%;\n            height: 100%;\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            transition: all 0.135s cubic-bezier(0.74, 0.16, 0.24, 0.92);\n            transition-delay: 0.15s;\n        }\n\n        .email-button-bevel:before {\n            left: 0;\n            background:\n                linear-gradient(45deg, transparent calc(200% / 3), rgba(255, 79, 79, 1) calc(200% / 3)),\n                linear-gradient(-45deg, rgba(230, 57, 57, 1) calc(100% / 3), transparent calc(100% / 3)),\n                linear-gradient(to right, #FF4F4F, #e63939);\n        }\n\n        .email-button-bevel:after {\n            right: 0;\n            background:\n                linear-gradient(-45deg, transparent calc(200% / 3), rgba(255, 79, 79, 1) calc(200% / 3)),\n                linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(230, 57, 57, 1) calc(100% / 3), transparent calc(100% / 3)),\n                linear-gradient(to left, #FF4F4F, #e63939);\n        }\n\n        .email-button-container:hover .email-button-bevel {\n            transform: scale(1.07);\n            box-shadow:\n                0px 25px 40px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3),\n                inset 0px 0px 0px 0px rgba(255, 79, 79, 0),\n                inset 0px -40px 0px 0px #e63939;\n        }\n\n        .email-button-container:active .email-button-bevel {\n            transform: scale(1.02);\n        }\n\n\n        .email-button-text {\n            display: block;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n            font-family: \'Azo Sans Uber\', sans-serif;\n            font-size: 28px;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: #1F1F1F;\n            z-index: -1;\n            transition: all 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.74, 0.16, 0.24, 0.92);\n            transition-delay: 0.135s;\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            .email-button-container {\n                padding: 0.75rem 1rem;\n            }\n\n            .email-button-bevel {\n                padding: 0 48px;\n                height: 70px;\n                font-size: 20px;\n            }\n\n            .email-button-text {\n                font-size: 24px;\n                margin-bottom: 8px;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 480px) {\n            .email-button-container {\n                padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;\n            }\n\n            .email-button-bevel {\n                padding: 0 32px;\n                height: 60px;\n                font-size: 18px;\n                letter-spacing: 0.2px;\n            }\n\n            .email-button-text {\n                font-size: 20px;\n                margin-bottom: 6px;\n            }\n\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 375px) {\n            .email-button-bevel {\n                padding: 0 24px;\n                height: 55px;\n                font-size: 16px;\n            }\n\n            .email-button-text {\n                font-size: 18px;\n            }\n\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n\n<body>\n    <div id=\"nav-placeholder\"></div>\n\n    <main role=\"main\">\n        <div class=\"film-reel-wrapper\">\n            <!-- Animated Film Strips - Spanning both hero and brochure sections -->\n            <div class=\"film-reel-container film-reel-container-left\">\n                <div class=\"film-strip-vertical\">\n                    <div class=\"sprocket-right\"></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"film-reel-container film-reel-container-right\">\n                <div class=\"film-strip-vertical\">\n                    <div class=\"sprocket-right\"></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <section id=\"hero\" class=\"relative h-screen flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden\"\n                aria-label=\"Visual Services Hero Section\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center\"\n                    style=\"background-image: url(\'../../assets/images/visuals/hero.jpg\'); z-index: 1;\"\n                    aria-hidden=\"true\" role=\"presentation\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 hero-gradient\" style=\"z-index: 1;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n\n                <div class=\"relative z-20 text-center text-white px-4 sm:px-6 w-full pt-20\">\n                    <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto\">\n                        <h3 class=\"av-title text-xl sm:text-2xl md:text-xl font-bold mb-2 sm:mb-3\"\n                            data-text=\"A/V PRODUCTION\">\n                            A/V PRODUCTION</h3>\n                        <h1 class=\"visual-services-container\"\n                            aria-label=\"Visual Services - LED Walls, Video Mapping, Projection Design & AV Production\">\n                            <div class=\"visual-upper\">VISUAL</div>\n                            <div class=\"visual-lower\">VISUAL</div>\n                            <div class=\"services-inside\">SERVICES</div>\n                        </h1>\n                        <!-- SEO-optimized visible h1 for search engines (screen reader only but indexed) -->\n                        <h1 class=\"sr-only\">Professional Visual Services - LED Walls, Video Mapping, Projection Design &\n                            AV Production | MiHi Entertainment</h1>\n                        <div class=\"monitor-table\">\n                            <div class=\"monitor-wrapper\">\n                                <div class=\"monitor\">\n                                    <p>Professional visual services and AV production for events including LED display\n                                        walls, video mapping, projection design, lighting production, and immersive\n                                        visual experiences. MiHi Entertainment delivers expert video solutions and\n                                        innovative AV services for conferences, galas, concerts, corporate events, trade\n                                        shows, and brand activations. • Professional visual services and AV production\n                                        for events including LED display walls, video mapping, projection design,\n                                        lighting production, and immersive visual experiences. MiHi Entertainment\n                                        delivers expert video solutions and innovative AV services for conferences,\n                                        galas, concerts, corporate events, trade shows, and brand activations. •\n                                        Professional visual services and AV production for events including LED display\n                                        walls, video mapping, projection design, lighting production, and immersive\n                                        visual experiences. MiHi Entertainment delivers expert video solutions and\n                                        innovative AV services for conferences, galas, concerts, corporate events, trade\n                                        shows, and brand activations. •</p>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div\n                            class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 sm:gap-6 mt-8 w-full px-4\">\n                            <a href=\"../contact-us.html\" class=\"super-button w-full sm:w-auto cursor-pointer\"\n                                aria-label=\"Get a quote for visual services and AV production\">\n                                <span>Get Your Quote</span>\n                            </a>\n                            <button type=\"button\" data-click-to-call data-call-text=\"Contact Us\"\n                                class=\"super-button w-full sm:w-auto cursor-pointer\"\n                                aria-label=\"Contact us about visual services\">\n                                <span class=\"whitespace-nowrap\">Contact Us</span>\n                                <span class=\"arrow\">\n                                    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                                        <path\n                                            d=\"M3 5C3 3.89543 3.89543 3 5 3H8.27924C8.70967 3 9.09181 3.27543 9.22792 3.68377L10.7257 8.17721C10.8831 8.64932 10.6694 9.16531 10.2243 9.38787L7.96701 10.5165C9.06925 12.9612 11.0388 14.9308 13.4835 16.033L14.6121 13.7757C14.8347 13.3306 15.3507 13.1169 15.8228 13.2743L20.3162 14.7721C20.7246 14.9082 21 15.2903 21 15.7208V19C21 20.1046 20.1046 21 19 21H18C9.71573 21 3 14.2843 3 6V5Z\"\n                                            stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"\n                                            stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n                           