     <h3 class=\"text-base md:text-lg font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase\"\n                                    style=\"text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4), 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6), 0 0 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3), 1px 1px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), -1px -1px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3); font-family: \'Azo Sans Uber\', sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #18F1E1; font-weight: 400;\">\n                                    SHOW OFF STUNNING VISUALS WITH OUR\n                                </h3>\n                                <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold leading-tight\"\n                                    style=\"text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4), 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6), 0 0 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3), 1px 1px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), -1px -1px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3); font-family: \'Azo Sans Uber\', sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.02em; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 400; color: #FF4F4F;\">\n                                    VISUAL EVENT SERVICES\n                                </h2>\n                                <p class=\"text-base md:text-lg leading-normal\"\n                                    style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, sans-serif; color: #1F1F1F; font-weight: 300; font-style: normal;\">\n                                    Boost your next event with MiHi Entertainment\'s Professional Visual Services. Our\n                                    expert\n                                    team ensures high-definition video quality for gatherings of all sizes, from\n                                    intimate\n                                    meetings to large-scale celebrations, including <a\n                                        href=\"../../corporate-events.html\" class=\"underline\"\n                                        style=\"color: #FF4F4F;\">corporate events</a> and\n                                    conferences.\n          