th=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n                                            </svg>\n                                        </span>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Right Side - Single Image -->\n                        <div class=\"slider-padding-tb order-2 lg:order-2\">\n                            <div class=\"section mx-auto text-center slider-height-padding relative\">\n                                <ul>\n                                    <li\n                                        style=\"opacity: 1; pointer-events: auto; border-radius: 16px; border-color: #FF4F4F; background-image: url(\'../../assets/images/visuals/s3.jpg\');\">\n                                        <span>VISUAL PRODUCTION</span>\n                                    </li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Fifth Section with Slider -->\n            <section class=\"section-padding slider-section slider-full-height slider-over-hide relative\"\n                style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f8f9fa 0%, #e9ecef 50%, #f1f3f5 100%); padding-top: 0; padding-bottom: 0; margin-top: -2rem; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n                <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 relative\" style=\"z-index: 20;\">\n                    <div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6 items-center\">\n                        <!-- Left Side - Single Image -->\n                        <div class=\"slider-padding-tb order-2 lg:order-1\">\n                            <div class=\"section mx-auto text-center slider-height-padding relative\">\n                                <ul>\n                                    <li\n                                        style=\"opacity: 1; pointer-events: auto; border-radius: 16px; border-color: #FF4F4F; background-image: url(\'../../assets/images/visuals/s4.jpg\');\">\n                                        <span>VISUAL PRODUCTION</span>\n                                    </li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Right Side - Content -->\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center min-h-[250px] sm:min-h-[300px] order-1 lg:order-2\">\n                            <div class=\"w-full max-w-2xl text-center sm:text-left space-y-2 text-content px-2 sm:px-4 lg:px-8\"\n                                style=\"padding-left: 0; padding-right: 0;\">\n                                <h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold leading-tight\"\n                                    style=\"text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4), 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6), 0 0 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3), 1px 1px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), -1px -1px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);font-family: \'Azo Sans Uber\', sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.02em; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 400; color: #FF4F4F;\">\n                                    <span\n                                        style=\"text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4), 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6), 0 0 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3), 1px 1px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), -1px -1px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3); color: #FF4F4F;\">PROJECTION</span>\n                                    <span\n                                        style=\"text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4), 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6), 0 0 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3), 1px 1px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), -1px -1px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3); color: #18F1E1;\">MAPPING</span>\n                                </h2>\n                                <p class=\"text-sm sm:text-base md:text-lg leading-normal\"\n                                    style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, sans-serif; color: #1F1F1F; font-style: normal;\">\n                                    Transform any location into an immersive event with our video\n                                    <br> and lighting services.\n                                </p>\n                                <div class=\"button-wrapper-mobile\">\n                                    <a href=\"../contact-us.html\" class=\"super-button\">\n                                        <span>Interested In Hearing More?</span>\n                                        <span class=\"arrow\">\n                                            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                                                <path d=\"M5 12H19M19 12L15 8M19 12L15 16\" stroke=\"currentColor\"\n                                                    stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n                                            </svg>\n                                        </span>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Contact Section -->\n            <section\n                style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f8f9fa 0%, #e9ecef 50%, #f1f3f5 100%); padding-top: 0; padding-bottom: 0; margin-top: -2rem; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n                <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 relative\"\n                    style=\"z-index: 20; padding-top: 2rem; padding-bottom: 2rem;\">\n                    <div class=\"max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center space-y-2 sm:space-y-3\">\n                        <div class=\"animated-text-container\">\n                            <div class=\"animated-text-flex\">\n                                <div class=\"animated-text-col animated-text-col-7\">\n                                    <div class=\"animated-black animated-growup animated-delay-1\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"animated-bg-primary animated-centerize\">\n                                        <span class=\"animated-scaleme animated-delay-1\">C</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"animated-black animated-growup animated-delay-1\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"animated-text-col animated-text-col-7\">\n                                    <div class=\"animated-black-2 animated-growup animated-delay-2\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"animated-bg-secondary animated-centerize\">\n                                        <span class=\"animated-scaleme animated-delay-2\">O</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"animated-black-2 animated-growup animated-delay-2\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"animated-text-col animated-text-col-7\">\n                                    <div class=\"animated-black animated-growup animated-delay-3\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"animated-bg-primary animated-centerize\">\n                                        <span class=\"animated-scaleme animated-delay-3\">N</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"animated-black animated-growup animated-delay-3\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"animated-text-col animated-text-col-7\">\n                                    <div class=\"animated-black-2 animated-growup animated-delay-4\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"animated-bg-secondary animated-centerize\">\n                                        <span class=\"animated-scaleme animated-delay-4\">T</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"animated-black-2 animated-growup animated-delay-4\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"animated-text-col animated-text-col-7\">\n                                    <div class=\"animated-black animated-growup animated-delay-5\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"animated-bg-primary animated-centerize\">\n                                        <span class=\"animated-scaleme animated-delay-5\">A</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"animated-black animated-growup animated-delay-5\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"animated-text-col animated-text-col-7\">\n                                    <div class=\"animated-black-2 animated-growup animated-delay-6\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"animated-bg-secondary animated-centerize\">\n                                        <span class=\"animated-scaleme animated-delay-6\">C</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"animated-black-2 animated-growup animated-delay-6\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"animated-text-col animated-text-col-7\">\n                                    <div class=\"animated-black animated-growup animated-delay-7\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"animated-bg-primary animated-centerize\">\n                                        <span class=\"animated-scaleme animated-delay-7\">T</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"animated-black animated-growup animated-delay-7\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"animated-text-flex\">\n                                <div class=\"animated-text-col animated-text-col-5\">\n                                    <div class=\"animated-black animated-growup animated-delay-1\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"animated-bg-secondary animated-centerize\">\n                                        <span class=\"animated-scaleme animated-delay-1\">U</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"animated-black animated-growup animated-delay-1\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"animated-text-col animated-text-col-5\">\n                                    <div class=\"animated-black-2 animated-growup animated-delay-2\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"animated-bg-primary animated-centerize\">\n                                        <span class=\"animated-scaleme animated-delay-2\">S</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"animated-black-2 animated-growup animated-delay-2\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"animated-text-col animated-text-col-5\">\n                                    <div class=\"animated-black animated-growup animated-delay-3\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"animated-bg-secondary animated-centerize\">\n                                        <span class=\"animated-scaleme animated-delay-3\">N</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"animated-black animated-growup animated-delay-3\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"animated-text-col animated-text-col-5\">\n                                    <div class=\"animated-black-2 animated-growup animated-delay-4\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"animated-bg-primary animated-centerize\">\n                                        <span class=\"animated-scaleme animated-delay-4\">O</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"animated-black-2 animated-growup animated-delay-4\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"animated-text-col animated-text-col-5\">\n                                    <div class=\"animated-black animated-growup animated-delay-5\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"animated-bg-secondary animated-centerize\">\n                                        <span class=\"animated-scaleme animated-delay-5\">W</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"animated-black animated-growup animated-delay-5\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm md:text-base leading-normal px-2 sm:px-0\"\n                            style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, sans-serif; color: #1F1F1F; font-style: normal;\">\n                            Learn more about our professional visual services including LED walls, video mapping,\n                            projection design, and AV production for your next <a href=\"../../corporate-events.html\"\n                                class=\"underline\" style=\"color: #FF4F4F;\">corporate event</a>, <a\n                                href=\"../../holiday-party.html\" class=\"underline\" style=\"color: #FF4F4F;\">holiday\n                                party</a>, concert, or\n                            <a href=\"../tradeshow-booth.html\" class=\"underline\" style=\"color: #FF4F4F;\">trade show</a>.\n                            Click the button\n                            below to email us and connect with our expert visual production team today.\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-center mt-2 sm:mt-3 px-2 sm:px-0\">\n                            <a href=\"#hero\" class=\"super-button\" style=\"margin-top: 0; width: 100%; max-width: 300px;\">\n                                <span>Learn More Now</span>\n                                <span class=\"arrow\">\n                                    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                                        <path d=\"M5 12H19M19 12L15 8M19 12L15 16\" stroke=\"currentColor\"\n                                            stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n                                    </svg>\n                                </span>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Brochure Modal -->\n    <div id=\"brochureModal\" class=\"brochure-modal\" aria-labelledby=\"visual-brochure-title\" role=\"dialog\"\n        aria-modal=\"true\">\n        <div class=\"brochure-modal-content\">\n            <button onclick=\"closeVisualBrochureModal()\" class=\"brochure-close-button\"\n                aria-label=\"Close Visual brochure\">\n                <svg class=\"w-6 h-6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                    <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12\">\n                    </path>\n                </svg>\n            </button>\n\n            <div id=\"brochureLoader\" class=\"fixed inset-0 flex items-center justify-center z-[10000]\"\n                style=\"background-color: rgba(10, 3, 33, 0.85);\">\n                <div class=\"text-center\">\n                    <div class=\"inline-block relative w-16 h-16\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-full border-4\"\n                            style=\"border-color: rgba(255, 79, 79, 0.3);\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-full border-4 border-transparent animate-spin\"\n                            style=\"border-top-color: #FF4F4F;\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 text-white text-lg font-medium\">Loading Visual Guide...</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <iframe id=\"brochureIframe\" class=\"brochure-iframe\" allowfullscreen loading=\"eager\"\n                sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <script src=\"../../assets/components/navigation.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"../../assets/components/footer.js\"></script>\n    <script>\n        // Brochure Modal Functions\n        function openVisualBrochureModal() {\n            const modal = document.getElementById(\'brochureModal\');\n            const iframe = document.getElementById(\'brochureIframe\');\n            const loader = document.getElementById(\'brochureLoader\');\n\n            if (!modal || !iframe) return;\n\n            modal.classList.add(\'show\');\n            document.body.style.overflow = \'hidden\';\n            if (loader) loader.style.display = \'flex\';\n\n            const timestamp = new Date().getTime();\n            iframe.src = \'../../flipbook/examples/audio-visual.html?t=\' + timestamp;\n\n            setTimeout(() => iframe.focus(), 120);\n        }\n\n        function closeVisualBrochureModal() {\n            const modal = document.getElementById(\'brochureModal\');\n            const iframe = document.getElementById(\'brochureIframe\');\n            const loader = document.getElementById(\'brochureLoader\');\n\n            if (!modal || !iframe) return;\n\n            modal.classList.remove(\'show\');\n            document.body.style.overflow = \'\';\n            iframe.src = \'about:blank\';\n            if (loader) loader.style.display = \'none\';\n        }\n\n        window.addEventListener(\'message\', function (event) {\n            if (event.data === \'flipbookLoaded\') {\n                const loader = document.getElementById(\'brochureLoader\');\n                if (loader) loader.style.display = \'none\';\n            }\n        });\n\n        document.addEventListener(\'keydown\', (e) => {\n            if (e.key === \'Escape\') {\n                const modal = document.getElementById(\'brochureModal\');\n                if (modal && modal.classList.contains(\'show\')) {\n                    closeVisualBrochureModal();\n                }\n            }\n        });\n    </script>\n    <script type=\"module\">\n        import Grid1Background from \'https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/threejs-components@0.0.16/build/backgrounds/grid1.cdn.min.js\';\n\n        document.addEventListener(\'DOMContentLoaded\', function () {\n            const canvas = document.getElementById(\'brochure-webgl-canvas\');\n            if (!canvas) return;\n\n            try {\n                const bg = Grid1Background(canvas);\n                if (bg && bg.grid) {\n                    bg.grid.setColors([0xFF4F4F, 0xe63939, 0x18F1E1]);\n                    if (bg.grid.light1) {\n                        bg.grid.light1.color.set(0xFF4F4F);\n                        bg.grid.light1.intensity = 900;\n                    }\n                    if (bg.grid.light2) {\n                        bg.grid.light2.color.set(0x18F1E1);\n                        bg.grid.light2.intensity = 400;\n                    }\n                }\n            } catch (error) {\n                console.warn(\'Could not load brochure background:\', error);\n            }\n        });\n\n        // Email button functionality\n        document.addEventListener(\'DOMContentLoaded\', function () {\n            const emailButton = document.getElementById(\'email-button\');\n            const emailLabel = document.querySelector(\'label[for=\"email-button\"]\');\n\n            if (emailLabel) {\n                emailLabel.addEventListener(\'click\', function (e) {\n                    // Open email client\n                    window.location.href = \'mailto:info@mihientertainment.com\';\n                });\n            }\n\n            // Smooth scroll to hero section for \"Learn More Now\" button\n            const learnMoreButton = document.querySelector(\'a[href=\"#hero\"]\');\n            if (learnMoreButton) {\n                learnMoreButton.addEventListener(\'click\', function (e) {\n                    e.preventDefault();\n                    const heroSection = document.getElementById(\'hero\');\n                    if (heroSection) {\n                        heroSection.scrollIntoView({ behavior: \'smooth\', block: \'start\' });\n                    }\n                });\n            }\n        });\n    </script>\n    <!-- Load Back to Top Component -->\n    <script src=\"../../assets/components/back-to-top.js\"></script>\n\n</body>', NULL, 'published', NULL, '2025-12-14 00:30:10', '2025-12-14 00:30:10');
INSERT INTO `pages` (`id`, `title`, `slug`, `content_html`, `custom_css`, `status`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(9, 'Ai Driven Event Trends For 2025 How Mihi Stays Ahead', 'post-ai-driven-event-trends-for-2025-how-mihi-stays-ahead', '<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>vrgyhty87 - My Blog</title>\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"cefghj98iugrter\">\n    <meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"wfd5r65756\">\n    <meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\">\n    <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"\">\n    \n    <!-- Open Graph -->\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"AI-Driven Event Trends for 2025: How MiHi Stays Ahead\">\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"\">\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\">\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"\">\n    \n    <!-- Twitter Card -->\n    <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n    <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"AI-Driven Event Trends for 2025: How MiHi Stays Ahead\">\n    <meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"\">\n    \n    <!-- Structured Data (JSON-LD) -->\n    <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n    {\n        \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n        \"@type\": \"BlogPosting\",\n        \"headline\": \"AI-Driven Event Trends for 2025: How MiHi Stays Ahead\",\n        \"description\": \"cefghj98iugrter\",\n        \"author\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Person\",\n            \"name\": \"Administrator\"\n        },\n        \"datePublished\": \"2025-12-12T03:30:00+00:00\",\n        \"dateModified\": \"2025-12-12T11:32:11+00:00\",\n        \"articleSection\": \"360 Video Booth\",\n        \"publisher\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n            \"name\": \"My Blog\"\n        }\n    }\n    </script>\n    \n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"../assets/css/style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n    <header class=\"site-header\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h1 class=\"site-title\"><a href=\"http://localhost/cms\">My Blog</a></h1>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n    \n    <main class=\"container\">\n        <article class=\"post-single\">\n            <header class=\"post-header\">\n                <span class=\"post-category\">\n                    <a href=\"http://localhost/cms/category.php?slug=360-video-booth\">\n                        360 Video Booth\n                    </a>\n                </span>\n                \n                <h1 class=\"post-title\">AI-Driven Event Trends for 2025: How MiHi Stays Ahead</h1>\n                \n                <div class=\"post-meta\">\n                    <span>By Administrator</span>\n                    <span>•</span>\n                    <span>December 12, 2025</span>\n                </div>\n            </header>\n            \n            <div class=\"post-content\">\n                <h2>AI-Driven Event Trends for 2025: How MiHi Stays Ahead</h2><ul><li>Jeff Libby</li><li>Jan 3</li><li>3 min read</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>At MiHi, staying at the forefront of event trends isn’t just about keeping up; it’s about leading the way. With AI as a key part of our strategy, we’ve been able to transform how we plan, market, and execute events. From understanding seasonal trends to optimizing campaign timing, AI empowers us to streamline our processes and focus on creating truly impactful experiences for our clients. As someone deeply involved in this process, I’ve seen how harnessing AI’s capabilities allows us to bring innovation and precision to everything we do.</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Keeping a Pulse on Event Trends Throughout the Year</strong>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;</h2><p>Event trends are constantly evolving, often influenced by the time of year, cultural moments, and shifting client needs. At MiHi, we’ve always been highly attuned to these changes, using our expertise to align our offerings with seasonal opportunities. For example, summer is the perfect time for outdoor activations like The Fort, while winter calls for immersive, cozy experiences like our Ski Lift and Snow Globe photo booths. However, staying on top of these trends can be a complex and time-intensive process.</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p>AI changes the game by analyzing historical data, industry reports, and audience behavior to predict what will resonate most during any given season. It doesn’t just confirm what we already know; it uncovers new opportunities we might not have considered. By staying ahead of the curve, we’re able to continually refine our offerings and ensure that we’re delivering exactly what clients and their audiences want, when they want it.</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Optimizing Marketing Timing with AI</strong>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;</h2><p>When it comes to marketing, timing is everything. Even the most creative campaign can fall flat if it doesn’t reach the audience at the right moment. That’s where AI proves invaluable. By analyzing data from past campaigns, AI identifies patterns and pinpoints the best times to launch promotions for maximum impact. For instance, it might reveal that early spring is the ideal window to promote summer activations or that holiday campaigns should roll out earlier than expected to secure prime bookings.</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p>This level of precision allows us to focus our energy where it matters most: on crafting campaigns that truly connect with our audience. Instead of relying on guesswork or spending hours sifting through spreadsheets, we can trust the data to guide our efforts. AI ensures that every campaign is timed to perfection, helping us maximize engagement and deliver results for our clients.</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Streamlining the Planning Process</strong>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;</h2><p>One of the most transformative aspects of AI is how it simplifies the planning process. At MiHi, we deal with a massive amount of data, from past event performance metrics to trend forecasts and client feedback. Organizing and analyzing all of this information manually would take countless hours, but AI does it in moments. It compiles everything into a clear, actionable roadmap, giving us the insights we need to hit the ground running.</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p>This automation allows us to shift our focus from administrative tasks to more impactful work. Instead of spending time laying out marketing schedules or digging through data, our team can dive straight into the creative process. This not only saves time but also ensures that our energy is directed toward designing innovative activations and refining client experiences. AI doesn’t just make things easier—it makes them better, empowering us to push boundaries and stay ahead of the competition.</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>A Future Driven by Data and Creativity</strong>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;</h2><p>As we move into 2025, it’s clear that the event\'s industry is becoming increasingly driven by data and technology. At MiHi, we’re embracing this shift while staying true to our creative roots. AI gives us the tools to work smarter, not harder, enabling us to focus on what we do best: delivering unforgettable experiences. By combining AI’s organizational power with our team’s creativity and expertise, we’re redefining what’s possible in the world of events.</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p>This is just the beginning. With AI as a core part of our strategy, MiHi is poised to lead the way in innovation, setting new standards for how trends are identified, campaigns are executed, and experiences are brought to life. Together, technology and imagination are opening up a world of possibilities—and I couldn’t be more excited for what’s ahead.</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/a92b01_159aee41e42b4995b00d035cc9dca820~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_350,h_175,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/a92b01_159aee41e42b4995b00d035cc9dca820~mv2.png\" alt=\"ree\" width=\"350\" height=\"175\"></p><p><br>&nbsp;</p>\n            </div>\n        </article>\n        \n        <nav class=\"post-navigation\">\n            <a href=\"http://localhost/cms/blog.php\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\">← Back to Blog</a>\n        </nav>\n    </main>\n    \n    <footer class=\"site-footer\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <p>&copy; 2025 My Blog. All rights reserved.</p>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n</body>\n</html>', NULL, 'published', NULL, '2025-12-14 00:30:10', '2025-12-14 00:30:10'),
(10, 'Elevate Your Events With Mihi Entertainment Where Memories Come To Life', 'post-elevate-your-events-with-mihi-entertainment-where-memories-come-to-life', '<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>🎭 Elevate Your Events with Mihi Entertainment: Where Memories Come to Life | My Blog</title>\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"🎭 Elevate Your Events with Mihi Entertainment: Where Memories Come to Life\">\n    <meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"#MihiEntertainment #EventEntertainment #LiveMusic #DJServices #WeddingEntertainment #CorporateEvents #PartyPlanning #LivePerformances #EntertainmentCompany #EventPlanning #MemorableEvents #ProfessionalEntertainers\">\n    <meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\">\n    <meta name=\"author\" content=\"Administrator\">\n    <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"\">\n    <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" href=\"../assets/images/favicon.svg\">\n    \n    <!-- Open Graph -->\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"🎭 Elevate Your Events with Mihi Entertainment: Where Memories Come to Life\">\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"\">\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\">\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"\">\n    \n    <!-- Twitter Card -->\n    <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n    <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"🎭 Elevate Your Events with Mihi Entertainment: Where Memories Come to Life\">\n    <meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"\">\n    \n    <!-- Structured Data (JSON-LD) -->\n    <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n    {\n        \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n        \"@type\": \"BlogPosting\",\n        \"headline\": \"🎭 Elevate Your Events with Mihi Entertainment: Where Memories Come to Life\",\n        \"description\": \"🎭 Elevate Your Events with Mihi Entertainment: Where Memories Come to Life\",\n        \"author\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Person\",\n            \"name\": \"Administrator\"\n        },\n        \"datePublished\": \"2025-12-12T23:03:00+00:00\",\n        \"dateModified\": \"2025-12-13T07:12:16+00:00\",\n        \"articleSection\": \"360 Video Booth\",\n        \"publisher\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n            \"name\": \"My Blog\",\n            \"logo\": {\n                \"@type\": \"ImageObject\",\n                \"url\": \"/../assets/images/logo.png\"\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    </script>\n    \n    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    \n    <!-- Google Fonts -->\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800;900&family=Montserrat:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    \n    <style>\n        html, body {\n            overflow-x: hidden;\n            width: 100%;\n        }\n        \n        body {\n            font-family: \'Inter\', sans-serif;\n            color: #1a202c;\n            padding-top: 80px; /* Space for fixed header */\n        }\n        \n        h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6 {\n            font-family: \'Montserrat\', sans-serif;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n        }\n        \n        .post-content {\n            font-size: 1.125rem;\n            line-height: 1.75;\n            color: #374151;\n        }\n        \n        .post-content p {\n            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n        }\n        \n        .post-content img {\n            max-width: 100%;\n            height: auto;\n            border-radius: 0.5rem;\n            margin: 2rem 0;\n        }\n        \n        .post-content h2 {\n            font-size: 2rem;\n            margin-top: 3rem;\n            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n            color: #1f2937;\n        }\n        \n        .post-content h3 {\n            font-size: 1.5rem;\n            margin-top: 2rem;\n            margin-bottom: 1rem;\n            color: #374151;\n        }\n        \n        .post-content a {\n            color: #0050ff;\n            text-decoration: underline;\n        }\n        \n        .post-content a:hover {\n            color: #0040d9;\n        }\n        \n        .post-content ul, .post-content ol {\n            margin: 1.5rem 0;\n            padding-left: 2rem;\n        }\n        \n        .post-content li {\n            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n        }\n        \n        .post-content blockquote {\n            border-left: 4px solid #0050ff;\n            padding-left: 1.5rem;\n            margin: 2rem 0;\n            font-style: italic;\n            color: #6b7280;\n        }\n        \n        .category-badge {\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 80, 255, 0.1), rgba(139, 111, 71, 0.1));\n            border-radius: 9999px;\n            font-size: 0.875rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: #0050ff;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n        }\n        \n        .category-badge:hover {\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 80, 255, 0.2), rgba(139, 111, 71, 0.2));\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n        }\n        \n        .tag-badge {\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 0.375rem 0.875rem;\n            background: #f3f4f6;\n            border-radius: 0.5rem;\n            font-size: 0.875rem;\n            color: #6b7280;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n            margin-right: 0.5rem;\n            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n        }\n        \n        .tag-badge:hover {\n            background: #e5e7eb;\n            color: #0050ff;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-gray-50\">\n    <!-- Navigation will be loaded by navigation.js -->\n    <script src=\"../assets/components/navigation.js\"></script>\n    \n    <!-- Hero Section -->\n    <section class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 via-white to-purple-50 py-12 md:py-20\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-4xl\">\n            <div class=\"text-center mb-8\">\n                <a href=\"../blog.php?category=360-video-booth\" class=\"category-badge\">\n                        360 Video Booth\n                </a>\n            </div>\n                \n            <h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 leading-tight\">\n                🎭 Elevate Your Events with Mihi Entertainment: Where Memories Come to Life\n            </h1>\n                \n            <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4 text-gray-600 mb-8\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                    <svg class=\"w-5 h-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                        <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z\"></path>\n                    </svg>\n                    <span class=\"font-medium\">Administrator</span>\n                </div>\n                    <span>•</span>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                    <svg class=\"w-5 h-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                        <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M8 7V3m8 4V3m-9 8h10M5 21h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z\"></path>\n                    </svg>\n                    <span>December 12, 2025</span>\n                </div>\n                </div>\n            <div class=\"mb-8 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl\">\n                <img src=\"http://localhost/mihi-entertainment/uploads/images/thumb_693ca098b96ad.jpg\" alt=\"🎭 Elevate Your Events with Mihi Entertainment: Where Memories Come to Life\" class=\"w-full h-auto\">\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n            \n    <!-- Main Content -->\n    <main class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-4xl py-12\">\n        <article class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-8 md:p-12\">\n            <div class=\"post-content prose prose-lg max-w-none\">\n                <h2><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\">Introduction: The Magic of Exceptional Entertainment</span></h2>\r\n<p>When it comes to creating unforgettable moments, entertainment is the heartbeat of every successful event. At&nbsp;<strong>Mihi Entertainment</strong>, we believe that every celebration deserves to be extraordinary&mdash;filled with energy, emotion, and experiences that guests will talk about for years to come.</p>\r\n<p>Whether you\'re planning an intimate wedding, a high-energy corporate gala, a birthday bash, or a community festival,&nbsp;<strong>Mihi Entertainment</strong>&nbsp;is here to transform your vision into reality.</p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h2>🌟 What Makes Mihi Entertainment Different?</h2>\r\n<h3>1.&nbsp;<strong>Tailored Entertainment Solutions</strong></h3>\r\n<p>We don\'t believe in one-size-fits-all. Every event is unique, and so are our entertainment packages. From selecting the perfect DJ to curating live band performances, we customize every detail to match your theme, audience, and budget.</p>\r\n<h3>2.&nbsp;<strong>Professional &amp; Experienced Team</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Our roster features talented performers, seasoned DJs, engaging MCs, and creative artists who bring passion and professionalism to every performance. With years of experience in the entertainment industry, we know how to read the room and keep the energy flowing.</p>\r\n<h3>3.&nbsp;<strong>End-to-End Event Entertainment</strong></h3>\r\n<p>From the first consultation to the final encore, Mihi Entertainment handles everything:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>🎵 Live Music &amp; Bands</li>\r\n<li>🎧 Professional DJ Services</li>\r\n<li>🎤 MC &amp; Hosting Services</li>\r\n<li>💃 Dancers &amp; Performers</li>\r\n<li>🎪 Themed Entertainment Acts</li>\r\n<li>🎥 Audio-Visual Production</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>4.&nbsp;<strong>Cutting-Edge Technology</strong></h3>\r\n<p>We invest in the latest sound systems, lighting equipment, and stage production technology to ensure your event looks and sounds spectacular.</p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h2>🎉 Our Services</h2>\r\n<h3><strong>Wedding Entertainment</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Make your big day magical with romantic live music, energetic DJ sets for the reception, and seamless coordination that keeps your celebration flowing beautifully.</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Corporate Events</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Impress clients and motivate employees with professional entertainment that reflects your brand\'s personality&mdash;from elegant background music to high-energy performances.</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Private Parties</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Birthdays, anniversaries, graduations&mdash;whatever you\'re celebrating, we bring the fun with customized playlists, interactive entertainment, and unforgettable performances.</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Festivals &amp; Community Events</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Large-scale events require large-scale talent. Our team has the experience and resources to deliver entertainment that captivates crowds of any size.</p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h2>💬 What Our Clients Say</h2>\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<p><em>\"Mihi Entertainment made our wedding absolutely perfect! The band was incredible, and our guests couldn\'t stop dancing. Highly recommended!\"</em><br>&mdash;&nbsp;<strong>Sarah &amp; James T.</strong></p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<p><em>\"Professional, punctual, and incredibly talented. Our corporate event was a huge success thanks to Mihi Entertainment.\"</em><br>&mdash;&nbsp;<strong>Michael R., Event Manager</strong></p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h2>📅 Ready to Create Something Amazing?</h2>\r\n<p>Your next event deserves entertainment that leaves a lasting impression. Let&nbsp;<strong>Mihi Entertainment</strong>&nbsp;be your partner in creating moments that matter.</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Contact Us Today!</strong></h3>\r\n<p>📞&nbsp;<strong>Phone:</strong>&nbsp;[Your Phone Number]<br>📧&nbsp;<strong>Email:</strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:info@mihientertainment.com\">info@mihientertainment.com</a><br>🌐&nbsp;<strong>Website:</strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.mihientertainment.com/\">www.mihientertainment.com</a><br>📍&nbsp;<strong>Location:</strong>&nbsp;[Your City/Region]</p>\r\n<p><strong>Follow us on Social Media:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Instagram: @mihientertainment</li>\r\n<li>Facebook: /mihientertainment</li>\r\n<li>Twitter: @mihientertain</li>\r\n<li>YouTube: Mihi Entertainment Official</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><img src=\"../uploads/images/img_693c9fe8462f7.jpg\"></p>\n            </div>\n        </article>\n        \n        <!-- Navigation -->\n        <nav class=\"mt-12 flex justify-center\">\n            <a href=\"../blog.php\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 bg-gray-100 hover:bg-gray-200 text-gray-700 rounded-full font-semibold transition-all duration-300 transform hover:scale-105\">\n                <svg class=\"w-5 h-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                    <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18\"></path>\n                </svg>\n                Back to Blog\n            </a>\n        </nav>\n    </main>\n    \n    <!-- Footer will be loaded by footer.js -->\n    <script src=\"../assets/components/footer.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>', NULL, 'published', NULL, '2025-12-14 00:30:10', '2025-12-14 00:30:10');
