on features traditional Old West styling, while our neon option adds vibrant lighting for a modern twist. Both styles are highly versatile and create memorable photo moments.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"Can I pair the saloon doors with other props or decorations?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"Absolutely. Our saloon door photo booth sets are highly versatile and pair perfectly with various Western-themed props and decorations such as hay bales, barrels, string lights, and other rustic elements. You can create a complete Western look or keep it simple for understated elegance. Our team can help you design the perfect setup for your event theme.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"Do you provide setup and delivery for saloon door photo booth rentals?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"Yes, we provide professional delivery, setup, and breakdown services for all our saloon door photo booth set rentals. Our experienced team ensures everything is properly installed and configured for your event, so you can focus on enjoying your celebration. Contact us for details about delivery areas and setup requirements.\"\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n    </script>\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"bg-white\">\n    <div id=\"nav-placeholder\"></div>\n\n    <main>\n        <!-- Hero Section -->\n        <section id=\"hero\"\n            class=\"relative min-h-[90vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden animated-gradient-western\"\n            aria-label=\"Saloon Door Photo Booth Set Hero Section\">\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0\"\n                style=\"background-image: url(\'../../assets/images/saloon-door/saloon-door-hero.webp\'); background-size: cover; background-position: center; background-repeat