 Stylish Flair\n                            </h2>\n                            <p class=\"text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed\">\n                                Our <a href=\"saloon-door-photo-set.html\"\n                                    class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 underline\">Saloon Door Photo Set</a> adds a\n                                rustic and stylish flair to your event, transporting guests straight to the Wild West.\n                                Whether you\'re hosting a Western-themed party, a <a href=\"../../corporate-events.html\"\n                                    class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 underline\">corporate event</a> with a\n                                twist, or looking to create a unique photo opportunity, this <a\n                                    href=\"saloon-door-photo-set.html\"\n                                    class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 underline\">saloon door photo booth</a>\n                                provides the perfect ambiance.\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed\">\n                                Crafted with intricate details and authentic design, our <a\n                                    href=\"saloon-door-photo-set.html\"\n                                    class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 underline\">saloon doors</a> are an instant\n                                hit for creating memorable photo moments at <a href=\"../../wedding.html\"\n                                    class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 underline\">weddings</a> and celebrations.\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed\">\n                                Not only are our <a href=\"saloon-door-photo-set.html\"\n                                    class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 underline\">saloon door photo sets</a>\n                                visually stunning, but they\'re also highly versatile, blending seamlessly with various\n                                event themes. Pair them with hay bales, barrels, or string lights to complete the\n                                Western look, or keep it simple for a touch of understated elegance.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl\">\n                            <div class=\"aspect-[4/3] carousel-container\" data-carousel=\"carousel-1\">\n                                <div class=\"carousel-slide active\">\n                                    <img src=\"../../assets/images/saloon-door/saloon-door-1.webp\"\n                                        alt=\"Rustic Western saloon door photo booth set with authentic wood textures and swinging panels at a wedding event\"\n                                        loading=\"lazy\">\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"carousel-slide\">\n                                    <img src=\"../../assets/images/saloon-door/saloon-door-2.webp\"\n                                        alt=\"Saloon door photo booth rental creating memorable moments with guests at a corporate event\"\n                                        loading=\"lazy\">\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"carousel-slide\">\n                                    <img src=\"../../assets/images/saloon-door/saloon-door-3.webp\"\n                                        alt=\"Western-themed saloon door photo set with classic charm and vintage styling for party celebrations\"\n                                        loading=\"lazy\">\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Rustic Western Saloon Doors Section -->\n        <section class=\"section-padding bg-gradient-to-b from-amber-50 to-white\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\">\n                <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto\">\n                    <div class=\"text-center mb-16\">\n                        <h2\n                            class=\"text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold mb-6 bg-gradient-to-r from-gray-900 via-amber-700 to-gray-900 bg-clip-text text-transparent\">\n                            RUSTIC WESTERN SALOON DOORS\n                        </h2>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center\">\n                        <div class=\"relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl order-2 md:order-1\">\n                            <img src=\"../../assets/images/saloon-door/saloon-door-4.webp\"\n                                alt=\"Classic rustic Western saloon door photo booth with authentic wood textures and Old West charm\"\n                                loading=\"lazy\" class=\"aspect-[4/3] w-full h-full object-cover\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"order-1 md:order-2\">\n                            <h3 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6 text-gray-900\">\n                                Classic Western Charm\n                            </h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed\">\n                                Our classic <a href=\"saloon-door-photo-set.html\"\n                                    class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 underline\">saloon doors</a> feature\n                                authentic wood textures, bold hardware, and classic swinging panels. These iconic doors\n                                bring a timeless Western charm to your event, making guests feel like they\'re stepping\n                                into a saloon straight out of the Old West.\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed\">\n                                Perfect for themed parties, <a href=\"../../wedding.html\"\n                                    class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 underline\">weddings</a>, or <a\n                                    href=\"../../corporate-events.html\"\n                                    class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 underline\">corporate activations</a>,\n                                they\'re a stylish way to set the scene.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Neon Saloon Doors Section -->\n        <section class=\"section-padding bg-white\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\">\n                <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto\">\n                    <div class=\"text-center mb-16\">\n                        <h2\n                            class=\"text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold mb-6 bg-gradient-to-r from-gray-900 via-amber-700 to-gray-900 bg-clip-text text-transparent\">\n                            NEON SALOON DOORS: A FUTURISTIC TWIST\n                        </h2>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center\">\n                        <div>\n                            <h3 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6 text-gray-900\">\n                                Modern Meets Classic\n                            </h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed\">\n                                Take your Western-themed event to the next level with our <a\n                                    href=\"saloon-door-photo-set.html\"\n                                    class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 underline\">Neon Saloon Doors</a>. By adding\n                                dynamic neon lights to the classic design, we\'ve created a modern, eye-catching twist on\n                                a beloved classic.\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed\">\n                                These glowing doors add vibrant color and energy, perfect for night events, tech-forward\n                                <a href=\"../../corporate-events.html\"\n                                    class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 underline\">corporate activations</a>, or\n                                anyone looking to blend the old with the new.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl\">\n                            <img src=\"../../assets/images/saloon-door/saloon-door-5.webp\"\n                                alt=\"Neon saloon door photo booth set with vibrant lighting creating modern twist on classic Western design\"\n                                loading=\"lazy\" class=\"aspect-[4/3] w-full h-full object-cover\">\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Features Grid -->\n        <section class=\"section-padding bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-amber-50\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\">\n                <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\">\n                    <div class=\"text-center mb-16\">\n                        <span\n                            class=\"inline-block px-6 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-600 to-orange-600 text-white rounded-full text-sm font-semibold mb-6 shadow-lg\">FEATURES</span>\n                        <h2\n                            class=\"text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold mb-6 bg-gradient-to-r from-gray-900 via-amber-700 to-gray-900 bg-clip-text text-transparent\">\n                            What Makes It Special\n                        </h2>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\">\n                        <div\n                            class=\"text-center p-8 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 to-orange-50 border border-amber-200\">\n                            <div class=\"feature-icon mx-auto\">\n                                <svg class=\"w-8 h-8 text-white\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                    <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"\n                                        d=\"M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4\">\n                                    </path>\n                                </svg>\n                            </div>\n                            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-gray-900\">Authentic Design</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Crafted with intricate details and authentic wood textures</p>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div\n                            class=\"text-center p-8 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 to-orange-50 border border-amber-200\">\n                            <div class=\"feature-icon mx-auto\">\n                                <svg class=\"w-8 h-8 text-white\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                    <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"\n                                        d=\"M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z\">\n                                    </path>\n                                </svg>\n                            </div>\n                            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-gray-900\">Classic Swinging Panels</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Iconic swinging doors that bring the Old West to life</p>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div\n                            class=\"text-center p-8 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 to-orange-50 border border-amber-200\">\n                            <div class=\"feature-icon mx-auto\">\n                                <svg class=\"w-8 h-8 text-white\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                    <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"\n                                        d=\"M12 6V4m0 2a2 2 0 100 4m0-4a2 2 0 110 4m-6 8a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4m6 6v10m6-2a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4\">\n                                    </path>\n                                </svg>\n                            </div>\n                            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-gray-900\">Highly Versatile</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Blends seamlessly with various event themes and styles</p>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div\n                            class=\"text-center p-8 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 to-orange-50 border border-amber-200\">\n                            <div class=\"feature-icon mx-auto\">\n                                <svg class=\"w-8 h-8 text-white\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                    <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"\n                                        d=\"M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z\">\n                                    </path>\n                                </svg>\n                            </div>\n                            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-gray-900\">Neon Option Available</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Dynamic neon lights for a modern, eye-catching twist</p>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div\n                            class=\"text-center p-8 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 to-orange-50 border border-amber-200\">\n                            <div class=\"feature-icon mx-auto\">\n                                <svg class=\"w-8 h-8 text-white\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                    <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"\n                                        d=\"M4 16l4.586-4.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L16 16m-2-2l1.586-1.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L20 14m-6-6h.01M6 20h12a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z\">\n                                    </path>\n                                </svg>\n                            </div>\n                            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-gray-900\">Memorable Moments</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Creates immersive experiences guests won\'t stop talking about</p>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div\n                            class=\"text-center p-8 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 to-orange-50 border border-amber-200\">\n                            <div class=\"feature-icon mx-auto\">\n                                <svg class=\"w-8 h-8 text-white\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                    <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"\n                                        d=\"M7 21a4 4 0 01-4-4V5a2 2 0 012-2h4a2 2 0 012 2v12a4 4 0 01-4 4zm0 0h12a2 2 0 002-2v-4a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2.343M11 7.343l1.657-1.657a2 2 0 012.828 0l2.829 2.829a2 2 0 010 2.828l-8.486 8.485M7 17h.01\">\n                                    </path>\n                                </svg>\n                            </div>\n                            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-gray-900\">Perfect Pairing Options</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Pair with hay bales, barrels, or string lights for complete Western\n                                look</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- CTA Section -->\n        <section class=\"section-padding animated-gradient-western relative overflow-hidden\">\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/50\"></div>\n            <div class=\"relative z-10 container mx-auto px-6\">\n                <div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6 text-white\">NEED HELP BOOKING?</h2>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-8 text-amber-200\">WE\'RE HERE FOR YOU!</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-xl mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-white/95\">\n                        Ready to bring the Wild West to your <a href=\"../../wedding.html\"\n                            class=\"text-amber-300 hover:text-amber-200 underline\">wedding</a> or <a\n                            href=\"../../corporate-events.html\"\n                            class=\"text-amber-300 hover:text-amber-200 underline\">corporate event</a>? Contact us today\n                        to get pricing and discuss which <a href=\"saloon-door-photo-set.html\"\n                            class=\"text-amber-300 hover:text-amber-200 underline\">saloon door photo booth style</a>\n                        works best for your occasion.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center items-center\">\n                        <a href=\"mailto:info@mihientertainment.com\" id=\"contact\"\n                            class=\"inline-block bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-gray-900 px-10 py-5 rounded-full text-lg font-bold shadow-2xl hover:shadow-amber-500/50 transition-all duration-500 transform hover:scale-110 hover:-translate-y-1\"\n                            aria-label=\"Email us for saloon door photo booth set rental\">\n                            Get Your Quote\n                        </a>\n                        <button type=\"button\" data-click-to-call data-call-text=\"Call Us\"\n                            class=\"group inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-10 py-5 rounded-full text-lg font-bold backdrop-blur-md bg-white/10 border-2 border-amber-400/50 hover:bg-white/20 hover:border-amber-400/70 shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-500 transform hover:scale-110 hover:-translate-y-1 text-white cursor-pointer\"\n                            aria-label=\"Call us for saloon door photo booth set rental\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-5 h-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n                                aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\n                                    d=\"M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498A1 1 0 0121 17.72V21a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 23 3 16.284 3 8V7a2 2 0 012-2z\" />\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Call Us</span>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n\n    <div id=\"footer-placeholder\"></div>\n\n    <script src=\"../../assets/components/navigation.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"../../assets/components/footer.js\"></script>\n    <script>\n        // Carousel functionality\n        document.addEventListener(\'DOMContentLoaded\', function () {\n            const carousels = document.querySelectorAll(\'.carousel-container\');\n\n            carousels.forEach(function (carousel) {\n                const slides = carousel.querySelectorAll(\'.carousel-slide\');\n                let currentSlide = 0;\n\n                function showSlide(index) {\n                    slides.forEach(function (slide, i) {\n                        slide.classList.remove(\'active\');\n                        if (i === index) {\n                            slide.classList.add(\'active\');\n                        }\n                    });\n                }\n\n                function nextSlide() {\n                    currentSlide = (currentSlide + 1) % slides.length;\n                    showSlide(currentSlide);\n                }\n\n                // Start the carousel\n                setInterval(nextSlide, 3000); // Change slide every 3 seconds\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n    <!-- Load Back to Top Component -->\n    <script src=\"../../assets/components/back-to-top.js\"></script>\n\n</body>', NULL, 'published', NULL, '2025-12-14 00:30:10', '2025-12-14 00:30:10');
