me with the ski lift photo booth rental?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"Our ski lift photo booth set comes with onsite photo printing with custom designs, Boomerang/GIF options for animated memories, instant digital sharing capabilities, and an online gallery for high-quality photos accessible to all guests. We also offer a snow globe insert add-on option where photos can be inserted into a custom snow globe as a unique keepsake.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"Can the ski lift photo booth be customized?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"Yes, our ski lift photo booth set is fully customizable. At MiHi Entertainment, we don\'t believe in \'what you see is what you get.\' We work to ensure that, based on your preferences, everything can be customized to match your event\'s theme. The ski lift set produces an output that creates the authentic experience of being on the mountain, and we can discuss options for any specific customizations you\'d like to include.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What events are ski lift photo booths suitable for?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"The ski lift photo booth set is perfect for any event type, from weddings and corporate events to parties and celebrations. Its classic design looks great set up in any venue size, creating a timeless mountain-themed aesthetic that works well for winter weddings, holiday parties, corporate events, and seasonal celebrations.\"\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n    </script>\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"bg-white\">\n    <div id=\"nav-placeholder\"></div>\n\n    <main>\n        <!-- Hero Section -->\n        <section id=\"hero\"\n            class=\"relative min-h-[90vh] flex item