eptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"The white water raft photo booth features a full-sized inflatable raft designed to accommodate multiple guests. You can load up the raft with as many guests as you can fit, and our professional attendants will help ensure everyone gets in the shot and has a safe, fun experience.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What props are included with the white water raft photo booth?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"The white water raft photo booth comes with an abundance of rafting props including head gear, oars, glasses, life preservers, and more. All props are designed to enhance the adventure-themed photo experience and create fun, dynamic images. You can also request custom props to match your specific event theme.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"Are attendants provided with the white water raft photo booth?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"Yes, professional attendants are included with every white water raft photo booth rental. Our staff handles setup, provides safety monitoring, helps guests get into the raft carefully, ensures everyone gets in the shot, and assists with props throughout your event.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"Can the white water raft photo booth be customized?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"Yes, the white water raft photo booth is fully customizable. We offer custom photo layouts to match your event theme, custom props in addition to our standard rafting props, unlimited prints, and idle time options. Just let us know your preferences and we\'ll work with you to make the set perfect for you