</span>\n                </h1>\n                <p class=\"holiday-banner-description\">\n                    Bring your holiday event to life with MiHi Entertainment\'s custom photo sets and seasonal photo\n                    booths. Perfect for an office gathering, company celebration, community event, or family\n                    get-together, our personalized setups deliver festive cheer and create picture-perfect moments that\n                    guests will treasure—no matter what you celebrate.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Infinite Scrolling Carousel -->\n            <section class=\"block block-carousel\">\n                <ul class=\"carousel-items\">\n                    <li class=\"card\">\n                        <div class=\"image-content\">\n                            <img src=\"../assets/images/holiday/h5.jpg\"\n                                alt=\"Ski lift themed photo set for winter holiday events and office parties\" width=\"600\"\n                                height=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                        </div>\n                        <h3 style=\"font-family: \'Azo Sans Uber\', sans-serif; font-weight: 300;\">\n                            SKI LIFT PHOTO SET</h3>\n                        <p>Capture the charm of winter with our Ski Lift photo set, a set perfect addition to any\n                            holiday photo booth or office holiday party.</p>\n                        <a href=\"custom-sets/ski-lift-photo-set.html\" class=\"btn-card\"\n                            style=\"font-family: \'Azo Sans Uber\', sans-serif; font-weight: 300; color: #FF4F4F;\">Read\n                            More</a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"card\">\n                        <div class=\"image-content\">\n                            <img src=\"../assets/images/holiday/h6.avif\"\n                                alt=\"Ski goggle themed photo set for corporate holiday parties and wi