cepts to match your brand personality.</p>\n                                </div>\n                            </li>\n                            <li class=\"flex gap-3\">\n                                <div\n                                    class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-blue-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-blue-200 font-bold\">\n                                    3</div>\n                                <div>\n                                    <p class=\"font-semibold text-white\">Guest Experience Playbooks</p>\n                                    <p class=\"text-sm\">From queue engagement to share stations, see how we choreograph\n                                        laughter and share-worthy content.</p>\n                                </div>\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4\">\n                            <button onclick=\"openBrochureModal()\"\n                                class=\"group inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-semibold text-lg bg-[#FF4F4F] hover:bg-[#FF3838] text-white shadow-[0_20px_45px_-15px_rgba(255,79,79,0.75)] hover:shadow-[0_25px_60px_-18px_rgba(255,79,79,0.7)] transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:scale-105 focus:ring-4 focus:ring-[#FF4F4F]/40\"\n                                aria-label=\"Open interactive photobooth lookbook\">\n                                <svg class=\"w-6 h-6 mr-2 opacity-90 group-hover:opacity-100\" fill=\"none\"\n                                    stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                    <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"\n                                        d=\"M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832