tication and quality\n                            of our Lux Photography</p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Gallery Grid - Masonry Style -->\n                    <div class=\"gallery-grid-lux\">\n                        <div class=\"gallery-item-lux\" onclick=\"openLightbox(\'assets/images/lux/lux-1.webp\')\">\n                            <img src=\"assets/images/lux/lux-1.webp\" alt=\"Lux Photography Gallery - Image 1\"\n                                loading=\"lazy\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"gallery-item-lux\" onclick=\"openLightbox(\'assets/images/lux/lux-2.webp\')\">\n                            <img src=\"assets/images/lux/lux-2.webp\" alt=\"Lux Photography Gallery - Image 2\"\n                                loading=\"lazy\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"gallery-item-lux\" onclick=\"openLightbox(\'assets/images/lux/lux-3.webp\')\">\n                            <img src=\"assets/images/lux/lux-3.webp\" alt=\"Lux Photography Gallery - Image 3\"\n                                loading=\"lazy\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"gallery-item-lux\" onclick=\"openLightbox(\'assets/images/lux/lux-4.webp\')\">\n                            <img src=\"assets/images/lux/lux-4.webp\" alt=\"Lux Photography Gallery - Image 4\"\n                                loading=\"lazy\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"gallery-item-lux\" onclick=\"openLightbox(\'assets/images/lux/lux-5.webp\')\">\n                            <img src=\"assets/images/lux/lux-5.webp\" alt=\"Lux Photography Gallery - Image 5\"\n                                loading=\"lazy\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"gallery-item-lux\" onclick=\"openLightbox(\'assets/images/lux/lux-6.webp\')\">\n                            <img src=\"assets/images/lux/lux-6.webp\" alt=\"Lux Photography Gallery - Image 6\"\n                                loading=\"lazy\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"gallery-item-lux\" onclick=\"openLightbox(\'assets/images/lux/lux-7.webp\')\">\n                            <img src=\"assets/images/lux/lux-7.webp\" alt=\"Lux Photography Gallery - Image 7\"\n                                loading=\"lazy\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"gallery-item-lux\" onclick=\"openLightbox(\'assets/images/lux/lux-8.webp\')\">\n                            <img src=\"assets/images/lux/lux-8.webp\" alt=\"Lux Photography Gallery - Image 8\"\n                                loading=\"lazy\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"gallery-item-lux\" onclick=\"openLightbox(\'assets/images/lux/lux-9.webp\')\">\n                            <img src=\"assets/images/lux/lux-9.webp\" alt=\"Lux Photography Gallery - Image 9\"\n                                loading=\"lazy\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"gallery-item-lux gallery-item-hidden\"\n                            onclick=\"openLightbox(\'assets/images/lux/lux-10.webp\')\">\n                            <img src=\"assets/images/lux/lux-10.webp\" alt=\"Lux Photography Gallery - Image 10\"\n                                loading=\"lazy\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"gallery-item-lux gallery-item-hidden\"\n                            onclick=\"openLightbox(\'assets/images/lux/lux-11.webp\')\">\n                            <img src=\"assets/images/lux/lux-11.webp\" alt=\"Lux Photography Gallery - Image 11\"\n                                loading=\"lazy\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"gallery-item-lux gallery-item-hidden\"\n                            onclick=\"openLightbox(\'assets/images/lux/lux-12.webp\')\">\n                            <img src=\"assets/images/lux/lux-12.w