Photo Booth rental service - mobile photo booth experience that moves throughout your event venue\"\n                                    loading=\"lazy\"\n                                    class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"p-6\">\n                                <h4 class=\"text-xl mb-2 transition-colors uppercase\"\n                                    style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #FF4F4F; font-family: \'Azo Sans Uber\', sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;\">\n                                    ROAMING PHOTO BOOTH</h4>\n                                <p style=\"color: #1F1F1F; font-family: \'Azo Sans\', sans-serif;\">Mobile photo booth\n                                    experience that moves throughout your event</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </a>\n\n                        <!-- Virtual Photo Booth -->\n                        <a href=\"virtual-photo-booth.html\"\n                            class=\"group bg-white backdrop-blur-lg rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 hover:border-[#FF4F4F]/50 transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-105 shadow-lg\">\n                            <div class=\"aspect-video relative overflow-hidden\">\n                                <img src=\"../assets/images/virtual/virtual-1.webp\"\n                                    alt=\"Virtual Photo Booth rental with interactive digital photo experiences and virtual backgrounds for events\"\n                                    loading=\"lazy\"\n                                    class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"p-6\">\n                                <h4 class=\"text-xl mb-2 transition-colors uppercase\"\n                                    style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #FF4F4F; font-family: \'Azo Sans Uber\', sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;\">\n                                    VIRTUAL PHOTO BOOTH</h4>\n                                <p style=\"color: #1F1F1F; font-family: \'Azo Sans\', sans-serif;\">Interactive digital\n                                    photo experiences with virtual backgrounds</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Zoomable Image Lightbox -->\n        <div id=\"imageLightbox\"\n            class=\"fixed inset-0 z-50 hidden items-center justify-center bg-black/95 backdrop-blur-md\"\n            onclick=\"closeImageLightboxOnBackdrop(event)\">\n            <!-- Close Button -->\n            <button onclick=\"event.stopPropagation(); closeImageLightbox();\"\n                class=\"absolute top-4 right-4 z-[60] w-12 h-12 bg-slate-900/90 hover:bg-slate-800 text-[#18F1E1] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 transform hover:scale-110 border border-[#18F1E1]/40 cursor-pointer\">\n                <svg class=\"w-6 h-6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n                    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                    <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12\">\n                    </path>\n                </svg>\n            </button>\n\n            <!-- Navigation Arrows -->\n            <button onclick=\"event.stopPropagation(); navigateImage(-1);\"\n                class=\"absolute left-4 z-[60] w-12 h-12 bg-slate-900/90 hover:bg-slate-800 text-[#18F1E1] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 transform hover:scale-110 border border-[#18F1E1]/40 cursor-pointer\">\n                <svg class=\"w-6 h-6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n                    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                    <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M15 19l-7-7 7-7\"></path>\n                </svg>\n            </button>\n            <button onclick=\"event.stopPropagation(); navigateImage(1);\"\n                class=\"absolute right-4 z-[60] w-12 h-12 bg-slate-900/90 hover:bg-slate-800 text-[#18F1E1] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 transform hover:scale-110 border border-[#18F1E1]/40 cursor-pointer\">\n                <svg class=\"w-6 h-6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n                    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                    <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 5l7 7-7 7\"></path>\n                </svg>\n            </button>\n\n            <!-- Zoom Controls -->\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-4 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 z-[60] flex items-center gap-3 bg-slate-900/90 backdrop-blur-md rounded-full px-4 py-2 border border-[#18F1E1]/40 shadow-xl\"\n                onclick=\"event.stopPropagation();\">\n                <button onclick=\"event.stopPropagation(); zoomOut();\"\n                    class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-[#18F1E1] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-110 cursor-pointer\">\n                    <svg class=\"w-5 h-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n                        xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                        <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"\n                            d=\"M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0zM13 10H7\"></path>\n                    </svg>\n                </button>\n                <span id=\"zoomLevel\" class=\"text-[#18F1E1] font-mono text-sm min-w-[60px] text-center\">100%</span>\n                <button onclick=\"event.stopPropagation(); zoomIn();\"\n                    class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-[#18F1E1] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-110 cursor-pointer\">\n                    <svg class=\"w-5 h-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n                        xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                        <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"\n                            d=\"M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0zM10 7v6m3-3H7\"></path>\n                    </svg>\n                </button>\n                <button onclick=\"event.stopPropagation(); resetZoom();\"\n                    class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-[#18F1E1] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-110 cursor-pointer\">\n                    <svg class=\"w-5 h-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n                        xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                        <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"\n                            d=\"M4 4v5h.582m15.356 2A8.001 8.001 0 004.582 9m0 0H9m11 11v-5h-.581m0 0a8.003 8.003 0 01-15.357-2m15.357 2H15\">\n                        </path>\n                    </svg>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Image Container -->\n            <div class=\"relative w-full h-full flex items-center justify-center p-4 overflow-auto\" id=\"imageContainer\"\n                onclick=\"event.stopPropagation();\">\n                <img id=\"lightboxImage\" src=\"\" alt=\"Full View Image\"\n                    class=\"max-w-full max-h-full object-contain transition-transform duration-300 cursor-move select-none hidden\"\n                    style=\"transform: scale(1);\">\n                <video id=\"lightboxVideo\" src=\"\" controls class=\"max-w-full max-h-full object-contain hidden\"\n                    onclick=\"event.stopPropagation();\"></video>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Image Counter -->\n            <div\n                class=\"absolute top-4 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 z-[60] bg-slate-900/90 backdrop-blur-md text-[#18F1E1] px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-[#18F1E1]/40 shadow-xl font-mono text-sm\">\n                <span id=\"imageCounter\">1 / 13</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script src=\"../assets/components/footer.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"../assets/components/back-to-top.js\"></script>\n\n    <script>\n        // Image Gallery Array\n        const galleryImages = [\n            \'../assets/images/ai/ai-photo-booth-1.webp\',\n            \'../assets/images/ai/ai-photo-booth-2.webp\',\n            \'../assets/images/ai/ai-photo-booth-3.webp\',\n            \'../assets/images/ai/ai-photo-booth-4.webp\',\n            \'../assets/images/ai/ai-photo-booth-5.webp\',\n            \'../assets/images/ai/ai-photo-booth-6.webp\',\n            \'../assets/images/ai/ai-photo-booth-7.webp\',\n            \'../assets/images/ai/ai-photo-booth-8.webp\',\n            \'../assets/images/ai/ai-photo-booth-9.webp\',\n            \'../assets/images/ai/ai-photo-booth-10.webp\',\n            \'../assets/images/ai/ai-photo-booth-11.webp\',\n            \'../assets/images/ai/ai-photo-booth-3.webp\',\n            \'../assets/images/ai/ai-photo-booth-9.webp\'\n        ];\n\n        let currentImageIndex = 0;\n        let currentZoom = 1;\n        const minZoom = 0.5;\n        const maxZoom = 5;\n        const zoomStep = 0.25;\n\n        // Open lightbox\n        function openImageLightbox(imageSrc, index) {\n            currentImageIndex = index;\n            currentZoom = 1;\n            const lightbox = document.getElementById(\'imageLightbox\');\n            const lightboxImage = document.getElementById(\'lightboxImage\');\n            const lightboxVideo = document.getElementById(\'lightboxVideo\');\n            const imageCounter = document.getElementById(\'imageCounter\');\n\n            if (!lightbox || !lightboxImage || !imageCounter) {\n                console.error(\'Lightbox elements not found\');\n                return;\n            }\n\n            // Hide video, show image\n            if (lightboxVideo) {\n                lightboxVideo.classList.add(\'hidden\');\n                lightboxVideo.pause();\n                lightboxVideo.src = \'\';\n            }\n            lightboxImage.classList.remove(\'hidden\');\n\n            // Remove query parameters for full resolution\n            const cleanSrc = imageSrc.split(\'?\')[0];\n            lightboxImage.src = cleanSrc;\n            lightboxImage.style.transform = `scale(${currentZoom})`;\n            updateZoomLevel();\n\n            imageCounter.textContent = `${currentImageIndex + 1} / ${galleryImages.length}`;\n\n            lightbox.classList.remove(\'hidden\');\n            lightbox.classList.add(\'flex\');\n            document.body.style.overflow = \'hidden\';\n        }\n\n        // Open video lightbox\n        function openVideoLightbox(videoSrc, index) {\n            currentImageIndex = index;\n            currentZoom = 1;\n            const lightbox = document.getElementById(\'imageLightbox\');\n            const lightboxImage = document.getElementById(\'lightboxImage\');\n            const lightboxVideo = document.getElementById(\'lightboxVideo\');\n            const imageCounter = document.getElementById(\'imageCounter\');\n\n            if (!lightbox || !lightboxVideo || !imageCounter) {\n                console.error(\'Lightbox elements not found\');\n                return;\n            }\n\n            // Hide image, show video\n            lightboxImage.classList.add(\'hidden\');\n            if (lightboxVideo) {\n                lightboxVideo.classList.remove(\'hidden\');\n                const cleanSrc = videoSrc.split(\'?\')[0];\n                lightboxVideo.src = cleanSrc;\n                lightboxVideo.load();\n                // Play video (autoplay may be blocked by browser, but we try)\n                lightboxVideo.play().catch(e => {\n                    console.log(\'Video autoplay prevented:\', e);\n                });\n            }\n\n            imageCounter.textContent = `VIDEO / ${galleryImages.length + 1}`;\n\n            lightbox.classList.remove(\'hidden\');\n            lightbox.classList.add(\'flex\');\n            document.body.style.overflow = \'hidden\';\n        }\n\n        // Close lightbox\n        function closeImageLightbox() {\n            const lightbox = document.getElementById(\'imageLightbox\');\n            const lightboxVideo = document.getElementById(\'lightboxVideo\');\n            if (!lightbox) {\n                console.error(\'Lightbox not found\');\n                return;\n            }\n            // Pause video if playing\n            if (lightboxVideo) {\n                lightboxVideo.pause();\n                lightboxVideo.src = \'\';\n            }\n            lightbox.classList.add(\'hidden\');\n            lightbox.classList.remove(\'flex\');\n            document.body.style.overflow = \'\';\n            currentZoom = 1;\n        }\n\n        // Close on backdrop click\n        function closeImageLightboxOnBackdrop(event) {\n            if (event.target === event.currentTarget) {\n                closeImageLightbox();\n            }\n        }\n\n        // Zoom functions\n        function zoomIn() {\n            if (currentZoom < maxZoom) {\n                currentZoom = Math.min(currentZoom + zoomStep, maxZoom);\n                applyZoom();\n            }\n        }\n\n        function zoomOut() {\n            if (currentZoom > minZoom) {\n                currentZoom = Math.max(currentZoom - zoomStep, minZoom);\n                applyZoom();\n            }\n        }\n\n        function resetZoom() {\n            currentZoom = 1;\n            applyZoom();\n        }\n\n        function applyZoom() {\n            const lightboxImage = document.getElementById(\'lightboxImage\');\n            lightboxImage.style.transform = `scale(${currentZoom})`;\n            updateZoomLevel();\n        }\n\n        function updateZoomLevel() {\n            const zoomLevel = document.getElementById(\'zoomLevel\');\n            zoomLevel.textContent = `${Math.round(currentZoom * 100)}%`;\n        }\n\n        // Navigate images\n        function navigateImage(direction) {\n            currentImageIndex += direction;\n            if (currentImageIndex < 0) {\n                currentImageIndex = galleryImages.length - 1;\n            } else if (currentImageIndex >= galleryImages.length) {\n                currentImageIndex = 0;\n            }\n\n            const lightboxImage = document.getElementById(\'lightboxImage\');\n            const imageCounter = document.getElementById(\'imageCounter\');\n\n            lightboxImage.src = galleryImages[currentImageIndex].split(\'?\')[0];\n            imageCounter.textContent = `${currentImageIndex + 1} / ${galleryImages.length}`;\n\n            // Reset zoom when navigating\n            currentZoom = 1;\n            applyZoom();\n        }\n\n        // Keyboard shortcuts\n        document.addEventListener(\'keydown\', function (event) {\n            const lightbox = document.getElementById(\'imageLightbox\');\n            if (lightbox.classList.contains(\'hidden\')) return;\n\n            switch (event.key) {\n                case \'Escape\':\n                    closeImageLightbox();\n                    break;\n                case \'ArrowLeft\':\n                    navigateImage(-1);\n                    break;\n                case \'ArrowRight\':\n                    navigateImage(1);\n                    break;\n                case \'+\':\n                case \'=\':\n                    event.preventDefault();\n                    zoomIn();\n                    break;\n                case \'-\':\n                case \'_\':\n                    event.preventDefault();\n                    zoomOut();\n                    break;\n                case \'0\':\n                    resetZoom();\n                    break;\n            }\n        });\n\n        // Mouse wheel zoom (Ctrl + Scroll)\n        document.addEventListener(\'DOMContentLoaded\', function () {\n            const imageContainer = document.getElementById(\'imageContainer\');\n            if (imageContainer) {\n                imageContainer.addEventListener(\'wheel\', function (event) {\n                    const lightbox = document.getElementById(\'imageLightbox\');\n                    if (!lightbox.classList.contains(\'hidden\') && event.ctrlKey) {\n                        event.preventDefault();\n                        if (event.deltaY < 0) {\n                            zoomIn();\n                        } else {\n                            zoomOut();\n                        }\n                    }\n                });\n            }\n\n            // Featured video hover functionality\n            const featuredVideoContainer = document.getElementById(\'featuredVideoContainer\');\n            const featuredVideo = document.getElementById(\'featuredVideo\');\n            const playIconOverlay = document.getElementById(\'playIconOverlay\');\n\n            if (featuredVideoContainer && featuredVideo) {\n                featuredVideoContainer.addEventListener(\'mouseenter\', function () {\n                    featuredVideo.play().catch(e => {\n                        console.log(\'Video play prevented:\', e);\n                    });\n                    if (playIconOverlay) {\n                        playIconOverlay.style.opacity = \'0\';\n                    }\n                });\n\n                featuredVideoContainer.addEventListener(\'mouseleave\', function () {\n                    featuredVideo.pause();\n                    if (playIconOverlay) {\n                        playIconOverlay.style.opacity = \'1\';\n                    }\n                });\n            }\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n\n</html>', NULL, 'published', NULL, '2025-12-14 00:30:10', '2025-12-14 00:30:10');
INSERT INTO `pages` (`id`, `title`, `slug`, `content_html`, `custom_css`, `status`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(144, 'Brand Activation', 'product-brand-activation', '<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=5.0, user-scalable=yes\">\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Premium Brand Activation Services by MiHi Entertainment. Create unforgettable immersive brand experiences with photo booths, interactive installations, and custom activations for corporate events, product launches, and experiential marketing campaigns nationwide.\">\n    <meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"brand activation, experiential marketing, brand experience, corporate activation, product launch, interactive installation, branded photo booth, event marketing, brand engagement, experiential events, marketing activation\">\n    <meta name=\"author\" content=\"MiHi Entertainment\">\n    <meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1\">\n    <meta name=\"googlebot\" content=\"index, follow\">\n    <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.mihientertainment.com/product/brand-activation.html\">\n    \n    <!-- Open Graph / Facebook -->\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\">\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.mihientertainment.com/product/brand-activation.html\">\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Brand Activation Services - MiHi Entertainment\">\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Premium Brand Activation Services with immersive experiences, interactive installations, and custom branded photo booths. Perfect for product launches, corporate events, and experiential marketing campaigns.\">\n    <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.mihientertainment.com/assets/images/brand-activation-hero.jpg\">\n    <meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\">\n    <meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\">\n    <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"MiHi Entertainment\">\n    <meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\">\n    \n    <!-- Twitter -->\n    <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n    <meta name=\"twitter:url\" content=\"https://www.mihientertainment.com/product/brand-activation.html\">\n    <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Brand Activation Services - MiHi Entertainment\">\n    <meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Premium Brand Activation Services with immersive experiences and interactive installations for product launches and corporate events.\">\n    <meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://www.mihientertainment.com/assets/images/brand-activation-hero.jpg\">\n    \n    <title>Brand Activation Services | Experiential Marketing | MiHi Entertainment</title>\n    <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" href=\"../assets/images/favicon.svg\">\n    \n    <!-- Schema.org Structured Data -->\n    <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n    {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"Service\",\n      \"serviceType\": \"Brand Activation Services\",\n      \"provider\": {\n        \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\",\n        \"name\": \"MiHi Entertainment\",\n        \"url\": \"https://www.mihientertainment.com\"\n      },\n      \"areaServed\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Country\",\n        \"name\": \"United States\"\n      },\n      \"description\": \"Premium Brand Activation Services creating unforgettable immersive brand experiences with photo booths, interactive installations, and custom activations for corporate events, product launches, and experiential marketing campaigns.\",\n      \"offers\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n        \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\",\n        \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\"\n      },\n      \"aggregateRating\": {\n        \"@type\": \"AggregateRating\",\n        \"ratingValue\": \"5\",\n        \"reviewCount\": \"100\"\n      }\n    }\n    </script>\n    \n    <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n    {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"Product\",\n      \"name\": \"Brand Activation Services\",\n      \"image\": \"https://www.mihientertainment.com/assets/images/brand-activation-hero.jpg\",\n      \"description\": \"Professional brand activation services with immersive experiences, interactive installations, and custom branded photo booths for experiential marketing campaigns.\",\n      \"brand\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Brand\",\n        \"name\": \"MiHi Entertainment\"\n      },\n      \"offers\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n        \"url\": \"https://www.mihientertainment.com/product/brand-activation.html\",\n        \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\",\n        \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\",\n        \"priceSpecification\": {\n          \"@type\": \"UnitPriceSpecification\",\n          \"price\": \"Contact for pricing\"\n        }\n      }\n    }\n    </script>\n    \n    <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n    {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\",\n      \"itemListElement\": [\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n          \"position\": 1,\n          \"name\": \"Home\",\n          \"item\": \"https://www.mihientertainment.com/\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n          \"position\": 2,\n          \"name\": \"Products\",\n          \"item\": \"https://www.mihientertainment.com/our-booths.html\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n          \"position\": 3,\n          \"name\": \"Brand Activation\",\n          \"item\": \"https://www.mihientertainment.com/product/brand-activation.html\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n    </script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <style>\n        /* Azo Sans Font Face Declarations */\n        @font-face {\n            font-family: \'Azo Sans\';\n            src: url(\'../assets/fonts/AzoSans-Regular.woff2\') format(\'woff2\'),\n                url(\'../assets/fonts/AzoSans-Regular.woff\') format(\'woff\');\n            font-weight: 400;\n            font-style: normal;\n            font-display: swap;\n        }\n\n        @font-face {\n            font-family: \'Azo Sans Uber\';\n            src: url(\'../assets/fonts/AzoSansUber-Regular.woff2\') format(\'woff2\'),\n                url(\'../assets/fonts/AzoSansUber-Regular.woff\') format(\'woff\');\n            font-weight: 400;\n            font-style: normal;\n            font-display: swap;\n        }\n\n        /* Brand Guide: Body Text - Azo Sans Regular */\n        body {\n            font-family: \'Azo Sans\', sans-serif;\n            color: #1F1F1F;\n        }\n\n        p {\n            font-family: \'Azo Sans\', sans-serif;\n            color: #1F1F1F;\n        }\n\n        /* Brand Guide: Headers - Azo Sans Uber (Uppercase) */\n        main h1,\n        main h2,\n        main h3,\n        main h4,\n        main h5,\n        main h6 {\n            font-family: \'Azo Sans Uber\', sans-serif;\n            font-weight: 400;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n            line-height: 1.2;\n            color: #FF4F4F;\n            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n            -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;\n        }\n\n        /* Brand Activation Effects */\n        .brand-gradient-bg {\n            background: #FF4F4F;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes gradient-shift {\n            0%, 100% { background-position: 0% 50%; }\n            50% { background-position: 100% 50%; }\n        }\n\n        .pulse-glow {\n            animation: pulse-glow 3s ease-in-out infinite;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes pulse-glow {\n            0%, 100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }\n            50% { opacity: 0.8; transform: scale(1.05); }\n        }\n\n        .btn-primary {\n            background: #FF4F4F;\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n        }\n\n        .btn-primary:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 80, 255, 0.4);\n        }\n\n        .section-padding {\n            padding: 3rem 0;\n        }\n\n        @media (min-width: 768px) {\n            .section-padding {\n                padding: 8rem 0;\n            }\n        }\n\n        .animated-gradient-purple {\n            background: #FF4F4F;\n        }\n\n        .glass {\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n        }\n\n        .package-card {\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n        }\n\n        .package-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-8px);\n            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);\n        }\n\n        @keyframes float {\n            0%, 100% {\n                transform: translateY(0px);\n            }\n            50% {\n                transform: translateY(-20px);\n            }\n        }\n\n        .animate-float {\n            animation: float 6s ease-in-out infinite;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes blob {\n            0%, 100% {\n                transform: translate(0px, 0px) scale(1);\n            }\n            33% {\n                transform: translate(30px, -50px) scale(1.1);\n            }\n            66% {\n                transform: translate(-20px, 20px) scale(0.9);\n            }\n        }\n\n        .animate-blob {\n            animation: blob 7s infinite;\n        }\n\n        .animation-delay-2000 {\n            animation-delay: 2s;\n        }\n\n        .animation-delay-4000 {\n            animation-delay: 4s;\n        }\n\n        .feature-icon {\n            width: 64px;\n            height: 64px;\n            background: #FF4F4F;\n            border-radius: 16px;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .tech-spec-card {\n            background: rgba(255, 79, 79, 0.05);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 79, 79, 0.2);\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n        }\n\n        .tech-spec-card:hover {\n            background: rgba(255, 79, 79, 0.1);\n            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(255, 79, 79, 0.2);\n            transform: translateY(-4px);\n        }\n\n        /* Shimmer effect */\n        .shimmer {\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        .shimmer::after {\n            content: \'\';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: -100%;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3), transparent);\n            animation: shimmer 3s infinite;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes shimmer {\n            0% { left: -100%; }\n            100% { left: 100%; }\n        }\n\n        /* Mobile Optimizations */\n        @media (max-width: 640px) {\n            /* Reduce hero height on mobile */\n            section.relative.h-screen {\n                min-height: 100vh;\n                height: auto;\n                padding: 2rem 0;\n            }\n\n            /* Ensure images are responsive */\n            img {\n                max-width: 100%;\n                height: auto;\n            }\n\n            /* Touch-friendly button sizes */\n            button, a[class*=\"inline-flex\"] {\n                min-height: 44px;\n                min-width: 44px;\n            }\n\n            /* Better text readability on small screens */\n            p {\n                font-size: 0.9375rem;\n                line-height: 1.6;\n            }\n\n            /* Reduce spacing in cards on mobile */\n            .group.relative.bg-white {\n                padding: 1rem;\n            }\n        }\n\n        /* Tablet optimizations */\n        @media (min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px) {\n            .section-padding {\n                padding: 4rem 0;\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-white\">\n    <div id=\"nav-placeholder\"></div>\n\n    <main>\n        <!-- Hero Section -->\n        <section class=\"relative min-h-screen sm:h-screen flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden\" style=\"background-image: url(\'/brand-activation/brand-activation-hero.webp\'); background-size: cover; background-position: center; background-repeat: no-repeat;\">\n            <!-- Background Image -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0\">\n                <img src=\"../assets/images/brand-activation/brand-activation-hero.webp\" alt=\"Brand activation with immersive photo booth experience at corporate event\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/50\"></div>\n\n            <div class=\"relative z-10 container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 pt-16 sm:pt-20\">\n                <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto text-center\">\n\n                    <!-- Main Title -->\n                    <h1 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl xl:text-8xl font-normal mb-4 sm:mb-6 leading-tight px-2\">\n                        <span class=\"block text-[#FF4F4F] drop-shadow-2xl\">\n                            BRAND ACTIVATION\n                        </span>\n                    </h1>\n\n                    <!-- Description -->\n                    <div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-6 sm:mb-8 px-4\">\n                        <p class=\"text-base sm:text-lg md:text-xl lg:text-2xl mb-6 sm:mb-8 leading-relaxed text-white/95 font-normal drop-shadow-lg\">\n                            Transform your brand into an unforgettable experience with immersive activations, interactive installations, and custom photo booth experiences that drive engagement and create lasting impressions.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- CTA Buttons -->\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 sm:gap-6 justify-center items-center px-4\">\n                        <a href=\"../contact-us.html\"\n                            class=\"group relative inline-flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3 text-white px-6 sm:px-10 py-3 sm:py-5 rounded-full text-base sm:text-lg  shadow-2xl hover:shadow-[#FF4F4F]/50 transition-all duration-500 transform hover:scale-110 hover:-translate-y-1 overflow-hidden w-full sm:w-auto justify-center\"\n                            style=\"background: #FF4F4F;\">\n                            <span class=\"relative z-10\">Get Your Quote</span>\n                        </a>\n                        <button type=\"button\" data-click-to-call data-call-text=\"Call Us\"\n                            class=\"group inline-flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3 px-6 sm:px-10 py-3 sm:py-5 rounded-full text-base sm:text-lg  backdrop-blur-md bg-white/10 border-2 shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-500 transform hover:scale-110 hover:-translate-y-1 text-white w-full sm:w-auto justify-center cursor-pointer\"\n                            style=\"border-color: rgba(24, 241, 225, 0.5);\"\n                            onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor=\'rgba(24, 241, 225, 0.7)\'; this.style.background=\'rgba(24, 241, 225, 0.2)\';\"\n                            onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor=\'rgba(24, 241, 225, 0.5)\'; this.style.background=\'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1)\';\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 sm:w-5 sm:h-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\"\n                                viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"\n                                    d=\"M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498A1 1 0 0121 17.72V21a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 23 3 16.284 3 8V7a2 2 0 012-2z\">\n                                </path>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Call Us</span>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Trust Indicators -->\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3 sm:gap-4 md:gap-8 mt-6 sm:mt-8 md:mt-12 text-white/70 px-4\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-red-400 rounded-full\"></div>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-normal\">Custom Branded Experiences</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-orange-400 rounded-full\"></div>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-normal\">Nationwide Service</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-rose-400 rounded-full\"></div>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-normal\">Full-Service Production</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Main Description Section -->\n        <section class=\"section-padding bg-white !pb-0\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\">\n                <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto\">\n                    <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 sm:gap-8 md:gap-12 items-stretch mb-12 sm:mb-16 md:mb-20\">\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n                            <h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-normal mb-6 text-[#FF4F4F]\">\n                                Elevate Your Brand Story\n                            </h2>\n                            <p class=\"text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-700 mb-4 sm:mb-6 leading-relaxed\">\n                                Transform your brand into an unforgettable experience. We combine cutting-edge photo booth technology, interactive installations, and custom branded environments to create moments that captivate audiences and amplify your message.\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-700 mb-4 sm:mb-6 leading-relaxed\">\n                                From product launches to trade shows, our full-service activations drive engagement, generate viral social content, and deliver measurable ROI. Every element is designed to turn attendees into brand advocates.\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed\">\n                                We handle everything—concept, design, execution, and analytics—so you can focus on what matters: connecting with your audience and achieving your campaign goals.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"relative flex items-start justify-center h-full mt-6 md:mt-0\">\n                            <img src=\"../assets/images/brand-activation/brand-activation-1.webp\" alt=\"Brand activation with custom photo booth and branded environment at corporate event\" class=\"w-full h-auto md:h-[70%] object-contain rounded-2xl shadow-2xl\">\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Gallery Section -->\n        <section class=\"section-padding bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-gray-50\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\">\n                <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto\">\n                    <div class=\"text-center mb-8 sm:mb-10 md:mb-12\">\n                        <h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-normal mb-6 text-[#FF4F4F] px-2\">\n                            Our Brand Activation Gallery\n                        </h2>\n                        <p class=\"text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed px-2\">\n                            Explore our portfolio of successful brand activations and immersive experiences\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4 sm:gap-5 md:gap-6\">\n                        <!-- Gallery Item 1 -->\n                        <div class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer aspect-[4/3]\">\n                            <img src=\"../assets/images/brand-activation/brand-activation-1.webp\" \n                                 alt=\"Brand activation event with custom photo booth\" \n                                 class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 via-black/20 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-4 transform translate-y-full group-hover:translate-y-0 transition-transform duration-300\">\n                                <p class=\"text-white text-sm font-normal\">Corporate Event Activation</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Gallery Item 2 -->\n                        <div class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer aspect-[4/3]\">\n                            <img src=\"../assets/images/brand-activation/brand-activation-2.webp\" \n                                 alt=\"Interactive brand activation installation\" \n                                 class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 via-black/20 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-4 transform translate-y-full group-hover:translate-y-0 transition-transform duration-300\">\n                                <p class=\"text-white text-sm font-normal\">Product Launch Experience</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Gallery Item 3 -->\n                        <div class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer aspect-[4/3]\">\n                            <img src=\"../assets/images/brand-activation/brand-activation-3.webp\" \n                                 alt=\"Brand activation with immersive photo booth\" \n                                 class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 via-black/20 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-4 transform translate-y-full group-hover:translate-y-0 transition-transform duration-300\">\n                                <p class=\"text-white text-sm font-normal\">Trade Show Activation</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Gallery Item 4 -->\n                        <div class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer aspect-[4/3]\">\n                            <img src=\"../assets/images/brand-activation/brand-activation-4.webp\" \n                                 alt=\"Custom branded photo booth experience\" \n                                 class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 via-black/20 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-4 transform translate-y-full group-hover:translate-y-0 transition-transform duration-300\">\n                                <p class=\"text-white text-sm font-normal\">Festival Brand Experience</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Gallery Item 5 -->\n                        <div class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer aspect-[4/3]\">\n                            <img src=\"../assets/images/brand-activation/brand-activation-2.webp\" \n                                 alt=\"Retail brand activation setup\" \n                                 class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 via-black/20 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-4 transform translate-y-full group-hover:translate-y-0 transition-transform duration-300\">\n                                <p class=\"text-white text-sm font-normal\">Retail Activation</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Gallery Item 6 -->\n                        <div class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer aspect-[4/3]\">\n                            <img src=\"../assets/images/brand-activation/brand-activation-hero.webp\" \n                                 alt=\"Interactive brand engagement experience\" \n                                 class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 via-black/20 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-4 transform translate-y-full group-hover:translate-y-0 transition-transform duration-300\">\n                                <p class=\"text-white text-sm font-normal\">Interactive Installation</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Trusted Brands Section -->\n        <section class=\"relative section-padding bg-white overflow-hidden\" aria-label=\"Trusted brands\">\n            <!-- Ambient background elements -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none\">\n                <div class=\"absolute -top-40 -right-20 w-80 h-80 bg-red-500/5 rounded-full blur-3xl\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 -left-32 w-72 h-72 bg-orange-500/5 rounded-full blur-[110px]\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-[-4rem] right-1/3 w-[28rem] h-[28rem] bg-rose-500/5 rounded-full blur-[140px]\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0\" style=\"background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.02) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.02) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 60px 60px;\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"relative container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\">\n                <!-- Premium Header -->\n                <div class=\"text-center mb-8 sm:mb-10 md:mb-12 max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-6 sm:space-y-8 md:space-y-10\">\n                    <div class=\"space-y-3 sm:space-y-4 md:space-y-5\">\n                        <h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-normal mb-6 text-[#FF4F4F] px-2\">\n                            Top Brands and Planners\n                        </h2>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm sm:text-base md:text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed px-2\">\n                            Industry leaders trust MiHi Entertainment to deliver cutting-edge photo, video, and event experiences that captivate guests and elevate brand presence. From global corporations to top event planners, we create seamless, high-quality activations that leave a lasting impression.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <!-- Premium Grid Logos Container -->\n                <div class=\"relative py-12\">\n                    <!-- Decorative Elements -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 w-px h-full bg-[#FF4F4F]/30 opacity-30\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-0 transform -translate-y-1/2 w-full h-px bg-[#FF4F4F]/30 opacity-30\"></div>\n                    \n                    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-3 sm:gap-4 md:gap-6 lg:gap-8 xl:gap-10\">\n                        <!-- Brand Logos with Premium Cards -->\n                        <div class=\"group relative\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[#FF4F4F]/10 rounded-2xl blur-xl opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-500\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-center h-32 bg-white/50 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl border border-red-100/50 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-red-500/20 transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:border-red-300/50 p-4\">\n                                <im