reativity take over with our Graffiti Wall Photo Booth! Guests\n                            can snap a photo and then digitally \"spray paint\" their masterpiece using our interactive\n                            technology. With customizable colors, brushes, and branding, it\'s a modern twist on classic\n                            street art.\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"text-lg text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-8\">\n                            Ideal for brand activations, festivals, product launches, and interactive experiences, this\n                            booth is available nationwide to bring an engaging, hands-on activity to any event. Guests\n                            leave with a one-of-a-kind, printed or digital keepsake, making this activation an\n                            unforgettable part of your event.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Auto-Scrolling Photo Gallery -->\n                    <div class=\"mt-16\">\n                        <div class=\"graffiti-gallery-container\">\n                            <div class=\"graffiti-gallery-scroll\">\n                                <!-- First set of gallery items -->\n                                <div\n                                    class=\"graffiti-gallery-item group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl aspect-[3/4] shadow-xl hover:shadow-orange-200/60 transition-all duration-500\">\n                                    <img src=\"../../assets/images/graffiti/graffiti-1.webp\"\n                                        alt=\"Interactive graffiti wall photo booth with digital spray paint effects\"\n                                        width=\"360\" height=\"480\"\n                                        class=\"gallery-image w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110\"\n                                        loading=\"lazy\">\n                                </d