ver:scale-110\"\n                                    loading=\"lazy\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div\n                                class=\"headshot-gallery-item group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl aspect-[3/4] shadow-xl hover:shadow-blue-200/60 transition-all duration-500\">\n                                <img src=\"../../assets/images/headshot/professional-headshot-3.webp\"\n                                    alt=\"Executive portrait photography with professional retouching\" width=\"720\"\n                                    height=\"960\"\n                                    class=\"gallery-image w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110\"\n                                    loading=\"lazy\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div\n                                class=\"headshot-gallery-item group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl aspect-[3/4] shadow-xl hover:shadow-blue-200/60 transition-all duration-500\">\n                                <img src=\"../../assets/images/headshot/professional-headshot-4.webp\"\n                                    alt=\"Corporate team headshot photography service\" width=\"720\" height=\"960\"\n                                    class=\"gallery-image w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110\"\n                                    loading=\"lazy\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div\n                                class=\"headshot-gallery-item group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl aspect-[3/4] shadow-xl hover:shadow-blue-200/60 transition-all duration-500\">\n                                <img src=\"../../assets/images/headshot/professional-headshot-5.webp\"\n                                    alt=\"Professional headshot with custom branded backdrop\" width=\"720\" height=\"960\"\n                                    class=\"gallery-image w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110\"\n                                    loading=\"lazy\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div\n                                class=\"headshot-gallery-item group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl aspect-[3/4] shadow-xl hover:shadow-blue-200/60 transition-all duration-500\">\n                                <img src=\"../../assets/images/headshot/professional-headshot-6.webp\"\n                                    alt=\"Trade show headshot photography with instant digital delivery\" width=\"720\"\n                                    height=\"960\"\n                                    class=\"gallery-image w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110\"\n                                    loading=\"lazy\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div\n                                class=\"headshot-gallery-item group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl aspect-[3/4] shadow-xl hover:shadow-blue-200/60 transition-all duration-500\">\n                                <img src=\"../../assets/images/headshot/professional-headshot-7.webp\"\n                                    alt=\"Business profile picture with professional lighting setup\" width=\"720\"\n                                    height=\"960\"\n                                    class=\"gallery-image w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110\"\n                                    loading=\"lazy\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div\n                                class=\"headshot-gallery-item group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl aspect-[3/4] shadow-xl hover:shadow-blue-200/60 transition-all duration-500\">\n                                <img src=\"../../assets/images/headshot/professional-headshot-8.webp\"\n                                    alt=\"Personal branding photography with pose coaching\" width=\"720\" height=\"960\"\n                                    class=\"gallery-image w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110\"\n                                    loading=\"lazy\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div\n                                class=\"headshot-gallery-item group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl aspect-[3/4] shadow-xl hover:shadow-blue-200/60 transition-all duration-500\">\n                                <img src=\"../../assets/images/headshot/professional-headshot-9.webp\"\n                                    alt=\"Professional headshot rental service on-site at event\" width=\"720\" height=\"960\"\n                                    class=\"gallery-image w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110\"\n                                    loading=\"lazy\">\n                            </div>\n                            <!-- Duplicate set for seamless loop -->\n                            <div\n                                class=\"headshot-gallery-item group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl aspect-[3/4] shadow-xl hover:shadow-blue-200/60 transition-all duration-500\">\n                                <img src=\"../../assets/images/headshot/professional-headshot-1.webp\"\n                                    alt=\"Professional corporate headshot with studio-quality lighting\" width=\"720\"\n                                    height=\"960\"\n                                    class=\"gallery-image w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110\"\n                                    loading=\"lazy\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div\n                                class=\"headshot-gallery-item group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl aspect-[3/4] shadow-xl hover:shadow-blue-200/60 transition-all duration-500\">\n                                <img src=\"../../assets/images/headshot/professional-headshot-2.webp\"\n                                    alt=\"Business headshot portrait for LinkedIn profile\" width=\"720\" height=\"960\"\n                                    class=\"gallery-image w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110\"\n                                    loading=\"lazy\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div\n                                class=\"headshot-gallery-item group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl aspect-[3/4] shadow-xl hover:shadow-blue-200/60 transition-all duration-500\">\n                                <img src=\"../../assets/images/headshot/professional-headshot-3.webp\"\n                                    alt=\"Executive portrait photography with professional retouching\" width=\"720\"\n                                    height=\"960\"\n                                    class=\"gallery-image w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110\"\n                                    loading=\"lazy\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div\n                                class=\"headshot-gallery-item group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl aspect-[3/4] shadow-xl hover:shadow-blue-200/60 transition-all duration-500\">\n                                <img src=\"../../assets/images/headshot/professional-headshot-4.webp\"\n                                    alt=\"Corporate team headshot photography service\" width=\"720\" height=\"960\"\n                                    class=\"gallery-image w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110\"\n                                    loading=\"lazy\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div\n                                class=\"headshot-gallery-item group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl aspect-[3/4] shadow-xl hover:shadow-blue-200/60 transition-all duration-500\">\n                                <img src=\"../../assets/images/headshot/professional-headshot-5.webp\"\n                                    alt=\"Professional headshot with custom branded backdrop\" width=\"720\" height=\"960\"\n                                    class=\"gallery-image w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110\"\n                                    loading=\"lazy\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div\n                                class=\"headshot-gallery-item group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl aspect-[3/4] shadow-xl hover:shadow-blue-200/60 transition-all duration-500\">\n                                <img src=\"../../assets/images/headshot/professional-headshot-6.webp\"\n                                    alt=\"Trade show headshot photography with instant digital delivery\" width=\"720\"\n                                    height=\"960\"\n                                    class=\"gallery-image w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110\"\n                                    loading=\"lazy\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div\n                                class=\"headshot-gallery-item group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl aspect-[3/4] shadow-xl hover:shadow-blue-200/60 transition-all duration-500\">\n                                <img src=\"../../assets/images/headshot/professional-headshot-7.webp\"\n                                    alt=\"Business profile picture with professional lighting setup\" width=\"720\"\n                                    height=\"960\"\n                                    class=\"gallery-image w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110\"\n                                    loading=\"lazy\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div\n                                class=\"headshot-gallery-item group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl aspect-[3/4] shadow-xl hover:shadow-blue-200/60 transition-all duration-500\">\n                                <img src=\"../../assets/images/headshot/professional-headshot-8.webp\"\n                                    alt=\"Personal branding photography with pose coaching\" width=\"720\" height=\"960\"\n                                    class=\"gallery-image w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110\"\n                                    loading=\"lazy\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div\n                                class=\"headshot-gallery-item group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl aspect-[3/4] shadow-xl hover:shadow-blue-200/60 transition-all duration-500\">\n                                <img src=\"../../assets/images/headshot/professional-headshot-9.webp\"\n                                    alt=\"Professional headshot rental service on-site at event\" width=\"720\" height=\"960\"\n                                    class=\"gallery-image w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110\"\n                                    loading=\"lazy\">\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Lightbox Modal -->\n                    <div id=\"headshotLightbox\"\n                        class=\"fixed inset-0 bg-black/90 backdrop-blur-sm z-50 hidden items-center justify-center p-6\">\n                        <button id=\"headshotLightboxClose\"\n                            class=\"absolute top-6 right-6 w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-white/15 border border-white/30 text-white flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-white/25 transition\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-5 h-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"\n                                    d=\"M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12\"></path>\n                            </svg>\n                        </button>\n                        <div class=\"relative max-w-5xl w-full flex flex-col items-center gap-5\">\n                            <div class=\"max-h-[80vh] w-full flex items-center justify-center\">\n                                <img id=\"headshotLightboxImage\" src=\"\" alt=\"Professional Headshot full view\"\n                                    class=\"max-h-[80vh] w-full object-contain rounded-2xl shadow-2xl transition-transform duration-200 ease-out\"\n                                    style=\"transform: scale(1); transform-origin: center;\"></img>\n                            </div>\n                            <div\n                                class=\"flex items-center gap-3 bg-white/10 border border-white/20 rounded-full px-5 py-3 text-white shadow-lg\">\n                                <button id=\"headshotZoomOut\"\n                                    class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-white/15 hover:bg-white/25 flex items-center justify-center transition\">\n                                    <svg class=\"w-5 h-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                        <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"\n                                            d=\"M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0zM13 10H7\"></path>\n                                    </svg>\n                                </button>\n                                <button id=\"headshotZoomReset\"\n                                    class=\"px-4 h-10 rounded-full bg-white/15 hover:bg-white/25 text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide transition\">\n                                    Reset\n                                </button>\n                                <button id=\"headshotZoomIn\"\n                                    class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-white/15 hover:bg-white/25 flex items-center justify-center transition\">\n                                    <svg class=\"w-5 h-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                        <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"\n                                            d=\"M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0zM10 7v6m3-3H7\"></path>\n                                    </svg>\n                                </button>\n                                <span id=\"headshotZoomLevel\"\n                                    class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-white/80\">100%</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <script>\n                        document.addEventListener(\'DOMContentLoaded\', () => {\n                            const lightbox = document.getElementById(\'headshotLightbox\');\n                            const lightboxImg = document.getElementById(\'headshotLightboxImage\');\n                            const closeBtn = document.getElementById(\'headshotLightboxClose\');\n                            const galleryImages = document.querySelectorAll(\'.headshot-gallery-item .gallery-image\');\n                            const zoomInBtn = document.getElementById(\'headshotZoomIn\');\n                            const zoomOutBtn = document.getElementById(\'headshotZoomOut\');\n                            const zoomResetBtn = document.getElementById(\'headshotZoomReset\');\n                            const zoomLevelDisplay = document.getElementById(\'headshotZoomLevel\');\n\n                            let currentZoom = 1;\n                            const zoomStep = 0.25;\n                            const minZoom = 0.75;\n                            const maxZoom = 4;\n\n                            const applyZoom = () => {\n                                if (!lightboxImg) return;\n                                lightboxImg.style.transform = `scale(${currentZoom})`;\n                                if (zoomLevelDisplay) {\n                                    zoomLevelDisplay.textContent = `${Math.round(currentZoom * 100)}%`;\n                                }\n                            };\n\n                            const zoomIn = () => {\n                                currentZoom = Math.min(maxZoom, currentZoom + zoomStep);\n                                applyZoom();\n                            };\n\n                            const zoomOut = () => {\n                                currentZoom = Math.max(minZoom, currentZoom - zoomStep);\n                                applyZoom();\n                            };\n\n                            const resetZoom = () => {\n                                currentZoom = 1;\n                                applyZoom();\n                            };\n\n                            const openLightbox = (src, alt) => {\n                                if (!lightbox || !lightboxImg) return;\n                                lightboxImg.src = src;\n                                lightboxImg.alt = alt || \'Professional Headshot full view\';\n                                resetZoom();\n                                lightbox.classList.remove(\'hidden\');\n                                lightbox.classList.add(\'flex\');\n                                document.body.style.overflow = \'hidden\';\n                            };\n\n                            const closeLightbox = () => {\n                                if (!lightbox) return;\n                                lightbox.classList.add(\'hidden\');\n                                lightbox.classList.remove(\'flex\');\n                                if (lightboxImg) {\n                                    lightboxImg.src = \'\';\n                                }\n                                document.body.style.overflow = \'\';\n                                resetZoom();\n                            };\n\n                            galleryImages.forEach(img => {\n                                img.addEventListener(\'click\', () => openLightbox(img.src, img.alt));\n                            });\n\n                            if (zoomInBtn) zoomInBtn.addEventListener(\'click\', zoomIn);\n                            if (zoomOutBtn) zoomOutBtn.addEventListener(\'click\', zoomOut);\n                            if (zoomResetBtn) zoomResetBtn.addEventListener(\'click\', resetZoom);\n                            if (closeBtn) closeBtn.addEventListener(\'click\', closeLightbox);\n\n                            if (lightbox) {\n                                lightbox.addEventListener(\'click\', (event) => {\n                                    if (event.target === lightbox) {\n                                        closeLightbox();\n                                    }\n                                });\n\n                                lightbox.addEventListener(\'wheel\', (event) => {\n                                    if (!lightbox.classList.contains(\'flex\')) return;\n                                    event.preventDefault();\n                                    if (event.deltaY < 0) {\n                                        zoomIn();\n                                    } else {\n                                        zoomOut();\n                                    }\n                                }, { passive: false });\n                            }\n\n                            document.addEventListener(\'keydown\', (event) => {\n                                if (!lightbox || !lightbox.classList.contains(\'flex\')) return;\n                                if (event.key === \'Escape\') {\n                                    closeLightbox();\n                                } else if (event.key === \'+\' || event.key === \'=\') {\n                                    zoomIn();\n                                } else if (event.key === \'-\' || event.key === \'_\') {\n                                    zoomOut();\n                                } else if (event.key === \'0\') {\n                                    resetZoom();\n                                }\n                            });\n                        });\n                    </script>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Studio-Quality Section -->\n        <section class=\"section-padding section-premium-light relative overflow-hidden\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 relative z-10\">\n                <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\">\n                    <div class=\"text-center mb-12 md:mb-20\">\n                        <div class=\"inline-block mb-4 md:mb-6 px-4 sm:px-6 py-2 rounded-full\"\n                            style=\"background-color: #18F1E1;\">\n                            <span class=\"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider\" style=\"color: #1F1F1F;\">Premium\n                                Service</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light mb-6 md:mb-8 leading-tight\">\n                            <span style=\"color: #FF4F4F;\">Professional Business Portrait Photography</span>\n                            <span style=\"color: #FF4F4F;\">& Corporate Headshots</span>\n                        </h2>\n                        <p class=\"text-base md:text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-4xl mx-auto leading-relaxed font-light\">\n                            Upgrade your corporate event with high-quality, professional headshots that give guests a\n                            polished, career-ready look. Our expert photographers use flattering lighting, professional\n                            backdrops, and instant touch-ups to deliver studio-grade results on-site.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Feature Grid with Image -->\n                    <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 md:gap-8 lg:gap-12 mb-12 md:mb-20 items-center\">\n                        <!-- Left Side - Image -->\n                        <div class=\"premium-image-wrapper shadow-premium-lg rounded-3xl overflow-hidden\">\n                            <img src=\"../../assets/images/headshot/professional-headshot-10.webp\"\n                                alt=\"Professional headshot service with expert photographer and studio-quality lighting\"\n                                width=\"800\" height=\"600\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover object-center scale-125\"\n                                loading=\"lazy\">\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Right Side - Feature Grid -->\n                        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 sm:gap-4\">\n                            <!-- Feature 1 -->\n                            <div class=\"professional-card bg-1F1F1F p-4 rounded-xl shadow-lg\">\n                                <div class=\"feature-icon mx-auto mb-3\" style=\"width: 48px; height: 48px;\">\n                                    <svg class=\"w-5 h-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1F1F1F\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                        <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"\n                                            d=\"M21 13.255A23.931 23.931 0 0112 15c-3.183 0-6.22-.62-9-1.745M16 6V4a2 2 0 00-2-2h-4a2 2 0 00-2 2v2m4 6h.01M5 20h14a2 2 0 002-2V8a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z\">\n                                        </path>\n                                    </svg>\n                                </div>\n                                <h4 class=\"text-xl font-