 every detail in breathtaking cinematic slow motion with footage up to 4K resolution and 240 FPS. Perfect for corporate events, weddings, fashion events, product launches, and experiential marketing.\",\n      \"brand\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Brand\",\n        \"name\": \"MiHi Entertainment\"\n      },\n      \"category\": \"Event Entertainment\",\n      \"keywords\": \"slow motion video booth, slow motion booth rental, slow mo video booth, high speed video booth, 240 fps video booth, 4K slow motion, cinematic video booth\",\n      \"offers\": {\n        \"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\",\n        \"url\": \"https://www.mihientertainment.com/product/slow-motion-booth.html\",\n        \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\",\n        \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\",\n        \"priceSpecification\": {\n          \"@type\": \"UnitPriceSpecification\",\n          \"price\": \"Contact for pricing\"\n        },\n        \"offerCount\": \"3\"\n      },\n      \"aggregateRating\": {\n        \"@type\": \"AggregateRating\",\n        \"ratingValue\": \"5\",\n        \"reviewCount\": \"45\",\n        \"bestRating\": \"5\",\n        \"worstRating\": \"1\"\n      },\n      \"additionalProperty\": [\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"PropertyValue\",\n          \"name\": \"Video Resolution\",\n          \"value\": \"Up to 4K (1080p Standard)\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"PropertyValue\",\n          \"name\": \"Frame Rate\",\n          \"value\": \"Up to 240 FPS\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"PropertyValue\",\n          \"name\": \"Video Duration\",\n          \"value\": \"15-30 seconds\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"PropertyValue\",\n          \"name\": \"Space Required\",\n          \"value\": \"12\' x 8\' Minimum\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"PropertyValue\",\n          \"name\": \"Setup Duration\",\n          \"value\": \"120 Minutes\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"PropertyValue\",\n  