ray-700 font-medium pt-2 font-semibold\">Custom Branded User Interface</span>\n                                </li>\n                                    <li class=\"flex items-start gap-4 group/item\">\n                                        <div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 bg-purple-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center group-hover/item:bg-purple-100 transition-colors\">\n                                            <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-purple-700\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9.75 17L9 20l-1 1h8l-1-1-.75-3M3 13h18M5 17h14a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z\"/></svg>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <span class=\"text-gray-700 font-medium pt-2\">Online Gallery Post Event</span>\n                                </li>\n                            </ul>\n                                <a href=\"../contact-us.html\" class=\"mt-8 block w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-600 to-purple-700 text-white py-4 rounded-xl font-semibold hover:from-purple-700 hover:to-purple-800 transition-all duration-300 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transform hover:-translate-y-1 text-center\">Get Started</a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        \n\n        <!-- CTA Section -->\n        <section class=\"section-padding animated-gradient-digital text-white relative overflow-hidden\">\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 digital-grid\"></div>\n            <div class=\"scan-lines\"></div>\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10\">\n                <div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6 holographic-text\">\n                        Ready to Go Virtual?\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-xl mb-8 text-white/90 leading-relaxed\">\n                        Let\'s create an unforgettable virtual photo experience for your next event. Our team is ready to help you engage guests from anywhere in the world!\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center\">\n                        <a href=\"../contact-us.html\" class=\"group relative inline-flex items-center justify-center px-10 py-4 rounded-full text-lg font-bold shadow-2xl hover:shadow-[#FF4F4F]/50 transition-all duration-500 transform hover:scale-110 hover:-translate-y-1 text-white\" style=\"background: #FF4F4F;\">\n                            Get Your Quote\n                        </a>\n                        <button type=\"button\" data-click-to-call data-call-text=\"Call Us\" \n                           class=\"group inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-10 py-4 rounded-full text-lg backdrop-blur-md bg-white/10 border-2 shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-500 transform hover:scale-110 hover:-translate-y-1 text-white cursor-pointer\" style=\"border-color: rgba(24, 241, 225, 0.5);\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor=\'rgba(24, 241, 225, 0.7)\'; this.style.background=\'rgba(24, 241, 225, 0.2)\';\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor=\'rgba(24, 241, 225, 0.5)\'; this.style.background=\'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1)\';\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-5 h-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498A1 1 0 0121 17.72V21a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 23 3 16.284 3 8V7a2 2 0 012-2z\"></path>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Call Us</span>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <!-- Floating Neon Elements -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-10 left-10 w-24 h-24 rounded-full blur-2xl float-animation glow-cyan\" style=\"background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.15);\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-10 right-10 w-32 h-32 rounded-full blur-2xl float-animation glow-pink\" style=\"animation-delay: 1.5s; background: rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.15);\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 right-1/3 w-20 h-20 rounded-full blur-xl float-animation glow-purple\" style=\"animation-delay: 3s; background: rgba(138, 43, 226, 0.15);\"></div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Related Products Section -->\n        <section class=\"section-padding bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-50 to-white\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\">\n                <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\">\n                    <div class=\"text-center mb-16\">\n                        <h2 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6\">\n                            Explore Our <span class=\"gradient-text\" style=\"background: none; -webkit-text-fill-color: #18F1E1; color: #18F1E1;\">Other Photo Booth Services</span>\n                        </h2>\n                        <p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">\n                            Discover more innovative photo booth experiences to elevate your event\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\">\n                        <!-- AI Photo Booth -->\n                        <a href=\"../../product/ai-photo-booth.html\" class=\"group\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg overflow-hidden transform hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-300 neon-border h-full\">\n                                <div class=\"relative h-48 overflow-hidden\">\n                                    <img src=\"../../assets/images/ai/ai-photo-booth-12.jpg\" \n                                         alt=\"AI photo booth rental with artificial intelligence character transformation\" \n                                         width=\"400\" height=\"300\" \n                                         class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300\" \n                                         loading=\"lazy\">\n                                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"p-6\">\n                                    <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-3 group-hover:text-purple-600 transition-colors\">AI Photo Booth</h3>\n                                    <p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4\">Transform guests into superheroes, celebrities, or fantasy characters with AI-powered transformations</p>\n                                    <span class=\"text-purple-600 font-semibold inline-flex items-center group-hover:translate-x-2 transition-transform\">\n                                        Learn More\n                                        <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 ml-2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 5l7 7-7 7\"></path>\n                                        </svg>\n                                    </span>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </a>\n\n                        <!-- Green Screen Booth -->\n                        <a href=\"../../product/green-screen-photo-booth.html\" class=\"group\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg overflow-hidden transform hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-300 neon-border h-full\">\n                                <div class=\"relative h-48 overflow-hidden\">\n                                    <img src=\"../../assets/images/greenscreen/green-screen-1.webp\" \n                                         alt=\"Green screen photo booth rental with chroma key technology\" \n                                         width=\"400\" height=\"300\" \n                                         class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300\" \n                                         loading=\"lazy\">\n                                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"p-6\">\n                                    <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-3 group-hover:text-green-600 transition-colors\">Green Screen Booth</h3>\n                                    <p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4\">Transport guests anywhere with custom backgrounds and professional chroma key technology</p>\n                                    <span class=\"text-green-600 font-semibold inline-flex items-center group-hover:translate-x-2 transition-transform\">\n                                        Learn More\n                                        <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 ml-2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 5l7 7-7 7\"></path>\n                                        </svg>\n                                    </span>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </a>\n                        <!-- Professional Headshot -->\n                        <a href=\"professional-headshots.html\" class=\"group\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg overflow-hidden transform hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-300 neon-border h-full\">\n                                <div class=\"relative h-48 overflow-hidden\">\n                                    <img src=\"../../assets/images/headshot/professional-headshot-1.webp\" \n                                         alt=\"Professional headshot photo booth rental for corporate events\" \n                                         width=\"400\" height=\"300\" \n                                         class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300\" \n                                         loading=\"lazy\">\n                                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"p-6\">\n                                    <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-3 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">Professional Headshot</h3>\n                                    <p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4\">Corporate-quality headshots with professional lighting and backdrop options</p>\n                                    <span class=\"text-indigo-600 font-semibold inline-flex items-center group-hover:translate-x-2 transition-transform\">\n                                        Learn More\n                                        <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 ml-2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 5l7 7-7 7\"></path>\n                                        </svg>\n                                    </span>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Footer -->\n    <script src=\"../../assets/components/footer.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"../../assets/components/back-to-top.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"../../assets/js/phone-protection.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n\n', NULL, 'published', NULL, '2025-12-14 00:30:10', '2025-12-14 00:30:10');
INSERT INTO `pages` (`id`, `title`, `slug`, `content_html`, `custom_css`, `status`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(163, 'Vogue Photo Booth', 'product-vogue-photo-booth', '<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <meta name=\"description\"\n        content=\"Premium Vogue Video Booth Rentals by MiHi Entertainment. Studio-quality headshots and videos, on-site and effortless.\">\n    <title>Vogue Photo Booth Rentals - MiHi Entertainment</title>\n    <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" href=\"../../assets/images/favicon.svg\">\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <link\n        href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800;900&family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap\"\n        rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <script src=\"../../assets/components/navigation.js\" defer></script>\n    <style>\n        @font-face {\n            font-family: \'AzoSansUber\';\n            src: url(\'../../assets/fonts/AzoSansUber-Regular.woff2\') format(\'woff2\');\n            font-weight: normal;\n            font-style: normal;\n            font-display: swap;\n        }\n\n        @font-face {\n            font-family: \'AzoSans\';\n            src: url(\'../../assets/fonts/AzoSans-Regular.woff2\') format(\'woff2\');\n            font-weight: normal;\n            font-style: normal;\n            font-display: swap;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: \'Inter\', sans-serif;\n            color: #e0e0e0;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a0a0f 0%, #1a0a2e 50%, #16213e 100%);\n        }\n\n        main h1,\n        main h2,\n        main h3,\n        main h4,\n        main h5,\n        main h6 {\n            font-family: \'Playfair Display\', serif;\n        }\n\n        .hero-title {\n            font-weight: 400;\n            font-family: \'AzoSansUber\', sans-serif;\n        }\n\n        .hero-subtitle {\n            font-family: \'AzoSans\', sans-serif;\n        }\n\n        .btn-primary {\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0050ff 0%, #0040d9 100%);\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n        }\n\n        .btn-primary:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 80, 255, 0.4);\n        }\n\n        .section-padding {\n            padding: 3rem 0;\n        }\n\n        @media (min-width: 640px) {\n            .section-padding {\n                padding: 4rem 0;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (min-width: 768px) {\n            .section-padding {\n                padding: 6rem 0;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (min-width: 1024px) {\n            .section-padding {\n                padding: 8rem 0;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @keyframes gradient-shift {\n\n            0%,\n            100% {\n                background-position: 0% 50%;\n            }\n\n            50% {\n                background-position: 100% 50%;\n            }\n        }\n\n        .animated-gradient-luxury {\n            background: linear-gradient(-45deg, #1a1a2e, #16213e, #0f3460, #533483);\n            background-size: 400% 400%;\n            animation: gradient-shift 15s ease infinite;\n        }\n\n        .glass {\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n        }\n\n        .package-card {\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n        }\n\n        .package-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-8px);\n            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);\n        }\n\n        .package-featured {\n            border: 2px solid #d4af37;\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .package-featured::before {\n            content: \'RECOMMENDED\';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: -12px;\n            left: 50%;\n            transform: translateX(-50%);\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d4af37 0%, #f4c430 100%);\n            color: #1a1a2e;\n            padding: 4px 20px;\n            border-radius: 20px;\n            font-size: 12px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes float {\n\n            0%,\n            100% {\n                transform: translateY(0px);\n            }\n\n            50% {\n                transform: translateY(-20px);\n            }\n        }\n\n        .animate-float {\n            animation: float 6s ease-in-out infinite;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes blob {\n\n            0%,\n            100% {\n                transform: translate(0px, 0px) scale(1);\n            }\n\n            33% {\n                transform: translate(30px, -50px) scale(1.1);\n            }\n\n            66% {\n                transform: translate(-20px, 20px) scale(0.9);\n            }\n        }\n\n        .animate-blob {\n            animation: blob 7s infinite;\n        }\n\n        .animation-delay-2000 {\n            animation-delay: 2s;\n        }\n\n        .animation-delay-4000 {\n            animation-delay: 4s;\n        }\n\n        .feature-icon {\n            width: 64px;\n            height: 64px;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FF4F4F 0%, #FF4F4F 100%);\n            border-radius: 16px;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n            box-shadow:\n                0 0 10px rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.6),\n                0 0 20px rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.4),\n                inset 0 0 8px rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.3);\n        }\n\n        .tech-spec-card {\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 20, 40, 0.8) 0%, rgba(30, 0, 50, 0.8) 100%);\n            border: 2px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.4);\n            box-shadow:\n                0 0 10px rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.3),\n                0 0 20px rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.2);\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\n        }\n\n        .tech-spec-card:hover {\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 30, 50, 0.9) 0%, rgba(40, 0, 60, 0.9) 100%);\n            border-color: rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.6);\n            box-shadow:\n                0 0 15px rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.5),\n                0 0 30px rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.4),\n                0 0 45px rgba(191, 0, 255, 0.3);\n            transform: translateY(-4px);\n        }\n\n        .gold-accent {\n            color: #00ffff;\n        }\n\n        .gold-border {\n            border-color: #ff00ff;\n        }\n\n        /* Neon Effects - Static (No Glow Animation) */\n\n        /* Neon Text */\n        .led-glow-text {\n            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n            -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;\n            text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;\n        }\n\n        /* For gradient text headings, use filter drop-shadow (better for bg-clip-text) */\n        h1.led-glow-text,\n        h2.led-glow-text,\n        h3.led-glow-text {\n            filter: drop-shadow(0 0 2px rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.6)) drop-shadow(0 0 4px rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.4));\n        }\n\n        /* For other text, use subtle text-shadow */\n        .led-glow-text:not(h1):not(h2):not(h3) {\n            text-shadow:\n                0 0 5px rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.6),\n                0 0 10px rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.4);\n        }\n\n        /* Neon Buttons - Static */\n        .led-glow-button {\n            position: relative;\n            box-shadow:\n                0 0 15px rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.5),\n                0 0 30px rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.3);\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n        }\n\n        .led-glow-button:hover {\n            box-shadow:\n                0 0 20px rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.7),\n                0 0 40px rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.5),\n                0 0 60px rgba(191, 0, 255, 0.3);\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n        }\n\n        /* Neon Borders - Static */\n        .led-glow-border {\n            border-color: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.6);\n            border-width: 2px;\n            box-shadow:\n                0 0 10px rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.4),\n                inset 0 0 10px rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.2);\n        }\n\n        /* Neon Cards - Static */\n        .led-glow-card {\n            box-shadow:\n                0 0 10px rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.3),\n                0 0 20px rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.2);\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n        }\n\n        .led-glow-card:hover {\n            box-shadow:\n                0 0 15px rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.5),\n                0 0 30px rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.4),\n                0 0 45px rgba(191, 0, 255, 0.3);\n            transform: translateY(-5px);\n        }\n\n        /* Neon Icons - Static */\n        .led-glow-icon {\n            box-shadow:\n                0 0 10px rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.6),\n                inset 0 0 8px rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.3);\n        }\n\n        /* Animated gradient text with glow */\n        .animated-gradient-text {\n            background-size: 200% auto;\n            animation: gradient-text 3s ease infinite;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes gradient-text {\n\n            0%,\n            100% {\n                background-position: 0% 50%;\n            }\n\n            50% {\n                background-position: 100% 50%;\n            }\n        }\n\n        /* Carousel Styles */\n        .carousel-container {\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .carousel-slides {\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        .carousel-slide {\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            opacity: 0;\n            transition: opacity 0.5s ease-in-out;\n        }\n\n        .carousel-slide.active {\n            opacity: 1;\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .carousel-slide img {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            object-fit: cover;\n        }\n\n        .carousel-indicator.active {\n            background: #00ffff;\n            border-color: #00ffff;\n            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.6);\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"bg-gray-900/80 backdrop-blur-sm\">\n    <div id=\"nav-placeholder\"></div>\n\n    <main>\n        <!-- Hero Section -->\n        <section class=\"relative h-screen flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden\">\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0\">\n                <img src=\"../../assets/video/vogue/vogue-hero.webp\" alt=\"Vogue Video Booth\"\n                    class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/50\"></div>\n            <div\n                class=\"absolute top-20 left-10 w-64 h-64 sm:w-96 sm:h-96 bg-cyan-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl animate-blob\">\n            </div>\n            <div\n                class=\"absolute bottom-20 right-10 w-64 h-64 sm:w-96 sm:h-96 bg-[#FF4F4F]/10 rounded-full blur-3xl animate-blob animation-delay-2000\">\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"mt-4 z-10 container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 pt-12 sm:pt-20\">\n                <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto text-center\">\n                    <!-- Badge -->\n                    <div\n                        class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3 px-4 sm:px-6 py-2 bg-[#FF4F4F] rounded-full shadow-lg mb-6 sm:mb-8\">\n                        <div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-white rounded-full animate-pulse\"></div>\n                        <span\n                            class=\"text-white text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase\">Studio-Quality\n                            Photography</span>\n                        <div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-white rounded-full animate-pulse\" style=\"animation-delay: 0.5s;\">\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h1\n                        class=\"hero-title text-5xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl font-black mb-6 leading-[1.1] tracking-tight\">\n                        <span class=\"font-light text-[#FF4F4F] led-glow-text\">\n                            VOGUE\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"block text-[#18F1E1] led-glow-text mt-2\">\n                            PHOTO BOOTH\n                        </span>\n                    </h1>\n\n                    <h2\n                        class=\"hero-subtitle text-base sm:text-lg md:text-xl lg:text-2xl font-semibold mb-6 sm:mb-8 text-white drop-shadow-xl led-glow-text px-4\">\n                        STUDIO-QUALITY HEADSHOTS, ON-SITE AND EFFORTLESS\n                    </h2>\n\n                    <!-- Description -->\n                    <div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-6 sm:mb-8 px-4\">\n                        <p\n                            class=\"text-base sm:text-lg md:text-xl lg:text-2xl leading-relaxed text-white/95 font-light tracking-wide drop-shadow-lg\">\n                            Experience the luxury of professional-grade photography with our Vogue Video Booth.\n                            Featuring perfect lighting, DSLR cameras, and a stunning LED portal, we bring the studio to\n                            you for flawless headshots and videos.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- CTA Buttons -->\n                    <div\n                        class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 sm:gap-4 md:gap-6 justify-center items-center px-4 mb-4 sm:mb-0\">\n                        <a href=\"../contact-us.html\"\n                            class=\"group relative inline-flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3 bg-[#FF4F4F] text-white px-6 sm:px-10 py-3 sm:py-5 rounded-full text-base sm:text-lg font-bold led-glow-button overflow-hidden w-full sm:w-auto justify-center\">\n                            <span class=\"relative z-10\">Get Your Quote</span>\n                            <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 sm:w-5 sm:h-5 relative z-10 transform group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\"\n                                fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"\n                                    d=\"M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6\" />\n                            </svg>\n                        </a>\n                        <button type=\"button\" data-click-to-call data-call-text=\"Call Us\"\n                            class=\"group inline-flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3 px-6 sm:px-10 py-3 sm:py-5 rounded-full text-base sm:text-lg font-bold backdrop-blur-md bg-gray-900/80 backdrop-blur-sm/10 border-2 led-glow-border hover:bg-gray-900/80 backdrop-blur-sm/20 shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-500 transform hover:scale-110 hover:-translate-y-1 text-white w-full sm:w-auto justify-center cursor-pointer\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 sm:w-5 sm:h-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"\n                                viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\n                                    d=\"M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498A1 1 0 0121 17.72V21a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 23 3 16.284 3 8V7a2 2 0 012-2z\" />\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Call Us</span>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Trust Indicators -->\n                    <div\n                        class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3 sm:gap-4 md:gap-8 mt-6 sm:mt-8 md:mt-12 text-white/70 px-4 text-xs sm:text-sm\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-cyan-400 rounded-full\"></div>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium\">Professional DSLR Cameras</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-[#18F1E1] rounded-full\"></div>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium\">Perfect Lighting Setup</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-white rounded-full\"></div>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium\">Instant Digital Delivery</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Main Description Section -->\n        <section class=\"section-padding bg-[#1F1F1F]\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\">\n                <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto\">\n                    <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-5 gap-6 sm:gap-8 md:gap-12 items-start mb-12 sm:mb-16 md:mb-20\">\n                        <div class=\"md:col-span-2 md:-ml-10\">\n                            <h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-light mb-4 sm:mb-6 text-[#18F1E1] led-glow-text\"\n                                style=\"font-family: \'AzoSansUber\', sans-serif;\">\n                                The Ultimate Professional Photography Experience\n                            </h2>\n                            <p class=\"text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-300 mb-4 sm:mb-6 leading-relaxed\"\n                                style=\"font-family: \'AzoSans\', sans-serif;\">\n                                Step into our stunning LED-lit Vogue portal and experience studio-quality photography at\n                                your event. With professional DSLR cameras, perfect lighting, and a reflective floor\n                                setup, every shot is Instagram-worthy.\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-300 mb-4 sm:mb-6 leading-relaxed\"\n                                style=\"font-family: \'AzoSans\', sans-serif;\">\n                                Whether you\'re capturing executive headshots at a corporate event, glamorous portraits\n                                at a gala, or professional photos at a conference, the Vogue Video Booth delivers\n                                consistently stunning results.\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-300 leading-relaxed\"\n                                style=\"font-family: \'AzoSans\', sans-serif;\">\n                                Customize the experience with multiple light modes, color options, and built-in beauty\n                                lighting that makes everyone look their absolute best. Your guests will feel like\n                                celebrities with this red-carpet experience.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div\n                            class=\"md:col-span-3 relative rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border-2 border-cyan-400/40 led-glow-border mt-6 md:mt-0\">\n                            <!-- Carousel Container -->\n                            <div class=\"carousel-container relative aspect-[4/3] w-full\">\n                                <!-- Carousel Slides -->\n                                <div class=\"carousel-slides relative h-full\">\n                                    <div class=\"carousel-slide active\">\n                                        <img src=\"../../assets/video/vogue/vogue-1.webp\" alt=\"Vogue Video Booth\"\n                                            class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\">\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"carousel-slide\">\n                                        <img src=\"../../assets/video/vogue/vogue-2.webp\" alt=\"Vogue Video Booth\"\n                                            class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\">\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"carousel-slide\">\n                                        <img src=\"../../assets/video/vogue/vogue-hero.webp\" alt=\"Vogue Video Booth\"\n                                            class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\">\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n\n                                <!-- Navigation Buttons -->\n                                <button\n                                    class=\"carousel-prev absolute left-2 sm:left-4 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-10 bg-gray-900/80 backdrop-blur-sm border-2 border-cyan-400/50 hover:border-cyan-400 rounded-full p-2 sm:p-3 text-cyan-300 hover:text-white transition-all duration-300 led-glow-button\"\n                                    aria-label=\"Previous image\">\n                                    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 sm:w-6 sm:h-6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\"\n                                        viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                        <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"\n                                            d=\"M15 19l-7-7 7-7\" />\n                                    </svg>\n                                </button>\n                                <button\n                                    class=\"carousel-next absolute right-2 sm:right-4 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-10 bg-gray-900/80 backdrop-blur-sm border-2 border-cyan-400/50 hover:border-cyan-400 rounded-full p-2 sm:p-3 text-cyan-300 hover:text-white transition-all duration-300 led-glow-button\"\n                                    aria-label=\"Next image\">\n                                    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 sm:w-6 sm:h-6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\"\n                                        viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                        <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"\n                                            d=\"M9 5l7 7-7 7\" />\n                                    </svg>\n                                </button>\n\n                                <!-- Indicators -->\n                                <div class=\"absolute bottom-4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-10 flex gap-2\">\n                                    <button\n                                        class=\"carousel-indicator active w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-cyan-400 border border-cyan-300 transition-all duration-300\"\n                                        aria-label=\"Slide 1\"></button>\n                                    <button\n                                        class=\"carousel-indicator w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-gray-600 border border-gray-500 hover:bg-cyan-400/50 transition-all duration-300\"\n                                        aria-label=\"Slide 2\"></button>\n                                    <button\n                                        class=\"carousel-indicator w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-gray-600 border border-gray-500 hover:bg-cyan-400/50 transition-all duration-300\"\n                                        aria-label=\"Slide 3\"></button>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Features Grid -->\n                    <div\n                        class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 sm:gap-6 md:gap-8 mt-12 sm:mt-16 md:mt-20\">\n                        <div\n                            class=\"text-center p-4 sm:p-6 md:p-8 rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-900/50 to-white/50 border border-cyan-400/30 led-glow-card\">\n                            <div class=\"feature-icon mx-auto\">\n                                <svg class=\"w-8 h-8 text-white-300\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\"\n                                    viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                    <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"\n                                        d=\"M3 9a2 2 0 012-2h.93a2 2 0 001.664-.89l.812-1.22A2 2 0 0110.07 4h3.86a2 2 0 011.664.89l.812 1.22A2 2 0 0018.07 7H19a2 2 0 012 2v9a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V9z\">\n                                    </path>\n                                    <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"\n                                        d=\"M15 13a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z\"></path>\n                                </svg>\n                            </div>\n                            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-white\" style=\"font-family: \'AzoSans\', sans-serif;\">\n                                Professional DSLR Cameras</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-gray-300\" style=\"font-family: \'AzoSans\', sans-serif;\">High-resolution cameras\n                                that capture every detail with clarity</p>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div\n                            class=\"text-center p-8 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-900/50 to-white/50 border border-cyan-400/30 led-glow-card\">\n                            <div class=\"feature-icon mx-auto\">\n                                <svg class=\"w-8 h-8 text-white-300\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\"\n                                    viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                    <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"\n                                        d=\"M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-